<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Uown Thawp</para>
  <para style="toc1">Uown Thawp</para>
  <para style="toc2">Uown Thawp</para>
  <para style="mt1">Uown Thawp</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow Mosi chekhai, now arui khin dow 1,445-1,405 <char style="w">BC</char> takra kowi chekhai. Mami bowih dow Mosi ruiah mih tanga klüng mih bowih kowi kowh palawmbawr mih chekhai. Baibul chimsai kowi kowh rik khüa mih bowih dow mami Uown Thawp bowih chekhai. Mami bowih Mosi ruila mih dow amatni chenchap kowh chownglawng lawnguan natukla reng kownkow amatni Israeluüa vüi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi arui uowi mih dow lusa hai alak kowi kowh uowi mih matiow kowi Thurai uown thawpah mih lawnguan chekhai. Nami klen kowi masiuüa hown kachakuüa tachawng talang mih, Thurai pur kowi tawng iawng chow lusa maru chang ngak mih hai palusama kowi tawng iawng chow lusa maru krawi tauet mih lawnguan paw arui uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Uown Thawp bowih auown hownia 11 lawng mowr kowi arui uowi mih dow lusa hai alak kowi kowh uowi mih matiow kowi Thurai thawpah mih lawnguan chekhai, now 12 hownia 50 lawng mowr kowi arui uowi mih dow Israel chenchapuüa uown uowi mih hai amatni kowh chownglawng lawnguan chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih hailawm Mosi ruiah mih tanga klüng mih bowih kowi dow ari arow bowih pahai Hebraiuüa tek pe khai.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Phuchua: Phuchua pami dow tawncher mih ngenah hanow anga maih kowi tikah mih hown Thurai kowi tüng pe ringkawra mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Khampha uanpik: Khampha uanpik pami dow kachakuüa kowh siri pik chekhai. Alai kowh Israeluüa dow Thurai hown tatow sangbowk laitawm mih amat müa kachakuüa chah maten ranit ni chi now hiata khampha uanpik reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Sangbowk laitawm: Sangbowk laitawm pami dow maru pre ia takham mih chekhai. Sangbowk laitawm dow laikham hown tatu chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Krungchak: Baibul kowi kowh krungchak pami alai kowh Israeluüa chowng khe dow Jakawb kowh chauüa laipre ia mih hownia kowh uang taprek miuüa kowi kowh tek pe mih chekhai. Naiawngün dow Juda krungchak, Levi krungchak, Dan krungchak, Naptali krungchak hai Aser krungchak ün chekhai. Now tawngbak khe dow chen hai chenchap pahai paw tekah khai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Machak: Machak pami alai kowh Israeluüa chowng khe dow krungchak hownia kowh taprek miuüa kowi aluchowuüa kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai. Naiawngün dow Levi krungchak kowi kowh Arawn machak ün chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Lusa hai alak kowi kowh uanh thawp lawnguan 1:1-2:25</para>
  <para style="io1">Angak hai ngarera uang uown ting mih lawnguan 3:1-24</para>
  <para style="io1">Adam hownia Noa 4:1-5:32</para>
  <para style="io1">Noa hai tuikling mangma 6:1-10:32</para>
  <para style="io1">Abraham kowh chownglawng 11:1-25:18</para>
  <para style="io1">Babel kimkrowng 11:1-9</para>
  <para style="io1">Sem hownia Abraham 11:10-32</para>
  <para style="io1">Abraham, Isak hai Jakawb 12:1-35:29</para>
  <para style="io1">Esau krungchakuüa 36:1-43</para>
  <para style="io1">Josef hai atainau-uüa 37:1-45:28</para>
  <para style="io1">Aigupta pren kowi Israeluüa 46:1-50:26</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GEN 1" />
  <para style="s">Uanh thawp lawnguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 1:1" />Auown khe Thurai mih mukuang hai lusa thawpah khai. <verse eid="GEN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 1:2" />Nami khin khe dow lusa mih akhaw aklaima; apowm paw uowi dowi tak chekhai, now tui abüpma mih luk kowi aiiu kangowh chekhai. Thurai Lümla dow nami tui luk kowi krawi len reng chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 1:3" />Thurai tek mih, “Panowi lah,” pakhai. Now anowi dow uang uowi khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 1:4" />Nami anowi dow aia mü hanow aia tut-e aiungma chekhai. Thurai dow nowi hai iiu kowi lang kraah khai. <verse eid="GEN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 1:5" />Thurai mih nowi kowi dow ni pahai chap pe ming khai, now iiu kowi dow uar pahai chap pe ming khai. Now ni paw kowi khai, uar paw kowi khai bowt; nami dow pani mih chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 1:6" />Thurai tek mih, “Tui takra kowi akuangma pauowi lah, now tui mih dow pre bak pacham phaw lah,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 1:7" />Naiawng hown Thurai mih akuangma mih thawp pe hanow aluk pra kowh uowi kown mih tui hai adak pra kowh uowi kown mih tui kowi lang kraah khai. Naiawng rakowi pabak mih tui dow akuangma mih luk kowi uowi khai, now pabak mih tui dow akuangma mih dak kowi uowi khai. <verse eid="GEN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 1:8" />Thurai dow akuangma aia thawpah mih kowi mukuang pahai chap pe ming khai. Naiawng hai ni paw kowi khai, uar paw kowi khai iawk; nami dow pre ni mih chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 1:9" />Nami kung kowi Thurai tek mih, “Kuang dak kowi kowh tui uowi mih maten arasang pacham uowi lah, now süng akangma mih pauang tatüng lah,” pakhai. Now nami powm iawng dow uang uowi khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 1:10" />Thurai mih nami süng akangma mih kowi krawng pahai chap pe ming khai, now arasang uowi mih tui kowi dow sata pahai chap pe ming khai. Nami dow aia mü hanow aia tut-e aiungma chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 1:11" />Nami kung kowi Thurai tek mih, “Krawng hownia pramna chap maten paawr ru lah; cha ün, uih mih chap ün chowlowkkow liu uowi mih chap maten pauang uowi lah,” pakhai. Now nami powm iawng dow uang uowi khai. <verse eid="GEN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 1:12" />Krawng hownia dow cha ün, pramna ün, uih mih chap ün chowlowkkow liu uowi mih chap maten uang uowi khai bowt. Naiawngün dow aia mü hanow aia tut-e aiungma chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 1:13" />Naiawng hai ni paw kowi khai, uar paw kowi khai iawk; nami dow sum ni mih chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 1:14" />Nami kung kowi Thurai tek mih, “Anowi uowi mih chap maten kuang kowi pauang tatüng lah; naiawngün dow ni hai uar kowi pacham kraah lah. Nami dow pawi khin mat müa ün, ni hai ning klowk müa ün pacham chowng lah. <verse eid="GEN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 1:15" />Naiawngün dow kuang hownia lusa krawng luk kowi pauang iu nowi lah,” pakhai. Now naiawng dow uang phaw khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 1:16" />Thurai mih anowi kraingma mih pre buk thawpah khai. Nami pre buk kowi lang nowi rowt mih dow ni-e nachang alow kownkow, now anowi lang e rowtchow mih dow uar-e nachang alow kownkow aia thawpah mih chekhai. Nami klen kowi krek ün paw aia thawpla khai. <verse eid="GEN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 1:17" />Naiawngün dow lusa krawng luk kowi nauang iiu nowila kownkow kuang kowi aia towah khai. <verse eid="GEN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 1:18" />Naiawngün dow ni-e hai uar-e nachang alow kownkow hai anowi hai aiiu kowi nakrala kownkow kuang kowi aia towah mih chekhai. Naiawngün dow aia mü hanow aia tut-e aiungma chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 1:19" />Naiawng hai ni paw kowi khai, uar paw kowi khai iawk; nami dow tali ni mih chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 1:20" />Nami kung kowi Thurai tek mih, “Tui dawng kowi asak uowi mih chap ahuma pacham uowi lah, now kuang dawng kowi dow uakling uaber achap akawmma pacham iow lah,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 1:21" />Naiawng hai Thurai mih sata kowi asak uowi mih chap aiukma mih ün thawpah khai. Now tui dawng kowi kowh tahawm lawmlawm se krawi mang iualua mih chap paw achap ahuma aia thawpla khai. Nami klen kowi uakling uaber paw achap ahuma aia thawpah khai. Naiawngün dow chowlowkkow chap naprungla kown mih kür uowi bowk chekhai. Naiawngün dow aia mü hanow aia tut-e aiungma chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 1:22" />Now Thurai mih naiawngünuüa kowi maiawng peah <char style="w">prasi</char> khai, “Naprung nasela kown mih kür uowi powm iawng dow chowlowkkow chap mih prung büah se büa diah; sata tui dawng kowi atekma uowi büa diah. Krawng luk kowi kowh uakling uaber hawmh paw chowlowkkow chap iawng paprung pase lah,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 1:23" />Naiawng hai ni paw kowi khai, uar paw kowi khai iawk; nami dow tanga ni mih chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 1:24" />Nami kung kowi Thurai tek mih, “Krawng hownia tawncher ün, kaurawng uaramchak ün, kam hai sowr mih ün pacham uang phaw lah,” pakhai. Now nami powm iawng dow uang phaw khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 1:25" />Thurai mih kaurawng uaramchak ün, tawncher ün, kam hai sowr mih ün achap kawm thawpah khai. Naiawngün dow chowlowkkow chap naprungla kown mih kür uowi bowk chekhai. Naiawngün dow aia mü hanow aia tut-e aiungma chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rik thawpah mih maru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 1:26" />Nami kung kowi Thurai tek mih, “A-i iawng, a-i hown tatu iawng kawmat dow i thawp maru diah sik. Amatni dow sata kowi kowh dam luk kowi ün, kuang kowi kowh uakling uaber luk kowi ün, tawncher luk kowi ün, asadua maten hai lusa kowi kowh uowi mih matiow luk kowi pacham chang alow lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 1:27" />Thurai dow aia powm iawng thawp maru khai bowt. Aia dow aiamat powm iawng maru kowi thawpah khai; aia dow kachakuüa hai masiuüa kowi thawpah khai. <verse eid="GEN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 1:28" />Now Thurai mih amatchi kowi dow peah prasi khai. Thurai tek pe mih, “Enchi mih prungla sela mih kür hown atekma uowi iüah hanow lusa kowi ahuma uang prung uang se iüa diah. Lusa dow enni matia low iawng towah büa diah. Nami klen kowi sata kowi kowh dam luk kowi ün, kuang kowi kowh uakling uaber luk kowi ün, now krawng luk kowi kowh asak uowi mih chap maten luk kowi chang low büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 1:29" />Nami kung kowi Thurai tek mih, “Sünta, lusa krawng luk kowi kowh pramna hai uih-ak kowi chowlowkkow aliu uowi mih maten ang peta enni khowk; naiawngün dow enni kowh chakkham naown kown. <verse eid="GEN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 1:30" />Nachenganchepaw lusa kowi kowh asak uowi mih maten, asadua ün, uakling uaber ün, kam hai sowr mih nachangla chakkham kownkow pramna dow ang peta khowk,” pakhai. Now nami powm iawng uang own khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 1:31" />Thurai mih aia uanh thawp maten müah khai; naiawngün dow lainowmma aia tut-e iung khai. Naiawng hai ni paw kowi khai, uar paw kowi khai iawk; nami dow taruk ni mih chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GEN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 2:1" />Naiawng hown mukuang hai lusa lak kowi kowh uowi mih maten dow ki thawpta khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 2:2" />Thurai mih aia uanh thawp maten taruk ni mih ni khe ki thawpta khai; ranit ni mih ni kowi dow aia tanai khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 2:3" />Ranit ni mih ni kowi dow aia tanai khai rakowi nami ni kowi dow peah prasi hanow aia vüi kowi chimsaima towah khai.<verse eid="GEN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 2:4" />Mami dow Thurai thawp lusa hai mukuang khe kowh lawnguan laiklow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="GEN 2:4">Eden krum kowi kowh maru</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:4">CHAKRAMANG Thurai thawp lusa hai mukuang mih khin khe dow <verse eid="GEN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 2:5" />krawng luk kowi mih cha ün, pramna ün, uih mih chap ün tawngpaw awr ru dowi tak. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih lusa kowi uang kowi pe uangah dowi tak chekhai. Nami klen kowi chang üa chang laih mih maru paw uowi dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 2:6" />Nachenganchepaw krawng hownia asi uang lawt reng rakowi krawng dow sik kleplep reng. <verse eid="GEN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 2:7" />Now CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih krawng kowi kowh dinchow pawah hanow thawp maru khai. Aia dow nami maru kowh nakawng kowi chua pe masing kawli khai, now nami maru dow uang sing khai.<verse eid="GEN 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 2:8" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih satlawt pra kowh Eden pape mih pren kowi thawp krum lowk khai. Now aia thawpah mih maru kowi nami krum lak kowi aia towah khai. <verse eid="GEN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 2:9" />Nami krum kowi dow klangiungma mih singh maten awr pe ruah khai, naiawngün singh uih dow achak paw iungma chekhai. Nami klen kowi krum dawnglang kowi “Masing singh” hai “Aiung <char style="w">angak</char> tukla mih singh” pape mih pre singh paw aia awr pe ruah khai.<verse eid="GEN 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 2:10" />Nami krum mih naka tui reng kownkow Eden hownia aw uang hawr lowk. Now nami aw mih uang taprek hanow aw uang chowng tali klüng chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 2:11" />Alowk mih aw ming dow Pisawn. Nami dow Havila pren kowi kowhawr khai. Nakowi dow kuh uowi reng. <verse eid="GEN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 2:12" />Nami pren kowi kowh kuh dow achangma chekhai. Nami klen kowi nam iungma mih singh pun hai “Oniks” maiak paw nakowi dow uowi reng. <verse eid="GEN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 2:13" />Alowk mih aw ming dow Gihawn chekhai. Nami aw dow Ethiawpia pren kowi kowhawr khai. <verse eid="GEN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 2:14" />Alowk mih aw ming dow Hidikel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hidikel aw </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow Taigris aw chekhai. Nami aw dow Irag, Iran, Turki hai Siria pren takra kowi uowi mih chekhai.</char></note> chekhai. Nami aw dow Asuria pren satlawt prakowi kowhawr khai. Now alowk mih aw ming dow Iufratis chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 2:15" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih nami maru kowi dow Eden krum kowi towah khai. Nami maru kowi dow nami krum kowi nachang lup kownkow hai naming nakhet kownkow aia towah mih chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 2:16" />Now nami maru kowi CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek pe mih, “Mami krum kowi kowh singh uih uowi mih maten en nau mih en naia cha kown. <verse eid="GEN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 2:17" />Tawkche aiung <char style="w">angak</char> tukla mih singh uih tarapdow en nacha kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami uih dow en cha hanow en cha mih ni khe en nakowng ngengche kown chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rik thawpah mih masiuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18-20" style="v" sid="GEN 2:18-20" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih bawn hown kowh thawpah mih kuang kowi kowh uakling uaber hai krawng luk kowi kowh asak uowi mih maten Adam tut-e uang pawla pe khai. Naiawngün kowi dow Adam pacham chap pe ming lah pakowh CHAKRAMANG uang pawla pe mih chekhai. Naiawngün asak uowi mih chap maten dow Adam hawah powm iawng ming uang hing phaw rowp khai. Adam mih tawncher hai kaurawng uaramchak ün, uakling uaber ün kowi chap pe ming khai. Nachenganchepaw naiawngün pungmadawng kowi aia vüi dow lahawm taka mih chumphak uowi dowi tak chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 2:18-20">CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, “Nami maru aia malowkchow uowi mih iung dowi lownow. Aia vüi lahawm taka mih auiua ang thawp pe lowk ia tak,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 2:18-20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 2:21" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih Adam kowi müi rau adikma uang pe phawah hanow Adam dow müi khai. Nami khin khe aia dow Adam kowh betrammow hut pawah lowk khai, now alawi dow plan plimla pe khai iawk. <verse eid="GEN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 2:22" />Adam hownia kowh pawah mih betrammow hut hown dow CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih thawpla masiuüa lowk ia hanow Adam tut-e kowpawla pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 2:23" />Nami masiuüa kowi khita hanow Adam tek mih, “Ah, khaleng tak kowh iung mih! Aia kowh hut hai nga dow ang hut ang nga hown kowh thawpah mih chekhai. Aia kowi dow kachakuüa hownia kowh thawpah mih chekhai rakowi masiuüa napape kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 2:24" />Naiawng rakowi kachakuüa mih towla u-pa hüah hanow masi hown nataiua uowi kown, now amatchi pre ia dow abuk anga sang naown kown. <verse eid="GEN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 2:25" />Nami khin khe Adam hai amasi iüah mih tengiow tengklaima reng tak. Nachenganchepaw amatchi mih tawngpaw rukrai dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GEN 3" />
  <para style="s">Angak uown</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 3:1" />Krawng luk kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai thawpah mih kaurawng uaramchak maten kowi lang puanla mih dow rua chekhai. Akat khe masiuüa kowi nami rua lüntaah mih, “Krum kowi kowh singh uih maten hangkow cha iüah pami CHAKRAMANG tek enchi nowm bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 3:2" />Nakhowk khe masiuüa tek pe rua mih, “Krum kowi kowh singh uih uowi mih maten angching nowngia cha chowh. <verse eid="GEN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 3:3" />Nachenganchepaw krum dawnglang kowi kowh uowi mih singh uih lawnguan kowi Thurai tek angching mih, ‘Nami uih cha paw hangkow cha iüah, kak paw hangkow kak iüah. Nami che enchi chang hanow enchi nakowng kown,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 3:4" />Nachenganchepaw rua tek pe masiuüa mih, “Kowng dowi iowh, mapaw enchi kowng kown nadowi. <verse eid="GEN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 3:5" />Nami singh uih enchi cha mih ni khe enchi kowh mik nathowi hanow aiung angak tukra enchi ka kown towbowt; nahanow Thurai iawng enchi naphaw kown towbowt pami Thurai tuk. Naiawng rakowi nami singh uih Thurai pe cha enchi dowi mih chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 3:6" />Nami masiuüa dow singh prakowi awr tau khai, now singh uih dow apowm klangiungma mih khi hanow achak naiung kown mih ka tuak khai. Nami klen kowi aia dow naka <char style="w">chanlaira</char> kown mih paw tuk hanow lainowmma irh khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow nami singh uih awr lüngah pre sum buk hanow chata khai. Nami uih dow ahua kowi paw pela ne khai, now ahua paw tawi chata khai. <verse eid="GEN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 3:7" />Nami hown krowksang amatchi kowh mik dow thowi khai bowt, now amatchi dow tengiow tengklaima pami tatuk iüah khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi krawi klek uidut ram iüah hanow sownah iüah khai, now phumla siri iüah khai.<verse eid="GEN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 3:8" />Now sat kowi pra li klamchow uang mih khin khe dow CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih krum kowi uang krawi len khai. Nakhowk khe amatchi mih CHAKRAMANG uang krawi len mih klow ta hanow krum kowi kowh singh rüm dawng kowi tapet iüah khai. <verse eid="GEN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 3:9" />Nami khin khe kachakuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG Thurai hawah now tek pe mih, “Tawng kowi chow en?” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 3:10" />Adam klangah mih, “Krum kowi en uang mih klow ang ta chowdiah; nachepaw ang mih tengiow tengklaima chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ang kram kowh ang cham tapet khai,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 3:11" />Now CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek pe mih, “En tengiow tengklaima pami amia chow tek en? Ang hang en mih singh uih en chata khai bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 3:12" />Adam tek pe mih, “Ang vüi kowi kowh en pe ang mih masiuüa pe ang rakowi nami singh uih ang chata khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 3:13" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek pe masiuüa mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng en tuk chang khai?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 3:13">Masiuüa tek pe mih, “Paimi rua kuan ang rakowi nami uih mih ang chata khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai peah ripra mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 3:14" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek pe rua mih, “Naiawng mih lup en chang khai rakowi krawng luk kowi tawncher hai kaurawng uaramchak maten kowi en lang ka <char style="w">piati</char> khai bowt. En mih chownglawng prat krawng kowi sowr se namang bowt kown, now en kowh chakkham dow dinchow naown kown. <verse eid="GEN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 3:15" />En hai masiuüa hown, now en <char style="w">krungchak</char> hai masiuüa hownia kowh uang towm mih krungchak hown ang nathawpah ransu kown. Nami masiuüa krungchak hownia kowh lowk ia dow nadita en lu iawm kown, now en dow aia kowh klingnik kowi en nachawtah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 3:16" />Now CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek pe masiuüa mih, “En kum nau mih khin khe lainowmma ang nape ngare en kown; now arau dikma hown en napen cha reng kown. Nachenganchepaw hua kowi dow en nanau reng kown; tawkchedow aia mih en luk kowi nachang alow kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 3:17" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek pe Adam mih, “En masi laiklow en sünta rakowi ang hang en mih singh uih en chata khai. Naiawng kowh bawn dow en rakowi ka piati khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi chownglawng prat lainowmma en kawmah dowi matchang krawng kowi kowh luprak en naka cha kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="GEN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 3:18" />En ienah mih natawi em en kownkow krawng hownia mawh hai chuh ün ang nape ruah kown. Nachenganchepaw en ienah mih luprak chowtaih en naka cha bowt kown. <verse eid="GEN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 3:19" />Thawpla en mih bawn kowi en plan dowi mowr dow hawk pe ling tui dowi matchang en naka cha chakkham kown nadowi bowt. En kowi dow dinchow hown kowh thawp en mih chekhai rakowi dinchow kowi en naplan iawk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eden krum hownia prütta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 3:20" />Now Adam dow amasi kowi Evi pahai rük pe ming khai. (Evi pami dow “Sing uowi mih” pami chekhai). Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow sing uowi mih maru maten kowh u nauang chowng kown mih chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 3:21" />Now CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih Adam hai amasi Evi vüi chak pik hown thawp pe tawnguat khai, now amatchi kowi khup pe khai.<verse eid="GEN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 3:22" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, “Mü madiah, aiung angak tukla mih ka kowh maru paw a-i iawng uang tawi phaw khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi kawmat dow masing singh uih chata hanow chowngchowng saksakma nasingla iüah dowi kownkow achap dow a-i chang kown takla,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 3:23" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih bawn hown kowh thawpah mih maru kowi dow bawn luk kowi nachang lup kownkow Eden krum hownia lawtta khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 3:24" />Naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih Adam hai Evi iüah kowi krum hownia prütta khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 3:24">Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih masing singh pra kowh mangla mih tiama kowi tow pe kangchawng mih khai. Nami tiama dow Eden satlawt prakowi chekhai. Now kangchawng mih dow cherupuüa hai lün pluplup mih saidawng chekhai. Nami saidawng dow atungma hing taui hüah chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GEN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kain hai Abel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 4:1" />Adam mih amasi Evi hown taphua taiua hanow Evi mih kum nau khai bowt, now ka chapa iüah lowk ia khai. Nami khin khe Evi tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG khowng ang luk kowi ang ka kachakuüa chah lowk ia,” pakhai. Now achapa ming dow Kain pahai rük pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 4:2" />Nami kung kowi Kain naumow Abel paw uang dia khai. Abel dow ruapur thing mih chekhai, now Kain dow üa lup chang mih chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 4:3" />Akat khe Kain dow aia üa hownia kowh luprak uang pawla hanow CHAKRAMANG tut-e ap-ah khai. <verse eid="GEN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 4:4" />Now Abel dow aia kowh ruapur hawmh hownia rik pen mih kowi kowh kow lang iung mih ruapur chah uang pawla pre sum pum khai, now naiawngün ngenah hanow asau lang uowi mih nga CHAKRAMANG tut-e ap-ah khai. CHAKRAMANG mih Abel hai aia kowh <char style="w">uanap</char> kowi hawt awmrawm pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 4:5" />Nachenganchepaw Kain hai aia kowh uanap kowi dow hawt awmrawm pe dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Kain dow kunmarau kowh lumowr akhüp türma uowi khai. <verse eid="GEN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 4:6" />Nami khita hanow Kain kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow en tuk kunmarau khai? Tawngplawng kowchow lumowr akhüp türma en tuk uowi khai? <verse eid="GEN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 4:7" />En che chang lup iung e dow ang awmrawm en kown taih diah, now en paw naawmrawm kown taih diah. Nachenganchepaw en chang lup ngak khai rakowi angak mih en luk kowi chang alow kownkow hawt pawm en hüah chekhai. Tawkchedow nami angak kowi en nanowngta kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 4:8" />Akat khe anaumow Abel kowi Kain tek pe mih, “Chu, üa kowi achi kowkowi lah,” pakhai. Now Kain hai Abel iüah dow üa kowi kowkowi khai. Nami khin khe Kain mih anaumow Abel kowi amaisang bawpah now kowngta khai.<verse eid="GEN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 4:9" />Nakhowk khe Kain kowi CHAKRAMANG lüntaah mih, “En naumow Abel tawng kowi chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 4:9">Kain klangah mih, “Ang tuk dowi. Ang naumow kowi naming nakhet kown mih <char style="w">kurdik</char> ang luk kowi nadowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 4:10" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng en tuk chang khai? Mü madiah, en naumow kowh vi mih napaw lu klai kownkow krawng hownia ang tut-e uang awr kar khai. <verse eid="GEN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 4:11" />En naumow kowh vi mih krawng kowi en hawkah khai. Naiawng rakowi krawng luk kowi mih en ka piati khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 4:12" />Krawng luk kowi en chang üa chang lai mih khin khe krawng mih alai kowh iawng ahuma nape en luprak kown nadowi bowt. En mih naram hanow lusa kowi nacham mang panglang kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 4:13" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowi Kain tek pe mih, “Mami <char style="w">ripra</char> dow ang nowng kham dowi mowr chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 4:14" />Mü madiah, ang kim üa hownia en prütta ang khai bowt, now en hownia alakma kowi ang nauowi bowt kown. Naiawng rakowi lusa kowi ang cham mang panglang mih khin khe lowra maru khi ang mih dow napawta ang asak kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 4:15" />Now Kain kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Naiawng chekhai now paw en asak mih maru kowi ranit dungna ang napaw pe lu klai kown,” pakhai. Now maru krumah chepaw miapaw nasaiah dowi kownkow Kain buk kowi CHAKRAMANG mih tow pe amatra lowk khai. <verse eid="GEN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 4:16" />Naiawng rakowi Kain dow CHAKRAMANG pur hownia powt hanow Eden satlawt pra kowh Nawd pape mih pren kowi kowuowi khai.<verse eid="GEN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kain chuprek chaprek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 4:17" />Nami kung kowi dow Kain mih amasi hown taphua taiua hanow amasi mih kum nau khai, now ka kachakuüa chah iüah lowk ia khai. Achapa ming dow Enawk pahai rük pe iüah khai. Kain mih thawp marow lowk hanow aming dow achapa ming iawng Enawk pahai rük pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 4:18" />Enawk kowh chapa dow Irad; Irad kowh chapa dow Mehujael; Mehujael kowh chapa dow Methusael, now Methusael kowh chapa dow Lamek chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 4:19" />Lamek kowh dow masi uowi pre ma. Lowk mih ming dow Ada, now alowk mih ming dow Zila chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 4:20" />Ada dow kum nau hanow ka kachakuüa chah lowk ia khai. Achapa ming dow Jabal pahai aia rük pe khai. Jabal krungchakuüa dow <char style="w">tangbung</char> kowi kowh uowi mih hai tawncher tawn miuüa chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 4:21" />Jabal kowh naumow ming dow Jubal chekhai. Jubal krungchakuüa dow taraw tep mih hai prui tum miuüa chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 4:22" />Zila paw kum nau hanow ka kachakuüa chah lowk ia khai. Achapa ming dow Tubal-kain pahai rük pe khai. Tubal-kain dow kri hai lawngha hown kowh <char style="w">rutchün khawkleng</char> chap matiow thawp mih chekhai. Tubal-kain kowh tuamow ming dow Naima chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 4:23" />Akat khe amasi pre ia kowi Lamek tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">“Ada hai Zila, ang laiklow sünta iüa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:23">Lamek masi iüah low, ang laiklow kowi pe ching iüa diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 4:23">Klanguüa lowk ia mih pe ang ngarau khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:23">nami klanguüa kowi mih ang saita khai.<verse eid="GEN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 4:24" />Kain kowi sai mih lu klai che ranit dungna paw pe hanow</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 4:24">Lamek kowi sai mih lu klai ngam padow ranitkawmkla ranit dungna napaw pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Set hai Enus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 4:25" />Nami kung kowi dow Adam mih amasi hown taphua taiua khai iawk. Now amasi mih kum nau hanow plan ka kachakuüa chah lowk ia khai. Nami khin khe Evi tek mih, “Abel kowi Kain saita khai rakowi Thurai mih Abel takcha kowi uang plan pe ang kachakuüa chah lowk ia iawk mih chekhai,” pakhai. Evi mih achapa ming Set pahai rük pe khai.<verse eid="GEN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 4:26" />Nami kung kowi Set mih ka chapa lowk ia khai. Achapa ming dow Enus pahai aia rük pe khai. Nami khin hownia dow maru-uüa mih CHAKRAMANG kowi uown chupiia khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 4:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GEN 5" />
  <para style="s">Adam krungchak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 5:1" />Mami dow Adam krungchak lawnguan chekhai. Thurai thawp maru mih khin khe aia kowi dow aiamat powm iawng thawpah khai. <verse eid="GEN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 5:2" />Thurai mih kachakuüa hai masiuüa kowi thawpah khai, now peah prasi khai. Thurai thawpah mih khin khe amatchi kowi mih maru pahai Thurai chap pe ming khai.<verse eid="GEN 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 5:3" />Adam mih 130 ning chih khe ka kachakuüa chah lowk ia iawk. Achapa dow aia hown tatu khai, now achapa dow aia powm iawng chekhai. Achapa ming dow Set chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 5:4" />Set uang dia kung kowi paw Adam mih singla 800 ning tak. Nami takra kowi paw aia dow kala chah küng tak chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 5:5" />Now 930 ning chih now Adam dow kowng khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 5:6" />Set dow 105 ning chih khe ka chah khai. Achapa ming dow Enus. <verse eid="GEN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 5:7" />Enus uang dia kung kowi paw aia dow singla 807 ning tak. Nami takra kowi paw aia dow kala chah küng tak chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 5:8" />Now 912 ning chih now Set dow kowng khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 5:9" />Enus dow 90 ning chih khe ka chah khai. Achapa ming dow Kenan. <verse eid="GEN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 5:10" />Kenan uang dia kung kowi paw aia dow singla 815 ning tak. Nami takra kowi paw aia dow kala chah küng tak chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 5:11" />Now 905 ning chih now Enus dow kowng khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 5:12" />Kenan dow 70 ning chih khe ka chah khai. Achapa ming dow Mahalalel. <verse eid="GEN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 5:13" />Mahalalel uang dia kung kowi paw aia dow singla 840 ning tak. Nami takra kowi paw aia dow kala chah küng tak chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 5:14" />Now 910 ning chih now Kenan dow kowng khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 5:15" />Mahalalel dow 65 ning chih khe ka chah khai. Achapa ming dow Jared. <verse eid="GEN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 5:16" />Jared uang dia kung kowi paw aia dow singla 830 ning tak. Nami takra kowi paw aia dow kala chah küng tak chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 5:17" />Now 895 ning chih now Mahalalel dow kowng khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 5:18" />Jared dow 162 ning chih khe ka chah khai. Achapa ming dow Enawk. <verse eid="GEN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 5:19" />Enawk uang dia kung kowi paw aia dow singla 800 ning tak. Nami takra kowi paw aia dow kala chah küng tak chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 5:20" />Now 962 ning chih now Jared dow kowng khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 5:21" />Enawk dow 65 ning chih khe ka chah khai. Achapa ming dow Methusela. <verse eid="GEN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 5:22" />Methusela uang dia kung kowi aia dow 300 ning mowr Thurai hown taklawp taiua khai. Nami khin khe paw aia dow kala chah küng tak chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 5:23" />Enawk dow 365 ning mowr lusa kowi uowila khai. <verse eid="GEN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 5:24" />Nami kung kowi aia kowi dow khi-ah dowi bowt chekhai. Thurai hown taklawp taiua reng rakowi aia kowi dow Thurai iu pawta khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 5:25" />Methusela dow 187 ning chih khe ka chah khai. Achapa ming dow Lamek. <verse eid="GEN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 5:26" />Lamek uang dia kung kowi paw aia dow singla 782 ning tak. Nami takra kowi paw aia dow kala chah küng tak chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 5:27" />Now 969 ning chih now Methusela dow kowng khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 5:28" />Lamek dow 182 ning chih khe ka chah khai. <verse eid="GEN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 5:29" />Now Lamek tek mih, “Krawng kowi Thurai peta piati hownia bowt now nakala chakkham kownkow akawm akratma hai a-i lup chang takla khai; nachenganchepaw mami chah dow akawm akrat hownia nape a-i sakklamra bowt kown,” pakhai. Now achapa ming dow Noa pahai rük pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 5:30" />Noa uang dia kung kowi paw aia dow singla 595 ning tak. Nami takra kowi paw aia dow kala chah küng tak chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 5:31" />Now 777 ning chih now Lamek dow kowng khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 5:32" />Noa dow 500 ning chih kung kowi ka kachakuüa chah sum ia khai. Achapauüa dow Sem, Ham hai Jafet büah chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 5:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GEN 6" />
  <para style="s">Lusa kowi angak prung mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 6:1" />Naiawng hai lusa kowi maru akawmma uang prung khai; nami pungmadawng kowi masiuüa paw ahuma tawi uowi khai. <verse eid="GEN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 6:2" />Nami khin khe Thurai chapauüa mih lusa kowi kowh masiuüa hawmh kowi klangiungma khi-ah khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni naukhi-ah mih kowi pawah büah hanow changla masi büah khai. <verse eid="GEN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 6:3" />Nami khita hanow CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Ang lümla mih maru tut-e chowngchowng saksakma nauowi kown nadowi bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru dow nakowng ngengche kown. Kawmat hownia dow 120 ning mowr towbowt nasing büah kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 6:4" />Lusa kowi kowh masiuüa hown Thurai chapauüa taphua taiua kowh kaah mih chauüa dow achük alai kowh aming anang iukma mih bawliuüa chekhai. Nami maru-uüa kowi dow Nephilimuüa pape khai; amatni dow nami khin khe hai nami kung kowi paw lusa kowi uowi reng chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 6:5" />Now lusa kowi maru-uüa kowh angak dow lainowmma hu mih CHAKRAMANG khi khai; maru-uüa kowh saktuak hai kamrütra dow atungma angak prakowi kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 6:6" />Nami khita hanow CHAKRAMANG dow lainowmma sak piak khai; lusa kowi aia thawpla maru mih rakowi aia sak kowi dow lainowmma rau khai. <verse eid="GEN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 6:7" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Ang thawpah mih maru kowi lusa hownia asaima ang namata kown. Nami klen kowi tawncher hai kaurawng uaramchak ün, kam hai sowr mih ün, kuang kowi kowh uakling uaber ün ang namata bowk kown. Naiawngün ang thawp rakowi chekhai ang sak kowi rau mih,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 6:8" />Nachenganchepaw Noa luk kowi dow CHAKRAMANG mih sak-ih reng chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Noa chün Thurai lai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="GEN 6:9-10" />Mami dow Noa chownglawng laiklow chekhai. Noa kowh chapa sum ia dow Sem, Ham hai Jafet chekhai. Noa dow maru iungma. Aia chowng kowi kowh maru maten kowi achi anawmma mih dow aia lowkchow taih. Aia dow Thurai hown taklawp taiua reng. <verse eid="GEN 6:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 6:11" />Nachenganchepaw akeng miuüa dow Thurai mik mük kowi piak bowk khowk; palusama kowi dow angak kangowh atekma chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 6:12" />Lusa kowi uang iu mü hanow lusa dow lainowmma ngah mih Thurai uang iu khi khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow lusa kowi kowh maru chowm krang uowi krang dow lainowmma ngah khai. <verse eid="GEN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 6:13" />Nami khi hanow Thurai tek pe Noa mih, “Lusa kowi kowh asak uowi mih maten ang napiakta kownkow ang kamrütta khowk. Maru rakowi lusa mih nowng chang powng changra hown tek khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi maru hown lusa kowi kowh uowi mih maten kowi ang napiakta bowk kown. <verse eid="GEN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 6:14" />Naiawng rakowi en matia vüi painglang singh hown thawp <char style="w">chawnlawng</char> lowk diah. Nami chawnlawng kowi atowk ahuma thawpah diah. Now chawnlawng ping kowi dow alak hownia hai uat hownia mih <char style="w">than</char> hown miaah bowk diah. <verse eid="GEN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 6:15" />Chawnlawng dow maiawng en nathawpah kown: Areng klang 300 muk, adowng phia 50 muk, now akro 30 muk en nathawpah kown. <verse eid="GEN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 6:16" />Now chawnlawng luk hownia adak pra amuk mowr mih tapat lut tawngpawk en natow pe kown; en napingah kown nadowi. Now aplawt dow areng hownia en nathawpah kown. Now aluk krowng, adawng krowng hai adak krowng en nathawp pe kown. <verse eid="GEN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 6:17" />Sünta, mukuang dak kowi hü sak kowh sing mih chap maten ang napiakta kownkow lusa kowi ang nauang pawla pe tuikling mangma kown. Lusa kowi kowh asak uowi mih maten dow nami tuikling mangma hown nakowng bowk kown.<verse eid="GEN 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 6:18" />“Nachenganchepaw en hown dow ang natatow <char style="w">sangbowk laitawm</char> kown. En hai en masi, en chapauüa hai en iaumowuüa, enni bowkbowk dow chawnlawng kowi napün kown. <verse eid="GEN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 6:19" />En hown natawi singla kownkow asak uowi mih chap maten ala ama, aku aklang achum achumchow chi chawnlawng lak kowi en natangla kown. <verse eid="GEN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 6:20" />Tawncher chap maten, uakling chap maten hai kam hai sowr mih chap maten achum achumchow en nape singla kownkow en tut-e nauang kown. <verse eid="GEN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 6:21" />Naiawngünuüa hai enni nachangla chakkham kownkow chaah mih chap maten krawi pawah hanow krümah diah,” pape khai. <verse eid="GEN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 6:22" />Now Noa dow nami powm iawng chang khai. Thurai peah ana mih iawng lup maten aia mih chang khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 6:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="GEN 7" />
  <para style="s">Tuikling mangma uang mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 7:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG plan tek pe Noa mih, “En hai en kimchakuüa hailawm chawnlawng kowi pün büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow kawmat kowh chowng maru-uüa pungmadawng kowi kowh achi anawmma mih maru dow en lowkchow taih chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 7:2" />Chimsaima mih asadua chap maten hownia ala hai ama ranit chum chi chawnlawng kowi en napawla kown. Now <char style="w">chimsai</char> dowi mih asadua chap maten hownia paw pachum chi chawnlawng kowi en napawla kown. <verse eid="GEN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 7:3" />Nami klen kowi kuang kowi kowh iow mih uakling uaber chap maten hownia paw ranit chum chi en napawla kown. Naiawngün dow lusa kowi aliu nauowila reng kownkow en tut-e towla diah. <verse eid="GEN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 7:4" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow kawmat hownia ranit ni kung kowi dow lusa kowi uang ang nauang pe uangah kown chekhai. Nami uang dow likawm ni likawm uar mowr amowt uowi dowi kowi nauang kown. Krawng luk kowi kowh ang thawpah mih asak uowi mih maten lusa hownia ang namata kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 7:5" />Naiawng rakowi Noa dow CHAKRAMANG kowh <char style="w">ana pek</char> iawng bowkbowk mih lup chang khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 7:6" />Lusa kowi tuikling mangma uang mih khin khe Noa kowh ning dow 600 chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 7:7" />Tuikling mangma hownia naplaila kownkow Noa dow amasi hai achapauüa hai aiaumowuüa hown chawnlawng kowi kowpün khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 7:7" /><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="GEN 7:8-9" />Noa kowi Thurai peah ana khe kowh tek pe mih iawng dow chimsai mih hai chimsai dowi mih asadua, uakling uaber, kam hai sowr mih chap maten aku aklang hai ala ama achum achumchow chawnlawng kowi Noa pawla khai. <verse eid="GEN 7:8-9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 7:10" />Now ranit ni kung kowi dow lusa kowi tuikling mangma uown tarowng khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 7:11" />Krawng dak hownia tui uang lawt iualua khai, now mukuang hownia paw tui uang takhük plawtlawt mih powm iawng uang uang khai bowt. Naiawng uown phaw mih dow Noa kowh ning 600 khe pre la kowi kowh lairanit ni khe chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 7:12" />Naiawng hai nami uang dow likawm ni likawm uar mowr krawng luk kowi uang hing uangta hüah chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 7:13" />Uang iu uown uang mih ni khe Noa mih amasi hai aiaumowuüa hai achapa Sem, Ham hai Jafet büah hown chawnlawng kowi kowpün khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 7:14" />Amatni tut-e dow tawncher, kaurawng uaramchak, uakling uaber, kam hai sowr mih hown asak uowi mih chap maten paw pachumchowchi chawnlawng kowi kowtawi pün khai. <verse eid="GEN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 7:15" />Hü sak kowh sing mih chap maten achum achumchow Noa hown chawnlawng kowi kowtawi kup khai. <verse eid="GEN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 7:16" />Noa kowi Thurai peah ana khe kowh tek pe mih iawng dow aku aklang hai ala ama mih achum achumchow chawnlawng kowi kowkup khai. Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG mih büngta pe chawnlawng plawt khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 7:17" />Nami hownia now likawm ni mowr lusa kowi tuikling mangma uang khai bowt. Now tui hu lai bowt rakowi chawnlawng dow krawng hownia awr tapowng khai. <verse eid="GEN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 7:18" />Nami kung kowi paw lusa kowi mih tui uang hu ngamlam khai; now chawnlawng paw tui luk kowi krawi nawm pawlaw khai. <verse eid="GEN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 7:19" />Lusa kowi dow tui uang hu ngamlam chekhai. Naiawng rakowi lusa kowi kowh akro akroma mih hungh maten lim bowk chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 7:20" />Hungma mawngma maten lim bowk klen kowi paw tui mih laitanga muk luk kowi tak awr pün khai.<verse eid="GEN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 7:21" />Naiawng rakowi krawng luk kowi kowh asak uowi mih maten kowng bowk khai; uakling uaber ün, tawncher ün, kaurawng uaramchak ün, kam hai sowr mih hown maru ün kowng bowk chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 7:22" />Süng kowi kowh uowi mih srui hü sak kowh sing mih chap maten dow kowng bowk khai. <verse eid="GEN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 7:23" />Thurai mih naiawng hai krawng luk kowi kowh asak uowi mih maten kowi lusa hownia mata khai; lusa maru ün, asadua ün, kam hai sowr mih hown kuang kowi kowh iow mih uakling uaber ün lusa hownia tama khai bowt. Noa hai aia tut-e kowh chawnlawng kowi tawi uowi miuüa ngetchow taih ta sing khai. <verse eid="GEN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 7:24" />Lusa kowi mih 150 ni mowr tui limah khai.<verse eid="GEN 7:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="GEN 8" />
  <para style="s">Tui iut mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 8:1" />Chawnlawng kowi kowh uowi mih Noa hai tawncher hown kaurawng uaramchak maten kowi Thurai mih tamata dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow lusa kowi li uang pe uangah khai, now tuikling mangma tui dow uown iut iawlaw khai. <verse eid="GEN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 8:2" />Nami dowi rawn khe krawng hownia kowh uang towk iualua mih tui hai kuang hownia kowh uang takhük plawtlawt powm iawng mih tui maten taing khai bowt, now uangchak mang paw uang dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 8:3" />Naiawng rakowi krawng luk kowi kowh tui dow uown iut rürü khai. Now tuikling mangma uown uang hownia 150 ni kung kowi dow tui mih ahuma uang iut khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 8:4" />Ranit la kowi kowh lairanit ni khe dow chawnlawng mih Ararat kowi kowh hungh lowk mih kowi kowtatang khai. <verse eid="GEN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 8:5" />Nami kung kowi paw tui dow uang iut rürü chekhai. Now hamüt la kowi kowh auown ni khe dow hungh chut ün uang tatüng khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 8:6" />Nami hownia likawm ni kung kowi Noa mih chawnlawng kowi kowh aia thawpah mih tawngpawk uowah khai. <verse eid="GEN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 8:7" />Nami tawngpawk hownia dow aia mih lawt uaak lowk khai. Nachenganchepaw nami uaak dow uang plan dowi; krawng luk kowi kowh tui kang dowi mowr nami uaak dow cham krawi iow panglang khai. <verse eid="GEN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 8:8" />Nami kung kowi paw krawng luk kowi tui kang khowk chünchü pami natukla kownkow Noa mih plan lawt uatur lowk iawk. <verse eid="GEN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 8:9" />Nachenganchepaw nami khin khe palusama kowi tui uowi reng tak chekhai. Naiawng kowh ka mownra dowi kowh nami uatur mih chawnlawng kowi uang plan khai iawk. Noa mih aia rut hown hawt pawah hanow nami uatur kowi dow chawnlawng lak kowi kupla khai. <verse eid="GEN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 8:10" />Nami kung kowi kutplan chawngah ranit ni hanow Noa mih nami uatur kowi chawnlawng hownia plan lawtah khai iawk. <verse eid="GEN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 8:11" />Nami ni sat kowi prakowi nami uatur dow Noa tut-e uang plan powt khai iawk; nami leng dow klekla thowi mih kanrawn ramthawn anawrchawk hown uang pawla lowk. Nami khita hanow krawng luk kowi tui kang khai bowt pami dow Noa hawt tuk khai. <verse eid="GEN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 8:12" />Aia dow plan chawngah ranit ni iawk now nami uatur kowi kutplan lawtah khai iawk, now nami leng dow nami uatur mih aia tut-e uang plan powt dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 8:13" />Noa kowh ning dow 601 ning uang tachi khai bowt. Nami ning kowi kowh ni uown kowi dow krawng luk kowi mih tui uowi dowi bowt chekhai. Nami khin khe dow chawnlawng kowi kowh aluk mih Noa uowah hanow tang mü khai, now aluk phü bawn uown kang mih aia khi khai. <verse eid="GEN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 8:14" />Nami ning pre la kowi kowh pirmi lairanit ni khe dow bawn mih akang khawngma uang own khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 8:15" />Nami khin khe Noa kowi Thurai tek pe mih, <verse eid="GEN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 8:16" />“En hai en masi, en chapauüa hai en iaumowuüa hailawm chawnlawng hownia uang lawt büah towbowt. <verse eid="GEN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 8:17" />Asadua hai uakling uaber hai kam hai sowr mih ün, asak uowi mih chap maten kowi uang lawtla towbowt. Amatni dow lusa kowi pacham prung pacham se büah lah, now lusa kowi atekma pacham uowi büah lah,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 8:18" />Naiawng rakowi Noa dow amasi hai achapauüa hai aiaumowuüa hailawm chawnlawng hownia uang lawt khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 8:19" />Now asadua hai uakling uaber hai kam hai sowr mih ün, asak uowi mih chap maten paw kowmatia chap hown ahawm ahawmchow uang tawi lawt khai.<verse eid="GEN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tikah mih uanap rakowi Thurai awmrawm mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 8:20" />Nami kung kowi dow Noa mih CHAKRAMANG vüi thawp phuchuara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Phuchuara </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow hua hown ün, lawngha hown ün thawpah mih uanap tik rah krowng chekhai.</char></note> lowk khai. Now asadua hai uakling uaber chap maten hownia chimsaima mih pawah lowk chi khai, now phuchuara luk kowi tikah now tikah mih uanap dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e ap-ah khai. <verse eid="GEN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 8:21" />Nami uanap nam ta hanow CHAKRAMANG dow awmrawm rakowi sakdawng hownia tek mih, “Maru rakowi lusa kowi kowh uowi mih maten kowi ang napeah piati kown nadowi bowt. Maru kowh saktuak dow asowmchow hownia angak prakowi kangowh chepaw asak uowi mih chap maten kowi kawmat kowh ang piakah mih iawng dow katpaw ang napiakah kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="GEN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 8:22" />Mami lusa uowi mowr dow akhin towng nasawt liu hanow nakua luprak bowt kown. Arua hai aden, chungrau hai satma, ni hai uar atungma nauowi reng bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="GEN 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 9:1" />Noa hai achapauüa kowi Thurai peah prasi khai, now tek pe mih, “Ahuma awr prung awr se büah hanow lusa kowi atekma uang uowi büa diah. <verse eid="GEN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 9:2" />Lusa kowi kowh asak uowi mih maten, kuang kowi kowh uakling uaber ün, kam hai sowr mih ün, sata kowi kowh dam ün nakram enni kown. Naiawngün dow enni low kowi nauowi kown. <verse eid="GEN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 9:3" />Alai khe dow pramna ang pe cha enni khai. Nachenganchepaw kawmat hownia dow kam hai sowr mih hown asak uowi mih maten paw enni naiung cha kown towbowt. Naiawngün dow ang peta enni bowk khowk. <verse eid="GEN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 9:4" />Tawkche vi dow sing müa chekhai rakowi tawng iawng mih chaknga paw avi hailawm enni nacha kown nadowi. <verse eid="GEN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 9:5" />Paw enni asak mih kowi dow aia kowh asak paw napawta pe kown. Maru lah, asadua lah paw maru asak mih kowi dow aia kowh asak paw napawta pe ngengche kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG tek khowk. <verse eid="GEN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 9:6" />Maru kowi dow ang matia powm iawng ang thawpah khai; naiawng rakowi amia iawng mih chow sai maru mih kowi dow aia kowi paw akeng mih maru nasaiah kown. <verse eid="GEN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 9:7" />Uang prung uang se büa diah. Akawmma prek chu prek cha büah hanow palusama kowi krawi tauet büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Noa tut-e Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm hai amatra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 9:8" />Nami kung kowi Noa hai achapauüa kowi Thurai tek pe mih, <verse eid="GEN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 9:9" />“Sünta, enni hai enni kowh krungchakuüa vüi sangbowk laitawm ang towta khowk. <verse eid="GEN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 9:10" />Nami klen kowi uakling uaber ün, tawncher ün, kaurawng uaramchak hai asak uowi mih maten chawnlawng hownia enni hown kowh uang tawi lawt mih srui vüi paw ang towta sangbowk laitawm khowk chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 9:11" />Nami sangbowk laitawm dow maiawng: tuikling mangma hown lusa kowi kowh asak uowi mih chap maten kowi ang napiakah kown nadowi bowt, now palusama nowng piakla iawng mih tuikling mangma paw nauang kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="GEN 9:12-13" />Thurai plan tek iawk mih, “Enni hai asak uowi mih maten vüi ang towta sangbowk laitawm khowk mih dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi chekhai. Nami sangbowk laitawm matra dow uangnim dawng kowi ang kowh tummapia ang nape tatüngah kown. Nami dow lusa kowi kowh asak uowi mih maten vüi ang towta sangbowk laitawm khowk mih amatra chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 9:12-13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 9:14" />Mukuang kowi ang kua uangnim mih khin khe nami uangnim dawng kowi enni nakhi tummapia kown. <verse eid="GEN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 9:15" />Nami khin khe dow enni hai asadua maten vüi kowi kowh ang towah mih sangbowk laitawm ang naka tuak kown. Nahanow tuikling mangma hown lusa kowi kowh asak uowi mih maten napiak kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="GEN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 9:16" />Uangnim dawng kowi tummapia uang tatüng mih ang khi hanow lusa kowi kowh asak uowi mih maten hown chowngchowng saksakma vüi ang towta sangbowk laitawm khowk mih ang naka tuak kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 9:17" />Nami kung kowi Thurai tek pe Noa mih, “Lusa kowi kowh asak uowi mih maten vüi ang towta sangbowk laitawm khowk pami amatra dow nami tummapia chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Noa hai aia chapauüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 9:18" />Chawnlawng hownia kowh uang lawt mih Noa kowh chapauüa dow Sem, Ham hai Jafet büah chekhai. (Ham dow Kanan kowh pa). <verse eid="GEN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 9:19" />Lusa kowi kowh maru maten dow Noa chapa sum ia kowh chuprek chaprekuüa kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 9:20" />Noa dow uown chang üa chang lai khai. Aia dow uown ien grep khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 9:21" />Akat khe aia dow kham grep tui kowh lainowmma pua khai. Aia dow pua lai rakowi tengiow tengklaima hown aia kowh tangbung lak kowi müi khai. <verse eid="GEN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 9:22" />Nami khin khe Kanan kowh pa Ham mih naiawng a-pa müi nga mih kowkhita khai. Nami khita hanow Ham dow prang kowi kowh ataimow pre ia tut-e kowkowiah hanow naiawng apa müi nga mih lawnguan kowtek pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 9:23" />Nami tata hanow Sem hai Jafet iüah dow paw uan lowk now pangkawt riaria batla iüah now kungpah kungpah kowkowi iüah khai, now nami uan mih a-pa luk kowi kowmum pe iüah khai. Amatchi dow a-pa prakowi dang iüah dowi rakowi a-pa tengiow tengklaima mih khi iüah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 9:24" />Now pua prowng kung kowi dow Noa mih achapa sawi mih Ham kowh uowi krang tukta khai. <verse eid="GEN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 9:25" />Naiawng rakowi Noa tek mih, “Kanan dow pacham ka piati lah. Aia dow atainau-uüa kowh lang sowm mih nar pacham chowng lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 9:26" />Noa plan tek iawk mih, “Sem kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai dow akiow pauowi lah. Kanan dow Sem kowh nar pachowng lah. <verse eid="GEN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 9:27" />Thurai mih Jafet kowi dow krawng bawn pacham peah küng lah. Now aia dow Sem kowh prasi pacham tawi ka lah. Kanan dow Jafet kowh nar pacham chowng lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 9:28" />Tuikling mangma uang kung kowi paw Noa dow singla 350 ning tak chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 9:29" />Now 950 ning chih now Noa mih kowng khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="GEN 10" />
  <para style="s">Noa krungchakuüa lawnguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 10:1" />Mami dow Noa chapa Sem, Ham hai Jafet büah kowh krungchakuüa lawnguan chekhai. Tuikling mangma uang kung kowi amatni dow ka chah ahuma chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jafet krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 10:2" />Jafet kowh chapauüa dow Gomer, Magawg, Madai, Javan, Tubal, Masek hai Tiras büah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 10:3" />Gomer kowh chapauüa dow Askenaz, Rifat hai Togarma büah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 10:4" />Javan kowh chapauüa dow Elisa, Tarsis<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tarsis </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow kawmat kowh Spain pren chekhai.</char></note>, Kittim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kittim </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow kawmat kowh Saipras pren chekhai. </char></note> hai Dudanim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dudanim </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow kawmat kowh Rhodes pren chekhai. </char></note> büah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 10:5" />Jafet krungchakuüa dow sata pang kowi kowh uowi mih hai süngdum kowi kowh uowi miuüa chekhai. Amatni dow kimchak lang powm iawng lai lang now chen paw lang bowk chekhai, now amatni kowh pren paw alang alangma chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ham kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 10:6" />Ham kowh chapauüa dow Kus, Mizraim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mizraim </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow kawmat kowh Aigupta pren chekhai.</char></note>, Put<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Put </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow kawmat kowh Libia pren chekhai. </char></note> hai Kanan büah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 10:7" />Kus kowh chapauüa dow Seba, Havila, Sabta, Rama hai Sabteka büah chekhai. Rama kowh chapauüa dow Seba hai Dedan iüah chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 10:8" />Kus kowh dow Nimrud pape mih paw chapa uowi lowk ia tak. Nimrud dow lusa kowi kowh tasen kiakma uang rik phaw mih maru chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 10:9" />Aia dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi chakmit akiakma mih maru chekhai. Naiawng rakowi chakmit akiakma mih maru kowi maiawng maru tek pe reng, “En dow Nimrud iawng CHAKRAMANG mik kowi chakmit akiakma,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 10:10" />Aia dow Sinar pren kowi kowh Babel, Erek, Akad hai Kalne marow luk kowi uown chowm mang khai. <verse eid="GEN 10:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="GEN 10:11-12" />Nami pren hownia lawt hanow aia dow Asuria pren kowi kowkowi khai. Nakowi dow Ninevi, Rehubawt-ir, Kalah hai Resen marow kowthawp khai. Resen marow dow Ninevi hai Kalah marow takra kowi kowh uowi mih chekhai. Nami marow dow aiukma chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 10:11-12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="GEN 10:13-14" />Mizraim kowh krungchakuüa dow Luduüa, Anamuüa, Lehabuüa, Naptu-uüa, Pathrusuüa, Kreteuüa hai Kasluuüa chekhai. (Kaslu krungchakuüa dow Filistinuüa chekhai).<verse eid="GEN 10:13-14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 10:15" />Kanan kowh chapa lang ta mih ming dow Sidawn chekhai. Sidawn kung kowi kowh uang dia mih dow Het chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 10:16" />Jebusuüa, Amawruüa, Girgasuüa, <verse eid="GEN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 10:17" />Hivuüa, Arkituüa, Sinuüa, <verse eid="GEN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 10:18" />Arvaduüa, Zemaruüa hai Hamatuüa dow Kanan kowh krungchakuüa chekhai. Akung kowi naiawngün Kanan krungchakuüa dow alakma mowr pat cham taset tauet khai. <verse eid="GEN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 10:19" />Kananuüa kowh pren sünghi dow tawngphak prakowi Sidawn marow mowr, mrawkphak prakowi dow Gerar hai Gaza marow mowr, now satlawt prakowi dow Sawdawm, Gawmawra, Adma hai Lasa re-e kowh Zebawim marow mowr chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 10:20" />Naiawngünuüa maten dow Ham kowh krungchakuüa chekhai. Amatni dow kimchak lang powm iawng lai lang now chen paw lang bowk, now amatni kowh pren paw alang alangma chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sem kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 10:21" />Jafet kowh taimow Sem kowh paw chauüa uowi ahuma chekhai. Sem kowh krungchakuüa dow Eber hai aia chauüa chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 10:22" />Sem kowh chauüa dow Elam, Asur, Arpasad, Lud hai Aram büah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 10:23" />Aram kowh chauüa dow Uz, Hul, Gether hai Mesek büah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 10:24" />Arpasad kowh chapa dow Sela chekhai, now Sela kowh chapa dow Eber chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 10:25" />Eber kowh dow chapa uowi pre ia. Achapa lowk ia mih ming dow Pelek; nami khin khe lusa tabak khai rakowi nami ming dow nami auan kowi rükah mih chekhai. Pelek kowh naumow ming dow Jawktan. <verse eid="GEN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 10:26" />Jawktan kowh chauüa dow Almadad, Selep, Hazarmavet, Jera, <verse eid="GEN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 10:27" />Hadoram, Uzal, Dikla, <verse eid="GEN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 10:28" />Obal, Abimael, Seba, <verse eid="GEN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 10:29" />Ofir, Havila hai Jawbab büah chekhai. Amatni bowkbowk dow Jawktan kowh chauüa chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 10:30" />Amatni dow hungma mawngma süng kowi uowi büah khai; nami dow Mesa hownia satlawt pra kowh Sephar marow pra mangla mih tia kowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 10:31" />Amatni dow Sem kowh krungchakuüa kangowh chekhai. Amatni dow kimchak lang powm iawng lai lang now chen paw lang bowk, now amatni kowh pren paw alang alangma chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 10:32" />Amatni dow Noa krungchakuüa chekhai. Amatni dow Noa kowh chu chauüa krungchakuüa hownia kowh chenchapuüa chekhai. Tuikling mangma uang kung kowi naiawngün maru-uüa maten dow palusama kowi cham taset tauet hanow chenchap alang alangma cham phaw büah khai.<verse eid="GEN 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="GEN 11" />
  <para style="s">Maru kowh lai taklowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 11:1" />Auown khe dow palusama maru-uüa kowh lai pachapchow taih, now laiklow paw katsang chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 11:2" />Nami maru-uüa mih satlawt prakowi cham süt cham süt hanow Sinar pren kowi kowh anaima mih süng kowi kowtowm büah khai, now nakowi mih chang kret büah khai. <verse eid="GEN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 11:3" />Nakowi uowi büah mih khin khe lowkkowlowk tatek mih, “Chu, i thawp <char style="w">ipbawn</char> lah; maih kowi i awpah hanow akhawtma i changah lah,” pakhai. Now hua takcha dow ipbawn, now thundi hown sakka kam takcha dow alkattra tawngah büah khai.<verse eid="GEN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 11:4" />Nami kung kowi plan tatek büah iawk mih, “Chu, i thawp marow lowk lah, now akro krang kuang kowi tawk pat mih kimkrowng i thawp lowk lah. Nahanow a-i kowh aming anang naiung kown towbowt, now palusama kowi a-i nacham taset tauet kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 11:5" />Now CHAKRAMANG dow maru-uüa thawpah mih marow hai kimkrowng uang mü kownkow uang dowm khai. <verse eid="GEN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 11:6" />CHAKRAMANG tek mih, “Amatni dow achap sang mih maru, now lai paw akat sang chekhai. Naiawng rakowi naiawng mih lup uown chang büah mih chekhai. Nami kung kowi dow amatni nowng changah dowi pami lup tawngpaw nauowi kown nadowi bowt tham lownow. <verse eid="GEN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 11:7" />Naiawng rakowi chu madiah, i kowsam kowi madiah sik. Lowkkowlowk lai natuktala büah dowi bowt kownkow i kowlangta pe lai bowk lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 11:8" />Now naiawng CHAKRAMANG changta pe hanow naiawngün maru-uüa dow palusama kowi cham taset plawt khai, now amatni kowh marow hai kimkrowng thawp dow towla büah hüah khai. <verse eid="GEN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 11:9" />Palusama maru kowh laiklow CHAKRAMANG langta pe mih dow nami re-e chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nami re-e kowh arah ming dow Babel pahai rük pe khai. Maru-uüa kowi palusama kowi CHAKRAMANG cham uetah mih dow nami hownia chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sem krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 11:10" />Mami dow Sem krungchakuüa lawnguan chekhai. Tuikling mangma uang mih pre ning kung kowi Sem dow ka chah khai. Achapa ming dow Arpasad chekhai. Nami khin khe aia dow ning 100 chi khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 11:11" />Arpasad uang dia kung kowi paw Sem mih singla 500 ning tak chekhai. Nami takra kowi paw aia dow kala chah küng tak chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 11:12" />Arpasad dow 35 ning chi khe ka chah khai. Achapa ming dow Sela chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 11:13" />Sela uang dia kung kowi paw Arpasad dow singla 403 ning tak. Nami takra kowi paw aia dow kala chah küng tak chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 11:14" />Sela dow 30 ning chi khe ka chah khai. Achapa ming dow Eber chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 11:15" />Eber uang dia kung kowi paw Sela dow singla 403 ning tak. Nami takra kowi paw aia dow kala chah küng tak chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 11:16" />Eber dow 34 ning chi khe ka chah khai. Achapa ming dow Pelek chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 11:17" />Pelek uang dia kung kowi paw Eber dow singla 430 ning tak. Nami takra kowi paw aia dow kala chah küng tak chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 11:18" />Pelek dow 30 ning chi khe ka chah khai. Achapa ming dow Reu chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 11:19" />Reu uang dia kung kowi paw Pelek dow singla 209 ning tak. Nami takra kowi paw aia dow kala chah küng tak chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 11:20" />Reu dow 32 ning chi khe ka chah khai. Achapa ming dow Serug chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 11:21" />Serug uang dia kung kowi paw Reu dow singla 207 ning tak. Nami takra kowi paw aia dow kala chah küng tak chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 11:22" />Serug dow 30 ning chi khe ka chah khai. Achapa ming dow Nahawr chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 11:23" />Nahawr uang dia kung kowi paw Serug dow singla 200 ning tak. Nami takra kowi paw aia dow kala chah küng tak chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 11:24" />Nahawr dow 29 ning chi khe ka chah khai. Achapa ming dow Tera chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 11:25" />Tera uang dia kung kowi paw Nahawr dow singla 119 ning tak. Nami takra kowi paw aia dow kala chah küng tak chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 11:26" />Tera dow 70 ning chi khe ka chah khai. Achapauüa ming dow Abram, Nahawr hai Haran büah chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tera krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 11:27" />Mami dow Tera krungchakuüa lawnguan chekhai. Tera kowh chauüa ming dow Abram, Nahawr hai Haran büah chekhai. Haran kowh chapa ming dow Lawt chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 11:28" />Haran dow aia dia rah Kaldaiuüa pren kowi kowh Ur marow kowi a-pa Tera sing uowi reng tak khe kowng khai. <verse eid="GEN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 11:29" />Abram hai Nahawr iüah dow paw masi khai. Abram kowh masi ming dow Sara, now Nahawr kowh masi ming dow Milka chekhai. Milka hai Iska iüah dow Haran kowh chama chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 11:30" />Sara dow atingma rakowi ka chah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 11:31" />Tera dow achapa Abram, aiaumow Sara hai Haran kowh chapa Lawt büah kowi pawla hanow Kaldaiuüa pren kowi kowh Ur marow hownia lawt khai, now Kanan pren prakowi tarü büah khai. Auown khe dow Haran pape mih marow mowr kowkowi büah khai, now nakowi mih kowuowi büah khai. <verse eid="GEN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 11:32" />Tera dow 205 ning chi khe Haran marow kowi kowng khai.<verse eid="GEN 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="GEN 12" />
  <para style="s">Abram kowi Thurai hawah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 12:1" />Abram kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “En matia pren hai en chen nawiuüa hai en pa kim towla hanow ang natüng en kown mih pren kowi kowkowi diah. <verse eid="GEN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 12:2" />Ang nape en prasi hanow en krungchakuüa kowi chenchap aiukma ang nathawpah kown. En kowh ming iung nang iung ang nahowng en kown, now en hownia maru natawi ka prasi kown. <verse eid="GEN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 12:3" />Pe en prasi miuüa kowi dow ang napeah prasi kown, now pe en piati miuüa kowi dow ang napeah piati kown. En hownia lusa kowi kowh chenchap maten natawi ka prasi kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanan pren kowi Abram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 12:4" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG laiklow powm iawng Abram dow tarü khai bowt, now Lawt paw aia tut-e tawi khai. Haran marow hownia lawt mih khin khe Abram kowh ning dow 75 ning chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 12:5" />Aia dow amasi Sara hai anaumow chapa Lawt kowi pawla now Kanan pren prakowi tarü khai. Haran marow kowi kowh aia kramah mih dawngthawnguan srui hai aia kaah mih narma narla maten paw aia pawla khai; now Kanan pren kowi dow kowtowm büah khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 12:6" />Abram dow Kanan pren kowi mang mang now Sekem marow kowi kowh Mawre kowh singh chimsaima mih rah re-e kowtowm khai. Nami khin khe paw nami pren kowi mih kananuüa hawt uowi reng chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 12:7" />Nakowi uowi mih khin khe Abram tut-e CHAKRAMANG uang tatüng hanow tek pe mih, “Mami pren mih en chuprek chaprekuüa kowi ang napeah kown,” pape khai. Now Abram dow aia tut-e kowh uang tatüng mih CHAKRAMANG vüi nami re-e thawp <char style="w">phuchuara</char> lowk khai.<verse eid="GEN 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 12:8" />Nami kung kowi dow nami hownia Bethel marow satlawt pra kowh hungh kowi aia awr süt khai, now nakowi mih aia khup tangbung khai. Aia uowi rah satkup prakowi uowi mih dow Bethel marow chekhai, now satlawt pra kowh uowi mih dow Ai marow chekhai. Nakowi mih CHAKRAMANG vüi aia thawp phuchuara lowk khai, now CHAKRAMANG kowi chupah iiaah khai. <verse eid="GEN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 12:9" />Now nami hownia aia dow mrawkphak pra kowh Negeb pape mih <char style="w">süngrüp süngkangma</char> prakowi kowkowi khai.<verse eid="GEN 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aigupta pren kowi Abram kowkowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 12:10" />Nakhowk khe Kanan pren kowi mih <char style="w">khown</char> uang kuak khai, nami khown dow arawn amatma chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Abram mih Aigupta pren kowi nakowuowi tak kownkow kowkowi khai. <verse eid="GEN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 12:11" />Aigupta pren kowi kowtowm kown chowbowt khe amasi Sara kowi Abram tek pe mih, “Sünta diah, en dow klangiungma mih masiuüa chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 12:12" />Naiawng kowh Aigupta maru-uüa khi en hanow nanaukhi en kown. En mih ang kowh masi chekhai pami tuk büah hanow en kowi dow natow en now ang kowi dow napawta ang asak büah kown chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 12:13" />Naiawng rakowi sakrauma hown, ‘Ang dow atuamow chekhai,’ pami en tek diah. Nahanow en rakowi naiung ang büah kown towbowt, now ang kowh asak paw natow ang büah kown towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 12:14" />Now Aigupta pren kowi Abram kowkup hanow Aigupta maru-uüa dow Abram kowh masi Sara klangiungma mih hawt khi büah khai. <verse eid="GEN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 12:15" />Mang Faraw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Faraw </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow Aiguptauüa lai hown mang pami chekhai. Mang maten kowi Aiguptauüa dow Faraw pahai hawah khai.</char></note> kowh maru iukuüa paw tawi khi hanow Sara klangiung mih lawnguan Faraw kowi tekla pe khai. Naiawng rakowi Sara kowi mih mang kim kowi pawla khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 12:16" />Now Sara rakowi Faraw mih Abram kowi changah iung khai. Aia dow ruapur ün, chia ün, kawrngaramchükma hai kawrngaramchükla ün, <char style="w">ut</char> ün, narma hai narla ün ahuma Abram kowi peah khai. <verse eid="GEN 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 12:17" />Nachenganchepaw Abram kowh masi Sara rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih Faraw hai aia kimchakuüa maten luk kowi rawka ngakma mih ahuma uang pe tingah khai. <verse eid="GEN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 12:18" />Naiawng rakowi Abram kowi hawah now Faraw tek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng en tuk chang ang khai? ‘Ang masi,’ pami tawngplawng kowchow en tek ang dowi? <verse eid="GEN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 12:19" />‘Ang tuamow chekhai,’ pami tawngplawng kowchow en tuk tek ang khai? Ang dow nüla en tuamow rakowi changla masi kownkow Sara kowi ang pawla mih chekhai. Kawmat mih en masi kowi pawla now powt diah,” pape khai. <verse eid="GEN 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 12:20" />Nahanow Abram kowi nalawtta kownkow Faraw mih aia maru-uüa kowi peah ana khai, now aia maru-uüa dow Abram hai amasi hai aia kowh uowi mih maten kowi nami pren hownia lawtta khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 12:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="GEN 13" />
  <para style="s">Abram hai Lawt iüah taprai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 13:1" />Abram mih amasi hai aia kowh uowi mih dawngthawnguan srui pawla now Aigupta pren hownia lawt khai, now Kanan pren mrawkphak pra kowh Negeb pami süngrüp süngkangma prakowi awr powt khai. Lawt paw aia hown katsang tawi powt khai. <verse eid="GEN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 13:2" />Abram dow kurengma. Aia kowh dow tawncher hai kuh hown tai ün ahuma chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 13:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="GEN 13:3-4" />Aia dow Negeb hownia mang mang now Bethel hai Ai marow takra kowi aia rik khupla tangbung hai rik thawp phuchuara mih re-e kowtowm khai. Nakowi aia mih CHAKRAMANG kowi chupah iiaah khai.<verse eid="GEN 13:3-4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 13:5" />Abram hown kowh tawi powt mih Lawt kowh paw chia ün, ruaün, ruapur hai tangbung ün ahuma chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 13:6" />Amatchi kowh dow tawncher hai dawngthawnguan hu lai rakowi arasang nataiua uowila kown mih süng talawk iüah dowi bowt. <verse eid="GEN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 13:7" />Naiawng rakowi Abram kowh tawncher thing mih hown Lawt kowh tawncher thing mih taran khai. Nami khin khe Kananuüa hai Perizuüa paw nami pren kowi uowi chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 13:8" />Nakhowk khe Lawt kowi Abram tek pe mih, “Sünta diah, achi dow pama pachowh asinma chekhai. Naiawng rakowi en hai ang hown taran kown mih mapaw iung dowi. En kowh tawncher thing mih hown ang kowh tawncher thing mih paw taran kown mih iung dowi. <verse eid="GEN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 13:9" />Paprenma dow achi pur kowi uowi hüah towbowt. Naiawng rakowi achi talang mih nalang iung kown; lakuai pra che en mang now hawmlawm pra ang mang sow, now hawmlawm pra che en mang now lakuai pra ang mang sow,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 13:10" />Nakhowk khe Lawt dow krawi tang mü hanow Jawrdan aw mrawkphak pra kowh <char style="w">lawngrawi</char> haikhi khai. Nami lawngrawi kowi dow tui ahuma uowi mih aia khi khai. Nami lawngrawi dow Jawrdan aw hownia Zoar marow mowr mih CHAKRAMANG kowh krum iawng chekhai. Krawng dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh krawng iawng aiungma chekhai. (Nami khin khe Sawdawm hai Gawmawra marow mih CHAKRAMANG piakta dowi tak chekhai). <verse eid="GEN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 13:11" />Naiawng rakowi Lawt dow Jawrdan aw mrawkphak pra kowh lawngrawi kowi nauowi kownkow tatuak khai, now aia dow satlawt prakowi awr powt khai bowt; naiawng hai amatchi dow taprai khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 13:12" />Abram dow Kanan pren kowi ta uowi khai, now Lawt dow nami lawngrawi kowi kowh marow takra kowi kowuowi khai. Aia dow Sawdawm marow ria mowr krawi khup tangbung khai. <verse eid="GEN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 13:13" />Sawdawm marow chakuüa dow angakma chekhai. Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowi <char style="w">kingküa</char> hai lainowmma chang angak khai.<verse eid="GEN 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hebrawn marow kowi Abram powt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 13:14" />Lawt lang talang kung kowi Abram kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “En iowngra hownia tawngphak, mrawkphak hai satlawt, satkup tapat lut krawi sam mü akat madiah. <verse eid="GEN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 13:15" />Nami en khi-ah mih srui dow en hai en krungchakuüa kowi chowngchowng saksakma vüi ang nape enni kown. <verse eid="GEN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 13:16" />En krungchakuüa kowi mih lusa kowi kowh dinchow iawng ang nachangah kown. Lusa kowi kowh dinchow che nowng rüa now en krungchakuüa kowi paw nanowng rüa kown. <verse eid="GEN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 13:17" />Mami paprenma kowi krawi len akat diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow mami pren mih ang nape en kown chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 13:18" />Nakhowk khe Abram dow aia kowh tangbung lutla now Hebrawn marow kowi kowkowi khai, now nakowi kowh Mamre kowh sasua singh rüm kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. Nakowi paw aia dow CHAKRAMANG vüi thawp phuchuara lowk chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="GEN 14" />
  <para style="s">Lawt kowi Abram krawi lawngah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 14:1" />Akat khe mih Elam pren kowi Kedalamer, Sinar pren kowi Amrafel, Ellasar pren kowi Ariuk hai Kawim pren kowi Tidal büah chowm mang mih khin khe maiawng uang own khai. <verse eid="GEN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 14:2" />Nakhowk khe nami mang tali ia mih takrüpah hanow Sawdawm marow mang Bera, Gawmawra marow mang Birsa, Adma marow mang Sinab, Zebawim marow mang Semeber hai Zoar marow mang büah kowi kowsenah khai. (Zoar marow dow Bela marow chekhai). <verse eid="GEN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 14:3" />Naiawng rakowi nami mang tanga ia dow amatni kowh siphaiuüa kowi kuala hanow Sidim lawngrawi kowi kowkowi khai. (Nami lawngrawi dow Sata Ik chekhai). <verse eid="GEN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 14:4" />Nami dowi rawn khe mih naiawngün manguüa dow laipre ning mowr mang Kedalamer nimkrüa kowi uowi büah khai. Nachenganchepaw laisum ning khe dow mang Kedalamer kowi kingküaah büah khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 14:5" />Nami paning kung kowi dow mang Kedalamer mih akeng pren mang aia kowh auiuauüa sum ia kowi hawla now cham tasen khai. Amatni cham tarü tasen mih khin khe tiama kowi kowh krumla mih marow maten kowi paw senla büah khai. Amatni dow Astarawt-Karnaim marow kowi kowh Refaimuüa kowi paw senla now nowngta büah khai, Ham marow kowi kowh Zuzimuüa kowi paw nowngta büah khai, now Save Kiriathaim marow kowi kowh Emimuüa kowi paw nowngta büah khai. <verse eid="GEN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 14:6" />Nami klen kowi Seir hungh kowi kowh Hawruüa kowi paw nowngta büah khai. Amatni dow süngrüp süngkangma ria kowi kowh El-Paran marow mowr krawi senla büah khai. <verse eid="GEN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 14:7" />Nami kung kowi dow uang plan büah hanow En-Mispat kowi kowkowi büah khai (En-Mispat dow Kades marow chekhai), now Amalekuüa kowh pren maten dow kowpowngta büah khai. Nami klen kowi Hazazawn-Tamar marow kowi kowh uowi mih Amawruüa kowi paw kownowngta büah khai.<verse eid="GEN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 14:8" />Nami kung kowi dow Sawdawm marow mang, Gawmawra marow mang, Adma marow mang, Zebawim marow mang hai Bela marow mang mih amatni kowh siphaiuüa kowi kuala hanow Sidim lawngrawi kowi kowdowk tasen büah khai. (Bela marow dow Zoar marow chekhai). <verse eid="GEN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 14:9" />Amatni kowh ransu-uüa dow Elam pren kowi kowh mang Kedalamer, Kawim pren kowi kowh mang Tidal, Sinar pren kowi kowh mang Amrafel hai Ellasar pren kowi kowh mang Ariuk büah chekhai. Tanga ia mang mih tali ia mang kowi senah khai. <verse eid="GEN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 14:10" />Sidim lawngrawi kowi dow rinaing kuam ahuma chekhai. Tasen sum kowh amatchi kowh siphaiuüa hailawm Sawdawm hai Gawmawra mang powt mih khin khe nami rinaing kuam kowi mih dowh büah ne khai. Now akeng miuüa dow hungh prakowi cham powt khai. <verse eid="GEN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 14:11" />Tasen kowi awng mih manguüa dow Sawdawm hai Gawmawra marow kowi kowh dawngthawnguan hai chakkham maten pawla pe bowk khai. <verse eid="GEN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 14:12" />Nami khin khe Abram naumow kowh chapa Lawt uowi mih paw Sawdawm marow kowi chekhai. Aia kowh dawngthawnguan maten hailawm Lawt kowi paw nami manguüa khümla now pawla khai.<verse eid="GEN 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 14:13" />Akung kowi maru lowk ia mih ku powt hanow Abram kowi nami satang dow kowphowng pe khai. (Abram dow Hebrai maru chekhai). Nami khin khe Abram uowi mih dow Amawr maru Mamre kowh sasua singh rüm ria kowi chekhai. Mamre dow Eskawl hai Aner iüah kowh taimow. Akrat pusa khin khe lowkkowlowk natakhowng kown mih Mamre büah tainau hown Abram kowh laikham uowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 14:14" />Abram dow anaumow chapa Lawt kowi khümla mih satang ta hown akrowksang aia kim kowi kowh dia mih naruüa tasen kiakma miuüa kowi pawla 318 ia now kowkrawi dowk tasen khai. Amatni dow Dan marow mowr ransu-uüa kowi kowkrawi senah khai. <verse eid="GEN 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 14:15" />Abram mih aia kowh maru-uüa kowi changah pre sum thum khai, now uar-e khe kowsenah büah hanow ransu-uüa kowi nowngta büah khai. Amatni dow Damaska tawngphak pra kowh Hawba marow mowr ransu-uüa kowi kowkrawi senah khai. <verse eid="GEN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 14:16" />Aia dow ransu-uüa pawla mih uanh maten uang plan pawla khai, now anaumow chapa Lawt kowi paw aia kowh dawngthawnguan hailawm uang plan pawla khai. Nami klen kowi ransu-uüa khümla mih masiuüa hawmh hai akeng miuüa kowi paw uang lawngla khai.<verse eid="GEN 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abram kowi Melkizedek peah prasi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 14:17" />Mang Kedalamer hai akeng pren manguüa hown tasen awng kung kowi dow Abram mih uang plan mang khai bowt. Nami khin khe Abram hown nauang takrum kownkow Sawdawm marow mang mih Save lawngrawi kowi uang khai. (Save Lawngrawi dow Mang Lawngrawi chekhai). <verse eid="GEN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 14:18" />Now Salem marow mang Melkizedek paw kawm hai grep tui uang pawla now Abram kowi uang peah khai. Melkizedek dow lang kri lang kraing mih Thurai kowh <char style="w">uamow</char> chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 14:19" />Aia dow Abram kowi peah prasi se tek pe mih, “Mukuang hai lusa thawp mih lang kro mih Thurai dow pacham pe en prasi lah. <verse eid="GEN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 14:20" />Ransu-uüa hown tasen mih khin khe pe awng en mih lang kro mih Thurai dow akiow pacham uowi lah,” pakhai. Nahanow Abram dow aia krawi klanah mih uan maten hownia hamüt bak kowi abak mih Melkizedek kowi peah khai.<verse eid="GEN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 14:21" />Nami kung kowi Sawdawm marow mang tek pe Abram mih, “Dawngthawnguan maten dow en paw taih. Nachenganchepaw ang kowh maru-uüa kowi plan peta ang bowk diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 14:22" />Nachenganchepaw Sawdawm mang kowi Abram tek pe mih, “Mukuang hai lusa thawp mih lang kro mih Thurai ming hown chawk bawng se ang takham khowk. <verse eid="GEN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 14:23" />En kowh uanh maten, en kowh lasin aiangchow paw, en kowh phanaikhawk leng lowkchow paw tawngpaw ang napaw kown nadowi. ‘Abram kureng mih dow ang kowh dawngthawnguan hown chekhai,’ pami en naia tekla dowi kownkow maiawng ang takham mih chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 14:24" />Ang kowh maru-uüa chala khamla mih klen kowi tawngpaw ang paw en dowi bowt tham; tawkche ang hown kowh tawi mih Aner, Eskawl hai Mamre büah kowi amatni kowh vüi bak pe pawah diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 14:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="GEN 15" />
  <para style="s">Abram vüi Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 15:1" />Nami kung kowi dow <char style="w">mukmang</char> kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Abram mih, “Abram, hangkow kram diah. Ang mih en kowh <char style="w">kawngma</char> chekhai; en kowi dow ang nalawng en reng kown, now en kowh <char style="w">awmrawm sung</char> dow akri akraingma naown kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 15:2" />Nachenganchepaw Abram tek pe mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, matawng tak chow en nape ang kown? Ang kowh dow chah paw uowi dowi. Ang kowng kung kowi ang kowh dawngthawnguan nata powng kown mih dow Damaska marow hownia kowh Eliezer chowtaih. <verse eid="GEN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 15:3" />Ang kowi dow en pe ka ang chah dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ang kim kowi kowh nar lowk ia mih chowtaih ang kowng kung kowi ang kowh dawngthawnguan nata powng kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 15:4" />Nakhowk khe Abram kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Aia mih en kowh dawngthawnguan naka powng kown nadowi. En kowh dawngthawnguan napowng kown mih dow en matia kowh chapa chowtaih,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 15:5" />Nami kung kowi dow prang kowi hawla now Abram kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Kuang prakowi awr mü diah. En che ia now awr mih krek sam rüa madiah. En krungchakuüa paw awr mih krek iawng nowng rüaah dowi mowr nakawm kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 15:6" />Abram dow CHAKRAMANG laiklow owm khai. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih Abram kowi <char style="w">achinawmma</char> mih maru padow tuakah khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 15:7" />Now Abram kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Nami pren nape en kownkow Kaldaiuüa pren kowi kowh Ur marow hownia uang lawtla en mih CHAKRAMANG ang chowbowt,” pape khai. <verse eid="GEN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 15:8" />Nachenganchepaw Abram klangah mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, mami pren en nape ang ngengche kown pami tawng iawng chow ang natukah kown?” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 15:9" />Abram kowi CHAKRAMANG plan tek pe mih, “Achi natatow sangbowk laitawm lowk kown. Naiawng rakowi sum ning mih chia iia apum, sum ning mih rua iia apum hai sum ning mih ruapurla apum ang tut-e uang pawla diah. Nami klen kowi kaurawng uatur hai kimtawn uatur chah paw uang pawla lowk chi diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 15:10" />Now Abram dow CHAKRAMANG tek iawng chang khai bowt. Aia dow naiawngün bowkbowk mih uang pawla hanow lowkchow lowkchow dawnglang taliti kowi praah khai. Nami aia praah mih dow pre prakowi akra akrachow towah khai. Tawkche uakling pre buk mih kowi dow aia prala dowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 15:11" />Nakhowk khe naiawngün chak uak luk kowi mih <char style="w">langta</char> hawmh uang chawp khai. Tawkche nami langta hawmh kowi Abram hawt prütta khai. <verse eid="GEN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 15:12" />Now sat kup ngialia mih khin khe dow Abram mih amüi khai. Aia müi dih thüm khe aia luk kowi mih kramra uowima mih uariiu uang takhu khai. <verse eid="GEN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 15:13" />Nakhowk khe Abram kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “En krungchakuüa mih akeng pren kowi nacham uowi kown. Nakowi mih prenlang maru iawng hai 400 ning mowr nar kowi nauowi büah kown. Nami khin khe amatni mih lainowmma nangare kown. Mami laiklow dow en mih tukah ngengche diah. <verse eid="GEN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 15:14" />Nachenganchepaw amatni kowi kowh towah nar mih chenchapuüa kowi ang naripah kown. Nami kung kowi dow amatni mih nami pren hownia nauang lawt büah kown, now nakowi kowh dawngthawnguan paw ahuma nauang pawla büah kown. <verse eid="GEN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 15:15" />Nachenganchepaw nami dowi rawn khe ning ahuma en nasing tak kown, now thaulangma en nakowng hanow narik ka tadupra kown. Nahanow en pipu-uüa tut-e en natawi uowi bowt kown. <verse eid="GEN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 15:16" />Now tali chowng mih en krungchak maru-uüa dow mami pren kowi nauang plan büah iawk kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nakowi kowh uowi mih Amawruüa mih nami khin khe tak nakala ripra pat mih lup ngak nachang büah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 15:17" />Nami kung kowi sat kup kowh uar aiiuma mih khin khe khü ngawnglawng mih taping hai lün pluplup mih maitawng uang tatüng khai. Naiawngün dow pre prakowi kowh akra akrachow towah mih asadua chaknga takra iawng powt khai. <verse eid="GEN 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 15:18" />Nami ni khe Abram vüi CHAKRAMANG tow pe sangbowk laitawm mih, “Aigupta pren kowi kowh aw hownia Iufratis awma mowr mami pren maten mih en krungchakuüa kowi ang peta khowk. <verse eid="GEN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 15:19" />Nami ang pe en mih pren kowi uowi miuüa dow Kenuüa, Kenisuüa, Kadmawnuüa, <verse eid="GEN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 15:20" />Hituüa, Perizuüa, Refaimuüa, <verse eid="GEN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 15:21" />Amawruüa, Kananuüa, Girgasuüa hai Jebusuüa chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 15:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="GEN 16" />
  <para style="s">Sara kowh narma Hagar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 16:1" />Abram kowh masi Sara dow ka chah dowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw aia kowh dow Aigupta prenchak Hagar pami narma uowi lowk ia. <verse eid="GEN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 16:2" />Abram kowi Sara tek pe mih, “Sünta diah, ang kowi dow CHAKRAMANG pe ka ang chah dowi bowt chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ang kowh narma hown kowtaphua taiua diah. Nami hownia ang tawi ia ka chah lowk ia tarawng,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:2">Now Abram dow amasi Sara kowh laiklow nauta khai. <verse eid="GEN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 16:3" />Naiawng rakowi Sara mih aia kowh narma Hagar kowi ahua Abram hown pe taphua taiuaah khai. Nami dow Kanan pren kowi hamüt ning Abraham uowi kung kowi kowh phaw mih chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 16:4" />Abram hown taphua taiua kung kowi Hagar dow kum nau khai bowt. Hagar dow Sara kowh narma taih chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw aia kum nau mih tatuk hanow aia dow Sara kowi nüah klowkah dowi bowt. <verse eid="GEN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 16:5" />Nami tuk hanow Sara tek pe Abram mih, “Hagar nü ang klowk ang dowi mih dow en rakowi chekhai. Aia tut-e dow ang chowdiah kowchin en. Tawkchedow aia kum nau mih tatuk hanow aia mih nü ang klowk ang dowi bowt chekhai. CHAKRAMANG mih achi pre ia kowi mia chow tawi mih pacham chet achi tara lah,” pape khai. <verse eid="GEN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 16:6" />Nakhowk khe Abram tek pe Sara mih, “Sünta, en kowh narma dow en low kowi kowh uowi mih chowtaih, aia luk kowi dow en kow kowi iung iawng en nowng chang chekhai,” pape khai. Nahanow Sara dow Hagar kowi lainowmma changah anowng apowng khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi Hagar mih Sara hownia cham powt khai.<verse eid="GEN 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ismael uang dia mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 16:7" />Nahanow Hagar dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh tuikuam ria kowi kowtowm khai. Nami tuikuam dow Sur pami arah pra kowh mangla mih tiaprek re-e chekhai. Nami re-e CHAKRAMANG kowh <char style="w">kramamu</char> mih aia tut-e uang tatüng pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 16:8" />Kramamu tek pe mih, “Sara kowh narma Hagar, tawng hownia chow en uang, now tawng chow en cham kowi?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 16:8">Now Hagar klangah mih, “Ang dow Sara kowh narma. Sara hownia ang powt mih chowbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 16:9" />Nami laiklow tata now CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu tek pe mih, “En kim iah masi tut-e kowplan hanow aia low kowi kowuowi iawk diah. <verse eid="GEN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 16:10" />En krungchakuüa kowi ahuma ang nape prungah kown; amatni dow nowng rüaah dowi mowr nakawm kown. <verse eid="GEN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 16:11" />Sünta, en kum nau khai bowt. En mih napen chapa lowk ia kown. Aming dow Ismael en narük pe kown. (Nami auan dow ‘Thurai ta reng’ pami chekhai). Tawngplawng kowchow panow en krat pusa mih khin khe en kowh kar klow mih CHAKRAMANG sünta en chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 16:12" />Nachenganchepaw en kowh chapa dow kaurawng <char style="w">kawrngaramchük</char> iawng angakma naown kown; aia dow maru maten kowi nakrawi chang ransu kown, now maru maten mih aia kowi nanüla ransu kown. Aia tasin taken miuüa hownia aia dow alakma kowi nalang uowi kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 16:13" />Nami ta hanow Hagar tatuak mih, “Ming ang khet ang reng mih kowi ang khi ching mih chowbowt bow?” pakhai. Now aia hown kowh taklang mih CHAKRAMANG kowi Hagar rük pe ming mih, “En dow ming ang khet ang reng mih Thurai,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 16:14" />Naiawng rakowi nami tuikuam kowi dow Birlahai-Rawi pahai chap pe ming khai. (Nami auan dow “Khi ang mih masing Thurai kowh tuikuam” pami chekhai). Nami dow Kades marow hai Bered süng takra kowi chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 16:15" />Nami kung kowi dow Hagar mih pen chapa lowk ia khai, now achapa ming dow Ismael pahai Abram rük pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 16:16" />Ismael uang dia mih khin khe Abram dow 86 ning chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 16:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="GEN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm matra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 17:1" />Abram 99 ning khe mukmang kowi CHAKRAMANG uang tatüng pe now tek pe mih, “Abram, ang dow lowra nowngia chang mih Thurai chekhai. Ang hown taklawp taiua reng diah, now ang low iawng uowi diah. <verse eid="GEN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 17:2" />Nahanow en hown ang natow sangbowk laitawm kown, now en krungchak kowi ahuma ang nape prungah kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 17:3" />Nakhowk khe Abram mih krawng kowi tabawkah krawm hanow Thurai kowi chupah khai, now Thurai mih aia hown taklowp taklang khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 17:4" />Thurai tek pe mih, “Achi kowh sangbowk laitawm kowi ang nachang en kown mih dow maiawng: Chenchap ahuma kowh pa ang nathawp en kown. <verse eid="GEN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 17:5" />Abram (akri akraingma mih pa) padow nahaw en kown nadowi bowt; kawmat hownia now Abraham (maru kawmma kowh pa) padow nahaw en bowt kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow chenchap ahuma kowi prekche miia ang thawpta en khowk. <verse eid="GEN 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 17:6" />En krungchak kowi ahuma ang nape prungah kown. En hownia mih chenchap ahuma ang nauang pe phawah kown. Nami klen kowi en hownia mih mang paw ahuma nauang phaw kown. <verse eid="GEN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 17:7" />Mami sangbowk laitawm dow en hai ang vüi krowngchow nadowi; mami dow en kung kowi kowh nauang ta uowi kown mih en krungchakuüa vüi paw na chekhai. Mami sangbowk laitawm dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi naown kown. Ang dow en hai en kung kowi kowh nauang ta uowi kown mih en krungchakuüa kowh Thurai naown kown. <verse eid="GEN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 17:8" />Prenlang maru iawng kawmat kowh en uowiah mih Kanan pren srui dow en hai en krungchakuüa kowi ang nape enni kown; nami dow chowngchowng saksakma nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow ang nape enni kown. Ang dow enni bowkbowk kowh Thurai nachowng kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 17:9" />Nami klen kowi Thurai plan tek pe mih, “Abraham, ang kowh sangbowk laitawm mih en nachün kown takla; en hai en kung kowi kowh nauang ta uowi kown mih en kowh krungchakuüa maten paw nachün reng kown takla. <verse eid="GEN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 17:10" />En hai en kung kowi kowh nauang ta uowi kown mih en krungchakuüa nachünah kown mih sangbowk laitawm dow maiawng: Enni kachakuüa maten mih nahiahta <char style="w">khampha uanpik</char> kown takla. <verse eid="GEN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 17:11" />Enni kowh khampha uanpik mih enni nahiahta kown; nami dow enni hown ang towta sangbowk laitawm khowk pami amat müa naown kown. <verse eid="GEN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 17:12" />Kawmat hownia now kachakuüa chah maten kowi dow uang dia kung kowi raiat ni khe en nahiahta pe khampha uanpik kown. En krungchak nadowi chepaw en kim kowi kowh dia mih srui kowi dow khampha uanpik en nahiahta pe kown; prenlang maru hownia kowh en hawt ranah mih nar chepaw, en kim kowi kowh dia mih nar chepaw naiawng en nachang pe kown takla. <verse eid="GEN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 17:13" />Enni bowkbowk nahiahta khampha uanpik ngengche kown takla. Nami dow chowngchowng saksakma enni buk kowi ang kowh sangbowk laitawm nauowila kown mih amat müa chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 17:14" />Hiah khampha uanpik dowi mih kachakuüa dow ang kowh sangbowk laitawm chün dowi mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi naiawng mih kachakuüa kowi dow aia maru-uüa hownia nabatta kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isak uang dia kown mih laikham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 17:15" />Abraham kowi Thurai plan tek pe mih, “Abraham, en masi kowi Sara pahai nahawah kown nadowi bowt; Sari padow nahawah bowt kown. <verse eid="GEN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 17:16" />Aia kowi dow ang napeah prasi hanow aia hownia ang nape ka en chapa lowk ia kown. Aia kowi dow ang napeah prasi kown; aia dow chenchapuüa kowh u nauang chowng kown, now nami chenchapuüa hownia dow manguüa paw ahuma nauang uowi kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 17:17" />Now Abraham mih krawng kowi tabawkah krawm hanow Thurai kowi chupah khai. Tawkchedow ren se sakdawng hownia aia tek mih, “Ang dow ning 100 khowk. Tawng iawng chow ang nowng ka chah bowt kown chow? Sari paw ning 90 khowk. Tawng iawng chow nowng pen chah bowt kown chow?” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 17:18" />Abraham tek pe Thurai mih, “En kowh prasira hai en kham ang mih maten Ismael pacham powngla towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 17:19" />Nakhowk khe Thurai tek pe mih, “Tawng na chow! En masi Sari napen en chapa ngengche kown, now aming dow Isak en narük pe kown. (Isak pami dow ‘Ren’ pami chekhai). Ang kowh sangbowk laitawm mih Isak hown nauowi reng kown, nami sangbowk laitawm dow aia krungchakuüa hown paw chowngchowng saksakma vüi nauowi reng kown. <verse eid="GEN 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 17:20" />Now Ismael vüi en lü mih paw ang ta chekhai. Ismael kowi paw ang napeah prasi kown, now aia krungchakuüa kowi paw ahuma ang nape prungah kown. Aia paw laipre chen kowi kowh prekche miia naown kown, now aia hownia paw chenchap aiukma ang nathawpah kown. <verse eid="GEN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 17:21" />Nachenganchepaw ang kowh sangbowk laitawm dow Isak hown chowtaih nauowi reng kown. Aia kowi dow ning thowi kowh maiawng khin khe Sari napenah kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 17:22" />Abraham hown ki taklang kung kowi dow Thurai mih kuang prakowi awr pün khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 17:23" />Now Abraham dow Thurai tek pe mih powm iawng nami ni khe Ismael kowi hiah pe khampha uanpik khai. Nami klen kowi aia ranah mih nar aia kim kowi kowh dia mih hai aia kim kowi kowh uowi mih kachakuüa maten kowi hiah pe khampha uanpik khai. <verse eid="GEN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 17:24" />Aia kowh khampha uanpik hiah mih khin khe Abraham mih 99 ning khowk chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 17:25" />Now aia kowh chapa Ismael dow laisum ning khowk chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 17:26" />Amatchi pachowh hiah khampha uanpik mih dow pani sang chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 17:27" />Nami klen kowi aia kim kowi kowh dia miuüa hai prenlang maru hownia kowh hawt ranah mih hailawm, aia kim kowi kowh uowi mih kachakuüa maten kowi paw aia hiah pe khampha uanpik khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="GEN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Abraham kowi Thurai kham pe lai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 18:1" />Mamre kowh sasua singh rüm re-e Abraham uowi mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG mih aia tut-e uang tatüng pe khai. Abraham mih ni ür thüm khe kowh sat den dawng kowi aia tangbung plawt kowi chowm phülü chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 18:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="GEN 18:2-3" />Nami khin khe Abraham mih awr tang mü hanow aia hown atawnchow re-e maru iowng sum ia mih awr khi khai. Nami khita hown akrowksang aia dow kowchupah kownkow tangbung plawt hownia awr iowm khai. Aia dow krawng kowi tabawk krawm now chupah se tek pe mih, “Sünta büa diah, enni che sakraula ang hanow sakrauma hown enni kowh nar kowi hauang riala diah. <verse eid="GEN 18:2-3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 18:4" />Ang kowpaw enni rut sau khawk sau müa tui tak; sau rut sau khawk büah now mami singh klim kowi tanai büa diah. <verse eid="GEN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 18:5" />Enni kowh nar tut-e enni uang khowk chedow ang kowpaw enni chakkham ditchow tak. Chala khamla prowng khe phai mang büah iang,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:5">Now nami maru sum ia tek pe mih, “Lainowmma iung, en tek iawng chang diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 18:6" />Nahanow Abraham dow alenma tangbung lak kowi kowkup khai. Aia dow Sari kowi tek pe mih, “Sala aiukma mih hownia kawmdi lang iung mih pawah dawnglang now alenma thawpla kawm bowk diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 18:7" />Now Abraham dow chia hawmh prakowi kowiowm hanow kow lang iung mih chia chah uang pawla apum khai. Nami chia chah dow anar kowi peah khai. Aia dow anar kowi changah tua hanow alenma engah rowngah kownkow tek pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 18:8" />Nami kung kowi dow Abraham mih chaknga, iawn tui bawiia hai iawn tui sing uang pawla pe now amatni kowi uang then pe khai. Amatni cha mih khin khe Abraham dow amatni ria-e singh klim kowi tawi iowng khai. <verse eid="GEN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 18:9" />Amatni dow Abraham kowi lüntaah mih, “En masi Sari tawng kowi chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:9">Now Abraham tek pe mih, “Tangbung lak kowi iu,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 18:10" />Nakhowk khe maru sum ia mih pungmadawng kowi kowh uowi mih CHAKRAMANG lowk ia tek pe mih, “Ning thowi kowh maiawng khin khe en tut-e ang naplan uang ngengche kown. Nami khin khe dow en masi Sari kowh chah nauowi lowk ia kown,” pakhai. Naiawngün laiklow dow Sari mih Abraham kung kowi kowh tangbung plawt hownia awr tawi ta bowk chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 18:11" />Nakhowk khe Abraham hai Sari iüah dow lainowmma lawngtang khai bowt. Sari kowh dow kala chah kown mih ning uowi dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 18:12" />Naiawng rakowi ren se sakdawng kowi Sari tek mih, “Ang lawngtang mih nowm khowk, now ang hua paw le lawngtang mih nowm khowk. Taphua taiua kown mih piawra ang naplan ka iawk kown chekhai bow?” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 18:13" />Nahanow CHAKRAMANG tek pe Abraham mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow Sari tuk ren khai? Ang lawngtang khowk pache ang naka chah kown tak bow pami tawngplawng kowchow tuk tek khai? <verse eid="GEN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 18:14" />CHAKRAMANG tut-e nowng changah dowi mih lup tawngpaw uowi dowi chekhai. Ning thowi kowh maiawng khin khe en tut-e ang naplan uang ngengche iawk kown. Nami khin khe dow Sari kowh chah nauowi lowk ia kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 18:15" />Now Sari dow kram kowh tada se tek mih, “Ang ren dowi dow,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:15">Nachepaw CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Tawng ren dowi chow, en ren owh!” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawdawm marow vüi Abraham lü mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 18:16" />Nami maru sum ia dow nami hownia awr rü hanow alowngma mih rah prakowi kowkowi khai, now Sawdawm marow pra iu mü khai. Abraham mih amatni kowi tawi saah kownkow amatni hown alak sangrum mowr kowtawi khai. <verse eid="GEN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 18:17" />Now CHAKRAMANG aiamat tatek mih, “Ang nau changah kown mih lup Abraham kowi ang data pe kown bow? <verse eid="GEN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 18:18" />Abraham hai aia krungchakuüa dow akri akraingma mih hai akürma mih chenchap nauang chowng kown mih chekhai. Aia hownia dow lusa kowi kowh chenchap maten naka prasi kown. <verse eid="GEN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 18:19" />Ang CHAKRAMANG, aia kowi dow ang lang kloah mih chekhai. Aia chapauüa hai aia krungchakuüa naringkaw ang kownkow hai nachang lup iung hanow ang naukrang iawng nauowila kown mih natüngsangah kownkow aia kowi dow ang lang kloah mih chekhai. Naiawng che aia chapauüa hai aia krungchakuüa chang khai hanow aia lawnguan kowi kowh ang CHAKRAMANG tekta khowk mih dow ang nachang pe bowk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 18:20" />Nahanow CHAKRAMANG tek pe Abraham mih, “Sawdawm hai Gawmawra marow kowi <char style="w">kingküa</char> miuüa klow lainowmma hu khai bowt, now amatni kowh angak krang paw lainowmma suiiai kaniai khowk chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 18:21" />Naiawng rakowi ang taah mih iawng amatni ngah nowm chünchü, ngah dowi chünchü ang kowmüah tak; ngah mih ngah dowi mih achima tuk kown ang nau,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 18:22" />Nami khin khe pre ia mih dow kung prakowi plan hanow Sawdawm marow prakowi kowkowi khai. Nachenganchepaw Abraham dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi ta iowng khai. <verse eid="GEN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 18:23" />Now Abraham mih kowtatawnah now CHAKRAMANG kowi tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG, maru ngakuüa hown <char style="w">achinawmma</char> mih maru-uüa kowi paw en piakla bowk kown chekhai bow? <verse eid="GEN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 18:24" />Sawdawm marow kowi achinawmma mih maru 50 ia uowi khai e dow nami 50 ia rakowi nami marow kowi en lawtah dowi tham bow? <verse eid="GEN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 18:25" />Maru ngakuüa hown achinawmma mih maru-uüa kowi mapaw en ia piakla dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow maru ngakuüa hown achinawmma mih maru-uüa kowi akat sang en piakah kown? Naiawng mapaw en ia piak dowi chekhai. Palusama kowi kowh tara chet miia dow tara nowm chet takla,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 18:26" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Sawdawm marow kowi che achinawmma mih maru 50 ia ang khi khai hanow nami maru-uüa rakowi marow mih ang piakah dowi tham,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 18:27" />Now Abraham tek pe mih, “Mü diah, ang dow dinchow hown kowh thawpah mih maru chowtaih. Nachenganchepaw sakkraingma hown CHAKRAMANG ang plan tek en iawk tak. <verse eid="GEN 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 18:28" />Nakowi che achinawmma mih maru 50 ia kowi 5 ia uowi dowi e dow marow mih en napiakta kown bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:28">CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Nakowi che achinawmma mih maru 45 ia ang khi hanow nami marow ang piakta dowi tham,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 18:29" />Now Abraham plan tek pe iawk mih, “Nakowi che achinawmma mih maru 40 iachow e dow nami marow en napiakta kown bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:29">CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Nami 40 ia rakowi nami marow ang piakta dowi tham,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 18:30" />Now Abraham plan tek pe iawk mih, “CHAKRAMANG hang kunmarau diah, ang plan tek iawk tak; nakowi che achinawmma mih maru 30 iachow e dow nami marow en piakta kown bow?” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:30">CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Nakowi che achinawmma mih maru 30 ia ang khi hanow nami marow ang piakta dowi tham,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 18:31" />Now Abraham plan tek iawk mih, “CHAKRAMANG tut-e sakkraingma hown ang tekta khowk chedow ang plan tek iawk tak. Nakowi che achinawmma mih maru 20 iachow e dow nami marow en napiakta kown bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:31">CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Nami 20 ia rakowi nami marow mih ang piakta dowi tham,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 18:32" />Now Abraham plan tek iawk mih, “CHAKRAMANG hang kunmarau diah, ang plan lünta en akatchow tak. Nakowi che achinawmma mih maru hamüt iachow e dow nami marow en napiakta kown bow?” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 18:32">CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Nami hamüt ia rakowi nami marow mih ang piakta dowi tham,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 18:33" />Abraham hown ki taklang hanow CHAKRAMANG dow powt khai, now Abraham paw aia kim prakowi plan khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 18:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="GEN 19" />
  <para style="s">Sawdawm hai Gawmawra marow kowh angak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 19:1" />Nami ni sat kowi prakowi kramamu pre ia mih Sawdawm marow kowi kowtowm khai. Nami khin khe Lawt mih marow <char style="w">tapplawt</char> re-e hawt chowm phülü khai. Nami kramamu pre ia kowi khita now Lawt mih awr rü khai, now krawng kowi tabawkah krawm se chupah khai. <verse eid="GEN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 19:2" />Kramamu pre ia kowi Lawt tek pe mih, “<char style="w">Chakramang</char>, ang dow enchi kowh nar chekhai. Sakrauma hown ang kim kowi tawi pün iüa diah, now sau bawng sau pang now aiak dow ang kim kowi iak iüa diah towbowt. Tharau khe mur mangah iüah now na towbowt,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 19:2">Kramamu pre ia klangah mih, “Kim kowi iak dowi bowt tak ba. Marow kowi kowh tiama ret kowi angching cham iak nak kown towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 19:3" />Nachenganchepaw natawi iak ngengche kownkow Lawt kükah rengreng rakowi amatchi dow Lawt kim kowi tawi pün khai. Now the pe <char style="w">tuah</char> dowi mih kawm hai chak iung kham iung ahuma Lawt kamrüt pe khai, now cha büah kham büah khai. <verse eid="GEN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 19:4" />Nachenganchepaw mawk büah dowi rawnchow tak khe Sawdawm marow kowi kowh klanguüa hawmh hai lawngtanguüa mih uang umta kim lut khai. <verse eid="GEN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 19:5" />Amatni dow Lawt kowi hawah now tek pe mih, “En kim kowi kowh uang iak mih pinsüa pre ia tawng kowi chow? Amatchi kowi uang awr lawtla now anging tut-e uang pawla diah. Nami kachakuüa pre ia hown anging taphua taiua tak,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 19:6" />Nami khin khe Lawt mih kowlawt hanow nami maru-uüa tut-e kowkowi khai, now kimplawt mih büngta khai. <verse eid="GEN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 19:7" />Lawt tek pe mih, “Tainau-uüa low, sakrauma hown naiawng mih lup ngak hang chang büa diah. <verse eid="GEN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 19:8" />Sünta, mia iawng mih kachakuüa hown paw taiua dowi tak mih ang kowh chama uowi pre ia. Ang kowh chama pre ia kowi ang uang pawla enni kown towbowt. Ang chamauüa hown enni nau iawng chang büa diah. Tawkche pinsüa pre ia luk kowi dow tawngpaw hangkow chang büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow kowiüah dow ang kim kowi kowh uang tatung tanim mih pinsüa chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 19:9" />Nachenganchepaw nami maru-uüa tek pe Lawt mih, “Cham lang süt. Tiama kowi hauang uowi. En matia khowm padow akeng pren hownia kowh uang mih maru taih. Anging luk kowi tawngpaw en tawi tekra uowi dowi. Pinsüa pre ia kowi lak-e kawmat en hown chowbowt anging lang chang lup ngak hu kown,” pape khai. Now Lawt kowi mih nawtah chowtlowt büah khai, now nakhue kimbüng büah kownkow kowtatawn büah khai.<verse eid="GEN 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 19:10" />Nakhowk khe pinsüa pre ia mih uaiuow kimplawt hanow kim lak hownia Lawt kowi uaiküngta khai, now kimplawt dow büngta iüah khai. <verse eid="GEN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 19:11" />Nahanow nami pinsüa pre ia mih prang kowi kowh uowi mih maru maten kowi duta pe mik bowk khai. Nami maru-uüa dow aiuk asowm miapaw khi mik dowi bowt rakowi kimplawt uowi rah tuk büah dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawdawm marow hownia Lawt powt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 19:12" />Pinsüa pre ia tek pe Lawt mih, “Mami marow kowi en kowh chapauüa, chamauüa, mawkchowuüa hai tasin taken mih uowi ne bow? Uowi now amatni kowi pawla hanow mami marow hownia kawmat powtla diah. <verse eid="GEN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 19:13" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow mami marow napiakta kownkow kamrütma hown angching uang mih chekhai. Mami marow kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi kingküa mih klow CHAKRAMANG tut-e lainowmma hu khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi mami marow napiakta kownkow aia uang chin angching mih chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 19:14" />Nami tata hanow Lawt dow cham krawi tarü khai bowt. Now aia kowh mawkchow khamuüa kowi krawi tek pe mih, “Sakkrowng diah! Mami marow hownia alenma powt büa diah. Mami marow CHAKRAMANG napiakta kown chowbowt,” pape khai. Nachenganchepaw amawkchow khamuüa dow uang ngawkah mih naown taih pahai tatuak büah khai.<verse eid="GEN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 19:15" />Now uar thowi ria prakowi dow kramamu pre ia mih Lawt kowi krowkah khai bowt. Kramamu tek pe mih, “Len nown. En masi hai en kowh chama pre ia kowi pawla now mami hownia lawt büa diah. Nadowi now mami marow kowi kowh ripra enni luk kowi paw uang kla now enni natawi piak kown chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 19:16" />Tawkchedow Lawt mih lainowmma awi-ai khai. Nachenganchepaw aia kowi dow CHAKRAMANG sakrauah reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi kramamu pre ia mih aia, amasi hai achama pre ia rut kowi dowkla now marow uat prakowi küngla khai. <verse eid="GEN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 19:17" />Amatni bowkbowk kowi lawtla kung kowi kramamu lowk ia tek pe mih, “Sing kown nau now powt büa diah. Kung prakowi hangkow müla diah, now anaima mih rah kowi hangkow tanaila büa diah. Hungh kowi cham powt büa diah; nadowi now enni paw nakowng kown chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 19:18" />Nakhowk khe Lawt tek mih, “Nadowi chakramang, naiawng nadowi. <verse eid="GEN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 19:19" />Ang dow enchi kowh nar chowtaih. Nachenganchepaw enchi saksing sana ang khai. Lainowmma enchi saksing sana ang rakowi enchi pe plai ang mih chekhai. Nachenganchepaw hungh kowi dow ang ia powt dowi tham. Hungh kowi ang kowting dowi rawn nami phih mih ang luk kowi nauang kla tarawng, now ang nakowng kown chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 19:20" />Mü diah, pai iow paimi re-e atawnchow mih marow uowi lowk. Chah paw achalachow taih. Achalachow chepaw ang hai ang kimchak dow nasing kown taih. Paimi marow kowi pe powt ang towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 19:21" />Nakhowk khe kramamu tek pe mih, “Naiawng chepaw iung. En tek iawng ang chang en kown towbowt. Paimi marow dow ang napiakla kown nadowi. <verse eid="GEN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 19:22" />Tawkchedow paimi marow kowi alenma kowpowt diah. Pai kowi en kowting dowi mowr dow tawngpaw ang nowng chang dowi chekhai,” pape khai. (Lawt kowh laiklow rakowi nami marow ming dow Zoar pahai rük pe khai. Zoar pami dow achalachow pami chekhai).<verse eid="GEN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawdawm hai Gawmawra marow piak mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 19:23" />Zoar marow kowi Lawt kowtowm mih khin khe dow sat uang lawt khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 19:24" />CHAKRAMANG dow Sawdawm hai Gawmawra marow luk kowi mukuang hownia uangchak iawng hai napawksi maih lün pluplup mih hown mairing aringma mih uang pe klaah khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 19:25" />CHAKRAMANG dow nami marow pre buk hai aria aret kowi kowh dowm nai maten paw piakta khai. Marow kowi kowh maru maten hai krawng kowi kowh ru mih chap maten paw piakta bowk chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 19:26" />Nami khin khe Lawt kowh masi dow marow kowi tawng chow own mih nakhila kownkow aia kung prakowi hai ngeu khai, now nami hown akrowksang aia dow hing chowng awisa klu khai.<verse eid="GEN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 19:27" />Abraham mih auai rau murpa awr rü hanow CHAKRAMANG hown taklang khe kowh aia iowngra re-e kowkowi khai. <verse eid="GEN 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 19:28" />Nami hownia aia dow Sawdawm hai Gawmawra marow hown aria aret kowi kowh dowm nai maten prakowi krawi tang mü khai. Nakhowk khe naiawngün hownia üa towk maikhük iawng maikhük chai lawmlawm mih aia khi khai.<verse eid="GEN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 19:29" />Naiawng hai Lawt uowiah mih dowm nai kowi kowh marow maten dow Thurai piakta khai. Nami khin khe Lawt kowi Thurai lang henta mih dow Abraham kowi tuakla rakowi chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amawn hai Moab uang dia mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 19:30" />Zoar kowi uam uowi dowi bowt rakowi Lawt mih achama pre ia kowi pawla now hungh prakowi cham powt khai. Now hungh kowi kowh puk uowi lowk mih kowi cham uowi büah khai. <verse eid="GEN 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 19:31" />Pakat khe Lawt kowh chama ta mih anaumow kowi tek pe mih, “Apa lawngtang khai bowt. Mami re-e dow lusa rirow iawng nachawng achi kown mih kachakuüa miapaw uowi dowi. <verse eid="GEN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 19:32" />Naiawng rakowi chu, apa kowi achi pe khamah grep tui lah; achi pe puaah hanow achi phuaah iuaah lah. Nahanow apa hownia achi nakum nau now achi naka chah kown towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 19:33" />Naiawng rakowi nami powm iawng nami iak-e khe a-pa kowi pe khamah grep tui iüah hanow pe puaah iüah khai. Now achama lang ta mih apa hown tawi taiua mawk khai bowt. Nachenganchepaw achama uang tawi mawk mih hai achama powt mih Lawt dow tawngpaw tuk dowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 19:34" />Now auai ni paw lang sawi mih kowi lang ta mih tek pe mih, “Sünta. Maiak dow apa hown ang tawi taiua mawk khowk. Nami powm iawng aiak paw achi pe puaah hanow en kowtawi taiua mawk diah. Nahanow apa hownia achi nakum nau now achi naka chah kown towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 19:35" />Naiawng rakowi nami powm iawng nami iak paw a-pa kowi pe khamah grep tui iüah hanow pe puaah iüah khai. Now achama lang sawi mih a-pa hown kowtawi taiua mawk khai bowt. Nachenganchepaw achama uang tawi mawk mih hai achama powt mih Lawt dow tawngpaw tuk dowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 19:36" />Naiawng hai Lawt kowh chama pre ia dow a-pa hown kum nau khai. <verse eid="GEN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 19:37" />Nami kung kowi chama lang ta mih dow pen kachakuüa chah lowk ia khai. Achapa ming dow Moab pahai aia rük pe khai. Aia dow kawmat kowh Moabuüa kowi prekah cheah miia chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 19:38" />Nami kung kowi chama lang sawi mih paw pen kachakuüa chah lowk ia khai. Achapa ming dow Ben-Ammi pahai aia rük pe khai. Aia dow kawmat kowh Amawnuüa kowi prekah cheah miia chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 19:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="GEN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Abraham hai mang Abimelek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 20:1" />Abraham dow Mamre hownia mrawkphak pra kowh Negeb pape mih süngrüp süngkangma prakowi kowpowt khai. Aia dow nakowi kowh Kades marow hai Sur pami arah takra kowi kowuowi khai. Nami kung kowi dow aia mih Gerar marow kowi kowuowi khai. <verse eid="GEN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 20:2" />Gerar marow kowi uowi mih khin khe amasi Sari kowi atuamow padow Abraham mih plan khamah khai iawk. Naiawng rakowi Gerar marow kowi kowh mang Abimelek dow kowchin maru pre sum ia now Sari kowi aia tut-e uang pawla khai. <verse eid="GEN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 20:3" />Nachenganchepaw Thurai mih iak-e Abimelek mang lak kowi uang tatüng pe khai, now tek pe mih, “Nami masiuüa kowi en uang pawla khai rakowi en nakowng kown mih tawn khowk. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en uang pawla mih masiuüa kowh dow ahua uowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 20:4" />Nachenganchepaw mang Abimelek mih Sari hown taphua taiua dowi tak chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG, ang chang ngak dowi diah. Nachenganchepaw ang hai ang maru-uüa kowi en napiakta kown chekhai bow? <verse eid="GEN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 20:5" />Abraham matia ngengche chowbowt tek ang mih, ‘Mami masiuüa dow ang tuamow taih,’ pakhai. Now masiuüa paw tek ang mih, ‘Mami kachakuüa dow ang rakma taih,’ pakhai. Mami lup dow saktuak iungma hown kowh ang chang mih chekhai. Ang dow tawngpaw angakma mih lup chang dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 20:6" />Now mang lak kowi Thurai tek pe Abimelek mih, “Ang tuk, nami lup mih saktuak iungma hown kowh en chang mih chekhai. Nakingküala ang kown mih lup ngak dow ang pe chang en dowi; naiawng rakowi aia hown ang pe taphua taiua en dowi mih chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 20:7" />Naiawng kowh kawmat aia kowi mih ahua tut-e kowsata diah. Ahua dow <char style="w">risi</char> chekhai. Aia dow en vüi kowi nachup en Thurai hanow en kowh asak mih naplai kown taih. Tawkchedow en che kowsa pe dowi kowh chalow now en hai en maru-uüa lowk iachow paw kowngra hownia naia plai kown nadowi; mami laiklow sak kowi towah reng diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 20:8" />Nahanow mang Abimelek mih murpa awr rü now mang lak kowi kowh aia khi-ah mih maten aia naruüa kowi hawah now lawp pe khai. Nami ta hanow aia naruüa mih lainowmma kram khai. <verse eid="GEN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 20:9" />Abraham kowi Abimelek hawah now tek pe mih, “Anging hown maiawng mih lup tawngplawng kowchow en tuk chang khai? Tawng angak chow ang changta khai kowh ang hai ang pren luk kowi naiawng khowt mih <char style="w">aprek</char> iuk pache en uang pe klaah khai? Naiawng mih lup en nachang kown mih mapaw taka dowi chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 20:10" />Mang Abimelek plan tek pe mih, “Tawng chow en ka tuak kowh naiawng mih lup en tuk chang khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 20:11" />Nakhowk khe Abraham tek pe mih, “Mami re-e kowh maru-uüa Thurai kowi mapaw kram dowi tham padow ang ka tuak khai; amatni mih ang masi kowi napawta ang now ang kowi dow nasaita ang kown chekhai padow ang ka tuak khai. <verse eid="GEN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 20:12" />Sari dow ang masi chepaw ang tuamow tawng chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow angching kowh u lang chepaw pa dow katsang chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 20:13" />Thurai mih apa kim hownia uang lawtla ang hanow akeng pren kowi cham chin ang khai. Nami khin khe ang masi kowi ang tek pe mih, ‘En sakrau ang mih krang maiawng tüng ang diah. Lowra kowi achi cham kowi mih khin khe ang kowi mih en rak pahai kham ang reng diah,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 20:14" />Nahanow Abimelek mih Abraham kowi ruapur ün, chia ün hai narma narla ün ahuma peah khai. Now amasi Sari kowi paw planta pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 20:15" />Abraham kowi aia tek pe mih, “Mü diah, ang kowh paprenma dow en pur kowi uowi hüah khowk. En nau mih re-e krawi uowi diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 20:16" />Now Sari kowi Abimelek tek pe mih, “Sünta diah, en rakma kowi ang peta tai 1,000 iun khowk. Nami dow en luk kowi kowh phaw mih lawnguan kowi en maru-uüa mih hangkow pacham tuak naklak lah pakowh chekhai. Nahanow en kowh dow tawngpaw atawi uowi dowi pami maru bowkbowk natuk en kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="GEN 20:17-18" />Abraham masi Sari kowi Abimelek pawta pe khai rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih Abimelek kimchak masiuüa maten kowi pe hing kaah chah dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Abraham mih Abimelek vüi chup pe Thurai khai. Nahanow Thurai mih Abimelek, amasi hai aia narmauüa kowi pe iungah khai. Now amatni dow plan nowng ka chah khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 20:17-18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="GEN 21" />
  <para style="s">Isak uang dia mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 21:1" />Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG mih aia tekta khowk iawng Sari kowi peah prasi khai, now aia khamta khowk mih iawng Sari kowi chang pe khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 21:2" />Naiawng rakowi Abraham alawngtangma khowk khe Sari mih kum nau hanow pen pe chapa khai. Amatchi kowi Thurai bowk pe mih akhin kowi amatchi kowh chah dow uang dia khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 21:3" />Now achapa ming dow Isak pahai Abraham rük pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 21:4" />Now Abraham mih Thurai ana pek iawng achapa Isak kowi riat ni khe hiah pe khampha uanpik khai. <verse eid="GEN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 21:5" />Achapa Isak uang dia mih khin khe Abraham kowh ning dow 100 khowk chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 21:6" />Now Sari tek mih, “Thurai mih pe awmrawm ang hai pe ren lawtla ang khai bowt, tawi ta miuüa maten paw natawi awmrawm hai natawi renla ang bowt kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 21:7" />Nami klen kowi Sari tek mih, “Ang natawi ka iawn nau kown mih Abraham kowi miapaw nowng tek pe dowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw lawngtang prakowi ang tawi ka pe chapa khai lowmow,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 21:8" />Now Isak mih awr iuk awr sown rürü khai bowt, now aia kowh iawn kham towng mih ni khe Abraham mih Isak vüi pawi aiukma chang pe khai.<verse eid="GEN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hagar hai Ismail kowi prütta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 21:9" />Akat khe achapa Isak kowi anarma Hagar kowh chapa Ismael khareah mih Sari khita khai. <verse eid="GEN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 21:10" />Nami khita hanow Abraham kowi Sari tek pe mih, “Achapa hailawm paimi narma kowi prütta diah. Ang kowh narma chapa mih ang kowh chapa Isak hown tawi ia tahum dawngthawnguan kown nadowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 21:11" />Now achapa Ismael lawnguan kowi Abraham dow lainowmma saktuak pusa khai. <verse eid="GEN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 21:12" />Nachenganchepaw Thurai tek pe mih, “Abraham, en kowh narma hai achapa lawnguan kowi hangkow tuak kawm diah. Sari tek en iawng chang diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Isak krungchak kowi chowtaih en kowh krungchak pahai nadowkah kown. <verse eid="GEN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 21:13" />Tawkchedow en kowh narma chapa hownia paw aiukma mih chenchap ang nathawpah lowk kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia paw en kowh chapa chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 21:14" />Naiawng rakowi Abraham mih auai rau murpa awr rü müi hanow chakkham hai tui-iia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tui-iia </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow tui towng müa chekhai. Abraham khin khe kowh tui towng müa dow chak pik hown kowh im chekhai.</char></note> kowi tui atekma klin pe now Hagar pangkawt kowi bat pe khai. Achapa kowi dow aia rut kowi ap pe hanow cham chinta khai bowt. Now kim hownia lawt hanow Hagar iüah uchow dow Ber-Seba pami süngrüp süngkangma kowi cham mang panglang khai. <verse eid="GEN 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 21:15" />Nahanow tui-iia kowi kowh tui khowk khai bowt, now Hagar mih achapa kowi ruih mung krüa kowi cham iüata hüah khai. <verse eid="GEN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 21:16" />Aia dow, “Ang chapa kowng mih ang khi dowi iawng,” padow tatuak khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow achapa hownia alak sangrum mowr cham powt hanow cham chowm tuai khai, now aia dow atün atünma kar khai. Achapa hown aia tala mih dow ap salangba khe kowh chawn mowr chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 21:17" />Nachenganchepaw ngeuüa kar klow mih Thurai ta khai bowt. Naiawng kowh <char style="w">mukuang pren</char> hownia Thurai kowh kramamu Hagar kowi hawah now tek pe mih, “Hagar, tawng chow en own? Hangkow kram diah. Ngeuüa kar mih klow Thurai ta khowk. <verse eid="GEN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 21:18" />Rü now ngeuüa kowi kowdepta diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami ngeuüa hownia mih chenchap aiukma ang nathawpah lowk kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 21:19" />Now Thurai mih Hagar kowi pe khi-ah tuikuam lowk. Nami tuikuam hownia mih aia kowh tui-iia hown towngla tui hanow achapa kowi pe khamah tui khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 21:20" />Thurai mih Ismael kowi mingah khetah reng khai, now Ismael mih awr iuk awr sown rürü khai bowt. Aia dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi uowi khai, now aia dow salangba ap akiakma mih maru uang phaw khai. <verse eid="GEN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 21:21" />Amatchi dow Paran pape mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi uowi iüah khai. Now Ismael nachangla masi kownkow Aigupta pren kowi kowh masiuüa kowi a-u paw pe khai.<verse eid="GEN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abraham hai mang Abimelek iüah tatow sangbowk laitawm mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 21:22" />Pani khe Abimelek mih aia kowh <char style="w">siphai</char> aluchow Fikawl kowi pawla now Abraham tut-e kowkowi khai. Now Abimelek tek pe Abraham mih, “Ang tuk, en changah mih lup maten kowi Thurai tawi uowila en reng chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 21:23" />Mü diah, ang kowh pren kowi en uang tawi uowi khai. Nachenganchepaw ang hawt saksing sana en khai. Nami powm iawng en paw ang hai ang prenchakuüa kowi en nasaksing sana kown takla. Naiawng rakowi ang hai ang chauüa hai ang krungchakuüa mia iawng mih luk kowi paw en naling nakuan dowi kownkow Thurai ming hown kawmat kham ang sawi diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 21:24" />Now Abraham tek pe mih, “Ang takham khowk,” pape khai. <verse eid="GEN 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 21:25" />Now Abimelek kowh naruüa kür hown khünta pe aia kowh tuikuam mih lawnguan kowi Abraham mih Abimelek kowi chawk pe lai khai.<verse eid="GEN 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 21:26" />Nakhowk khe Abimelek tek pe mih, “Naiawng mih lup mia chow chang mih ang tuk dowi. Mami dowi rawn en paw tek ang dowi tak chedow ang tuk dowi; kawmat tak ang ta,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 21:27" />Nahanow Abraham mih uang pawla chia hai ruapur sangrum hanow Abimelek kowi peah khai, now amatchi mih tatow sangbowk laitawm khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 21:28" />Now Abraham mih aia kowh ruapur hawmh hownia aiia ranit pum mih lang towah khai. <verse eid="GEN 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 21:29" />Nami khita hanow Abimelek lüntaah mih, “Nami ruapur iia ranit pum en lang towta mih auan tawng chow?” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 21:30" />Abraham tek pe mih, “Maiawngün ruapur iia paw ang diah. Maiawngün ruapur iia dow mami tuikuam ang thaiah mih chowtaih pami maru natukla reng kownkow amat müa chekhai,” pape khai. <verse eid="GEN 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 21:31" />Nami re-e amatchi takham sawi khai rakowi nami re-e kowh arah ming dow Ber-Seba pahai chap pe khai. (Ber-Seba pami dow “Sawi khamra tuikuam” pami chekhai).<verse eid="GEN 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 21:32" />Naiawng hai Ber-Seba kowi ki tatow sangbowk laitawm kung kowi dow Abimelek mih aia kowh siphai aluchow Fikawl hown amatni Filistinuüa uowi rah kowi mang khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 21:33" />Now Abraham mih Ber-Seba kowi chowk painglang singh atut khai, now nakowi mih auown hai achur uowi dowi mih CHAKRAMANG Thurai kowi chupah iiaah khai. <verse eid="GEN 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 21:34" />Abraham mih Filistinuüa pren kowi akrama uowila khai.<verse eid="GEN 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="GEN 22" />
  <para style="s">Isak kowi changla phuchua müa mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 22:1" />Naiawngün ki phaw kung kowi akat khe mih Abraham kowi Thurai chaingah khai. Thurai hawah mih, “Abraham,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:1">Abraham klangah mih, “Mami re-e chaw ang uowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 22:2" />Thurai tek pe mih, “En kowh chapa Isak lowkchow mih, en sakrauah nowm nowm mih kowi pawla now Moria pren kowi kowkowi diah. Nakowi kowh ang natek en kown mih hungh kowi aia kowi dow tikah mih uanap kowchangla diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 22:3" />Naiawng rakowi Abraham dow auai rau murpa awr rü khai, now tikah mih uanap chang müa krawi paw sawp hanow kawrngaramchük luk kowi tap pe khai. Now achapa Isak hai aia kowh nar pre ia kowi pawla now Thurai tek pe mih arah prakowi tarü khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 22:4" />Now sum ni mang rawng mang kung kowi dow Abraham mih krawi tang mü khai, now Thurai tek pe mih arah dow alakma kowi haikhi khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 22:5" />Nahanow aia kowh nar pre ia kowi Abraham tek pe mih, “Kawrngaramchük hailawm mami re-e hawt uowi iüah towbowt. Pai kowi angching pachowh kowchupiia Thurai tak; ki chup ki iiala Thurai hanow angching nauang plan iawk kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 22:6" />Now Abraham mih tikah mih uanap chang müa sawp cheng dow achapa Isak kowi pe kawtla khai, now aiamat dow mairing puh hai saichow dowkla khai. Nahanow amatchi dow katsang taiua tarü khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 22:7" />Nakhowk khe a-pa Abraham kowi Isak hawah mih, “Apa,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Abraham klangah mih, “Tawng chow pa?” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:7">Isak tek pe mih, “Tikah mih uanap chang müa sawp hai maih dow uowi khowk. Tawkche ruapur chah dow uowi dowi kowbow; tawng kowi chow?” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 22:8" />Abraham tek pe mih, “Pa, tikah mih uanap chang müa ruapur chah dow Thurai matia nape achi kown taih,” pape khai. Naiawng hai talawpla bowklowk se amatchi dow mang iüah khai.<verse eid="GEN 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 22:9" />Now Thurai tek pe mih arah kowi dow kowting iüah khai bowt. Nakowi dow Abraham mih thawp phuchuara hanow krowng pe sawp khai. Now achapa Isak kowi mih arut akhawk tawmta pe bowk now nami phuchuara luk kowi iüaah khai. <verse eid="GEN 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 22:10" />Nahanow achapa kowi nasaita kownkow Abraham mih dowk saichow khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 22:11" />Nami khin khe mukuang pren hownia CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu Abraham kowi hawah mih, “Abraham, Abraham!” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 22:11">Now Abraham klangah mih, “Mami re-e chaw ang uowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 22:12" />Kramamu tek pe mih, “En chapa kowi hangkow sai diah, chang paw tawngpaw hangkow chang diah. Thurai kowi en ringkaw pami ang tuk khowk. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh chapa uowi lowkchow mih, en sakrauah nowm nowm mih kowi khowm padow ang vüi nachangla <char style="w">phuchua</char> müa kown mih kung prakowi mapaw en süt dowi chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 22:13" />Nakhowk khe Abraham dow krawi tang mü khai, now aia kung prakowi kowh ruih mung kowi anang tauowk hüah mih ruapurla khi lowk khai. Nahanow nami ruapurla dow Abraham kowpaw khai bowt, now nami dow tikah mih uanap chang müa achapa takcha kowi phuchuaah khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 22:14" />Now Abraham mih nami re-e kowh arah ming dow “Jehova Jire” pahai chap pe khai. (Jehova Jire pami auan dow “CHAKRAMANG pe reng” pami chekhai). Naiawng rakowi kawmat paw, “CHAKRAMANG hungh kowi dow CHAKRAMANG pe reng,” pahai maru tek reng chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 22:15" />Now mukuang pren hownia CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu mih Abraham kowi kutplan hawah khai iawk. <verse eid="GEN 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 22:16" />Tek pe mih, “Abraham, en kowh chapa uowi lowkchow mih, en sakrauah nowm nowm mih kowi nachangla phuchua müa kown mih kung prakowi mapaw en süt dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ang matia ming hown ang takham khowk. <verse eid="GEN 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 22:17" />Ang nape en prasi ngengche kown. Kuang kowi kowh krek iawng hai sata pang kowi kowh sema iawng en krungchakuüa kowi ang nape prungah kown. En krungchakuüa mih amatni ransu-uüa kowh marow ün napowngta pe kown. <verse eid="GEN 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 22:18" />Now en krungchakuüa hownia lusa kowi kowh chenchap maten naka prasi kown. Ang kowh ana pek en chün khai rakowi naiawng ang nachang en kown mih chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 22:19" />Nami kung kowi dow Abraham mih aia kowh nar pre ia tut-e uang plan khai bowt. Nahanow amatni bowkbowk dow nami hownia amatni uowi rah Ber-Seba kowi kowplan büah khai, now Abraham mih nakowi uowi phülü khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nahawr kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-23" style="v" sid="GEN 22:20-23" />Naiawngün kung kowi dow anaumow Nahawr kowi paw Milka pen pe chapa raiat ia pami Abraham ta khai. Nahawr kowh chapa raiat ia kowi lang ta mih ming dow Uz chekhai. Nami kung kowi kowh ming dow Bus, nami kung kowi kowh ming dow Kemuel chekhai. (Kemuel dow Aram kowh pa). Nami kung kowi dow Keset, Hazo, Pildas, Jilaf hai Bethuel büah chekhai. (Bethuel dow Rebeka kowh pa). <verse eid="GEN 22:20-23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 22:24" />Ruma pape mih narma paw Nahawr changla masi mih uowi lowk ia tak. Ruma hown paw Nahawr ka chah tali ia chekhai. Aming dow Teba, Gaham, Tahas hai Maka büah chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 22:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="GEN 23" />
  <para style="s">Abraham ran Sari tadupra mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="GEN 23:1-2" />Sari dow 127 ning singla now Kanan pren kowi kowh Kiriat-Arba marow kowi kowng khai. Nami marow dow kawmat kowh tek pe Hebrawn mih chekhai. Sari kowng khai rakowi Abraham dow lainowmma prüa khai; aia dow Sari vüi kowi lainowmma kar khai. <verse eid="GEN 23:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 23:3" />Nahanow Abraham mih amasi uak towla now Hituüa hown kowtalawp khai. <verse eid="GEN 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 23:4" />Aia dow Hituüa kowi tek pe mih, “Ang dow prenlang hownia kowh enni tut-e uang tawi uowi mih maru chekhai. Ang kowh dow dupla masi uak kown mih paw chengrawng uowi dowi. Naiawng rakowi sakrauma hown tadupra krawng pe ang büah parachow dit,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="GEN 23:5-6" />Now Abraham kowi Hituüa tek pe mih, “Chakramang, anging kowh laiklow sünta diah. En dow anging pungmadawng kowi kowh Thurai lang kloah mih aluchow chekhai. Anging kowh tadupra lang iung mih kowi en masi uak mih kowdup diah. En masi uak mih lowra mih re-e en krawi dup chepaw amia iawng mih maru paw hang en dowi tham,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 23:5-6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 23:7" />Nahanow Abraham mih awr rüah now nami re-e kowh uowi mih Hituüa kowi tabawk krawm se chupah khai. <verse eid="GEN 23:7" /><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="GEN 23:8-9" />Now Hituüa kowi tek pe mih, “Ang masi kowi makowi nadup kown mih enni che nauta bowk hanow sakrauma hown ang laiklow sünta büa diah. Zohar chapa Efrawn tut-e kowkowiah now aia laih le re-e kowh Makpela kowi kowh puk uowi mih tawi hünlü ang büa diah. Aia mih nami puk pacham pe ang lah. Nami dow nachangla chengrawngs kownkow enni pur kowi asung takla iawng pacham sum ang lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 23:8-9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="GEN 23:10-11" />Nami khin khe Efrawn paw akeng mih Hituüa hown marow tapplawt re-e kowh takuara kowi tawi uowi khai. Now Efrawn mih nami re-e kowh uowi mih maru ta bowk iawng Abraham kowi tek pe mih, “Chakramang, sakrauma hown ang laiklow sünta diah. Ang krungchakuüa pur kowi paimi laih hai nakowi kowh puk mih ang hing peta en mih chowbowt. En masi uak mih paimi re-e kowdup towbowt,” pape khai. <verse eid="GEN 23:10-11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 23:12" />Now Abraham mih tabawk krawm se Hit maru-uüa kowi plan chupah khai. <verse eid="GEN 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 23:13" />Nahanow aia dow bowkbowk maru ta iawng Efrawn kowi tek pe mih, “En che nauta hanow sakrauma hown ang laiklow sünta diah. Ang dow nami laih ran kown ang nau, nami laih sung dow sakrauma hown paw ang diah. Ang masi uak mih nakowi ang nadupah kown mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 23:14" />Efrawn tek pe Abraham mih, <verse eid="GEN 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 23:15" />“Ang laiklow sünta diah. Nami laih sung dow tai 400 iun chowtaih. Nami dow en hai ang tut-e mün khowt paw nadowi. Nakowi mih en masi uak phai kowdup towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 23:16" />Now Abraham mih Hituüa pur kowi kowh Efrawn tekah iawng tai 400 <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">400 iun</char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow adik tali set hown raiatkawma gram chekhai. Abraham chowng khe kowh tai tangka dow kawmat kowh hown tatu dowi chekhai. </char></note>iun Efrawn kowi ap pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 23:16" /><verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="GEN 23:17-18" />Efrawn mih Mamre marow ria re-e kowh Makpela kowi kowh laih hai nakowi kowh puk hown laih kowi kowh singh kau uowi mih maten nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow Abraham kowi sumta pe khai. Naiawngün dow marow tapplawt ria re-e kowh uowi mih Hituüa pur kowi Efrawn sum pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 23:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 23:19" />Nahanow Abraham dow Kanan pren kowi kowh Mamre marow ria re-e Makpela kowi kowh puk kowi amasi Sari kowi dupah khai. (Mamre pami dow kawmat kowh tek pe Hebrawn mih chekhai).<verse eid="GEN 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 23:20" />Naiawng hai Makpela kowi kowh laih hai puk mih nachangla chengrawng kownkow Hituüa hownia Abraham kata khai.<verse eid="GEN 23:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="GEN 24" />
  <para style="s">Isak kowi napaw pe masi kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 24:1" />Abraham dow lainowmma lawngtang khai bowt. Lowra sia kowi CHAKRAMANG mih aia kowi peah prasi reng chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 24:2" />Abraham kowh dow aia kim kowi akrama uowi khowk mih, alawngtangma mih nar uowi lowk ia. Nami nar kowi dow aia kowh dawngthawnguan maten naming nakhet kown mih kurdik aia peah khai. Now akat khe nami nar kowi Abraham tek pe mih, “Sakrauma hown en kowh rut mih ang thung krüa kowi uang haitow hanow takham diah. <verse eid="GEN 24:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="GEN 24:3-4" />Mukuang pren hai lusa thawp mih CHAKRAMANG Thurai ming hown ang tut-e takham diah: Ang chapa Isak vüi kawmat kowh ang uowiah mih Kanan prenchak masiuüa kowi en naia paw pe masi kown nadowi. Ang dia rah pren kowi phai kowkowi diah. Nakowi en nakowkowi hanow ang tasin taken miuüa kowh chama en nakrawi mü pe kown, now ang chapa vüi en nauang pawla pe masi kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 24:3-4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 24:5" />Nami laiklow tata hanow nami nar tek pe Abraham mih, “Laiuan kowi, nami masiuüa che mami pren kowi uang tawi kown nau dowi hanow nami pren kowi en chapa kowi ang nakowpawla iawk kown bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 24:6" />Abraham tek pe mih, “Kaneu diah! Ang chapa kowi nami pren kowi mapaw en nakowpawla kown nadowi. <verse eid="GEN 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 24:7" />Mukuang kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih ang dia rah pren apa kim hownia uang lawtla ang hanow mami pren kowi uang pawla ang khai. Mami pren mih ang krungchakuüa kowi aia napeah kown mih uang kham ang khai. Ang chapa vüi nami pren hownia en nauang kala pe masi kownkow en dowi rawn aia kowh kramamu kowi aia mih nakowi kowrik chin en kown taih. <verse eid="GEN 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 24:8" />Nachenganchepaw nami masiuüa che en kung nauang tawi kown nau dowi hanow ang pe takham en mih hownia en nakhalat kown taih. Tawkchedow ang chapa kowi mih nakowi mapaw en nakowpawla kown nadowi,” pape khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 24:9" />Nami khin khe nami nar mih aia kowh kim iah Abraham thung krüa kowi haitow rut hanow nami lawnguan kowi takham khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isak kowi cham mü pe masi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 24:10" />Now nami nar dow aia cham müah mih masiuüa kimchak vüi aia kowh kim iah hownia uanh aiung aiungma mih pawla sangrum chi khai, now naiawngün uanh pawk müa pawla ut hamüt pum khai. Aia dow alakma mih Mesawpawtamia pren kowi Abraham kowh naumow Nahawr uowi rah marow prakowi kowkowi khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 24:11" />Nami marow uat kowi dow tuikuam uowi lowk chekhai. Nakowi kowting hanow nami nar mih aia kowh ut hawmh kowi tua kung se pe tanaiah khai. Nakhowk khe sat kowi ngialia khowk chekhai. Naiawng rakowi masiuüa tui towng khin dow uang na khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 24:12" />Nami nar mih maiawng chup Thurai khai, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh kim iah Abraham kowh Thurai, ani mih ang kowh kim iah kowh chapa vüi narui pe masi kownkow en uang khowng ang diah. Ang kowh kim iah Abraham kowi en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura tüng pe diah. <verse eid="GEN 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 24:13" />Mü diah, mami tuikuam re-e ang hawt iowng khai. Mami marow kowi kowh malauüa hawmh mih uang tarü tui towng thüm khowk. <verse eid="GEN 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 24:14" />Naiawngün malauüa kowi ang naklangah lowk ia kown; nami malauüa kowi dow, ‘En kowh tuikawng hownia pe kham ang tui dit snow,’ ang napape kown. Now aia mih, ‘Kham snow. En kowh ut hawmh kowi paw ang pe khamah tui tak ba,’ pahai tek ang khai hanow nami malauüa dow en nar Isak vüi en khowmah mih pacham chowng lah. Nami hownia dow ang kowh kim iah Abraham kowi en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura en tüng pe reng pami ang natuk kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 24:15" />Aia kowh laiklow chur dowi rawn tak khe Rebeka mih tuikawng paima uang haimang khai. Rebeka kowh pa dow Bethuel. Bethuel kowh pa dow Abraham naumow Nahawr, now Bethuel kowh u dow Milka chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 24:16" />Rebeka dow malauüa klangiungma. Aia dow tawng iawng mih kachakuüa hown paw taphua taiua dowi tak. Aia dow aia kowh tuikawng hown tuikuam hownia towngla tui now uang awr mang khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 24:17" />Nakhowk khe Abraham kowh nar kowiowmah now tek pe mih, “Sakrauma hown en kowh tuikawng hownia pe kham ang tui dit snow,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 24:18" />Rebeka tek pe mih, “Kham snow,” pakhai. Now sakkrowngma hown ap pe tuikawng hanow pe khamah tui khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 24:19" />Ki pe khamah tui kung kowi Rebeka kutplan tek pe mih, “En kowh ut hawmh kowi paw ang peah tui tak ba. Tui kham du dowi mowr ang towng pe tui sow,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 24:20" />Now Rebeka mih lenlenma aia kowh tuikawng tui tawncher kaw kowi kowkhük hanow lenlenma kowtowng tui khai iawk. Naiawng hai aia dow ut maten vüi towng pe tui khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 24:21" />Nami khin khe nami nar mih aia kowi CHAKRAMANG pe awng pe prangah tak chünchü pami natukla kownkow ririmma hown Rebeka kowi tang müah khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 24:22" />Ut hawmh ki kham tui bowk kung kowi dow Abraham kowh nar mih kuh nadawr akhuai dik mih lowk hai tanga lap dik chi mih kuh kuaiseh pre seh iu laiah hanow Rebeka kowi peah khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 24:23" />Now lüntaah mih, “Mia iawng mih chama chow en? En pa kim kowi anging tawi iak-e ka chünchü en ia tek ang kown bow?” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 24:24" />Rebeka tek pe mih, “Ang dow Bethuel kowh chama. Apa kowh pa ming dow Nahawr, now apa kowh u ming dow Milka chekhai,” pape khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 24:25" />Nami klen kowi kutplan tek pe mih, “Anging kim kowi pakdi hown chahau uowi bümma, now enni vüi iakra paw alawkma chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 24:26" />Nakhowk khe Abraham kowh nar mih krawng kowi tabawk krawm se CHAKRAMANG kowi chupah iiaah khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 24:27" />Aia tek mih, “Ang kowh kim iah Abraham kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai dow akiow pauowi lah. Aia dow ang kowh kim iah Abraham kowi khamah mih iawng kaah sakowmma chang pe hai aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura tüng pe reng chekhai. Aia dow ang kowh kim iah Abraham kowh naumow kim kowi uang pawla ang khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 24:28" />Nami khin khe Rebeka mih kowiowmah hanow a-u kimchakuüa maten kowi nami laiklow kowtek pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:28" /><verse number="29-30" style="v" sid="GEN 24:29-30" />Rebeka kowh dow arak uowi lowk ia, aming dow Laban chekhai. Laban dow atuamow Rebeka tut-e kuaiseh hown nadawr khi hai atuamow kowh laiklow tata hanow marow uat kowi kowh tuikuam prakowi kowiowm khai. Now tuikuam ria kowi mih ut hawmh ria kowi Abraham kowh nar iowng phülü mih kowkhi khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:29-30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 24:31" />Now Abraham kowh nar kowi Laban tek pe mih, “Apu, tawngplawng kowchow nami re-e en iowng rereng? En dow CHAKRAMANG peah prasi mih maru chekhai. Uang bowt; enni vüi hai ut hawmh vüi uowi rah ang kamrütla hüah khowk,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 24:32" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Abraham kowh nar mih Laban kung tawi krawi khai bowt. Kim kowi kowting hanow Laban mih ut luk kowi kowh uanh ün tawi khün kla pe khai, now ut hawmh kowi dow chahau hai pakdi pe chaah khai. Laban mih Abraham kowh nar hai aia hown kowh uang tawi mih naruüa kowi nasaula rut khawk kownkow peah tui khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 24:33" />Nachenganchepaw amatni pur kowi awr then pe hawm kan mih khin khe dow Abraham kowh nar tek pe mih, “Makowi ang uang mih auan ang tek enni dowi matchang tawngpaw ang nacha kown nadowi tak,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:33">Laban tek pe mih, “Now tek diah snow,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 24:34" />Nakhowk khe Abraham kowh nar tek pe mih, “Ang dow Abraham kowh nar chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 24:35" />CHAKRAMANG mih ang kowh kim iah Abraham kowi ahuma peah prasi khai; naiawng rakowi aia dow lainowmma kureng khai. CHAKRAMANG mih aia kowi dow chia, rua, ruapur, kuh, tai, narma, narla, ut hai kawrngaramchük ün ahuma peah khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 24:36" />Amasi Sari mih alawngtangma khowk khe Abraham kowi ka pe kachakuüa chah lowk ia. Nami chah kowi mih aia kowh dawngthawnguan srui Abraham pe powngah khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 24:37" />Now ang kowh kim iah Abraham mih pe takham ang khai; tek ang mih, ‘Ang chapa vüi kawmat kowh ang uowi rah Kanan prenchak masiuüa kowi en napaw pe masi kown nadowi. <verse eid="GEN 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 24:38" />Apa kim kowi en nakowkowi hanow ang tasin taken miuüa kowh chama en nakrawi mü pe kown, now ang chapa Isak vüi en nauang pawla pe masi kown,’ pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 24:39" />Nami khin khe ang tek pe mih, ‘Laiuan kowi, nami masiuüa che uang tawi kown nau dowi hanow tawng chow ang nachangah kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 24:40" />“Aia tek ang mih, ‘En kowh khari kowi nachawnla kownkow ang chün pe lai reng mih CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh kramamu kowi natawi chin en kown taih. Nahanow ang chapa nachangla masi kownkow ang tasin taken miuüa pungmadawng hownia masiuüa lowk ia dow en nauang kala kown taih. <verse eid="GEN 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 24:41" />Nachenganchepaw ang tasin taken miuüa che krawi pe en chama dowi kowh chalow hanow mami ang pe takham en mih hownia en nakhalat kown taih,’ pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 24:42" />“Naiawng rakowi ani paimi tuikuam re-e ang uang ting khe maiawng ang chup Thurai khai; ang tek mih, ‘Aw CHAKRAMANG, Abraham kowh Thurai, sakrauma hown ang kowh khari kowi pe chawn ang diah. <verse eid="GEN 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 24:43" />Mü diah, mami tuikuam ria kowi ang iowng khai. Marow hownia uang towng tui mih malauüa lowk ia kowi aia kowh tuikawng hownia nape kham ang tui ditchow kownkow ang natek pe kown. <verse eid="GEN 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 24:44" />Nami khin khe aia che pe kham ang hai ang kowh ut hawmh kowi paw nape khamah tui kown mih lai tek khai hanow aia dow Abraham kowh chapa vüi en lang khowmah mih masiuüa pacham chowng lah,’ pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 24:45" />“Ang kowh lai chur dowi rawn tak khe tuikawng pai hown Rebeka uang ting now uang towng tui khai. Now Rebeka kowi ang tek pe mih, ‘Sakrauma hown pe kham ang tui ditchow dit snow,’ pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 24:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 24:46" />“Now aia kowh tuikawng dow lenlenma uai ap ang hanow tek ang mih, ‘Kham snow. En kowh ut hawmh kowi paw ang pe khamah tui tak ba,’ pakhai. Nahanow ang kham tui khai bowt, now aia dow ang kowh ut hawmh kowi paw pe khamah tui khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 24:47" />Now ang lüntaah mih, ‘Mia iawng mih chama chow en?’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:47">“Aia tek ang mih, ‘Ang dow Bethuel kowh chama taih. Apa kowh pa ming dow Nahawr, now apa kowh u ming dow Milka chekhai,’ pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:47">“Nami ang tata hanow aia kowh nakawng kowi ang ü pe nadawr khai, now rut pre prakowi ang krua pe kuaiseh khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 24:48" />Now krawng kowi tabawkah krawm se CHAKRAMANG kowi ang chupah khai; Abraham kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai kowi mih ang tek pe awmrawm lai khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG dow ang kowh kim iah chapa vüi nakala masi kownkow aia tasin taken miuüa kim prakowi atengma uang pawla ang khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 24:49" />Naiawng rakowi kawmat mih ang kowh kim iah Abraham kaah sakowm iawng enni nachang pe tak chünchü tek ang büa diah. Enni chang pe dowi chepaw akeng prakowi ang cham ia müla kownkow tek ang büa diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 24:50" />Nakhowk khe Laban hai Bethuel tek mih, “Naiawng mih dow CHAKRAMANG hownia kowh uang ting mih chekhai lownow. Naiawng rakowi anging hownia aiung angak natek en kown mih tawngpaw uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 24:51" />Rebeka paw uowi lowmow, pawla now na towbowt. CHAKRAMANG tekta khowk iawng dow en kowh kim iah Abraham kowh iaumow pacham chowng lah,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 24:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 24:52" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Abraham kowh nar dow krawng kowi tabawkah krawm now CHAKRAMANG kowi chupah khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 24:53" />Now kuh hai tai hown kowh tatawng müa hown dawnguan ün laiah hanow Rebeka kowi peah khai, now Rebeka kowh rak hai a-u kowi paw asung khakma mih uanh ahuma peah khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 24:54" />Nami kung kowi dow Abraham kowh nar hai aia kung uang tawi miuüa mih cha hawm cha kan khai bowt, ki cha ki kham hanow nakowi mih müi büah khai.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="GEN 24:54">Isak kowi uang pawla pe masi mih</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:54">Now auai rau awr rü müi hanow nami nar tek mih, “Khaleng dow ang kowh kim iah tut-e naplan bowt kownkow pe mang anging towbowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 24:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 24:55" />Nami khin khe Rebeka kowh rak hai a-u tek mih, “Atum pacham uowila anging taku hamüt ni diah lah snow. Taku hamüt ni kung kowi mang büah iang,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 24:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 24:56" />Nachenganchepaw Abraham kowh nar tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG mih ang kowh khari kowi pe chawn ang khai. Naiawng rakowi hauang krawi town ang büa tham bowt. Ang kowh kim iah tut-e naplan kownkow pe mang ang towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 24:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 24:57" />Laban iüah uchow tek mih, “Now atum kowi anging lüntaah tak ba; tawng iawng tak chünchü atum matia dow tek kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 24:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="GEN 24:58" />Nahanow amatchi uchow dow Rebeka kowi hawah now lüntaah mih, “Mami maru hown tawi kown en nau bow?” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:58">Now Rebeka tek mih, “Ow, ang tawi kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 24:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="GEN 24:59" />Naiawng rakowi Abraham kowh nar hai aia hown kowh uang tawi mih naruüa kung amatni kowh tuamow Rebeka kowi mih tawi chinta khai bowt. Now Rebeka sowm khe kowh mingah khetah reng mih narma kowi paw Rebeka vüi krawi chin pe lowk ia khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="GEN 24:60" />Amatni dow maiawng Rebeka kowi krawi peah prasi khai, “Atum, en dow athawng aiawng mih chauüa u pacham chowngah. En krungchakuüa mih amatni ransu-uüa kowh marow maten pacham nowng powng lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 24:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="GEN 24:61" />Nami kung kowi dow Rebeka hai aia kowh narmauüa mih kamrüt hanow ut luk kowi chowm se Abraham kowh nar kung tawi mang khai bowt. Naiawng hai Abraham kowh nar dow aia kowh kim iah kim prakowi Rebeka kowi pawla khai.<verse eid="GEN 24:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="GEN 24:62" />Nakhowk khe Isak dow Birlahai-Rawi hownia uang plan hanow aia uowi rah Negeb kowi uang uowi khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="GEN 24:63" />Now akat khe mih sat kowi pra khe dowm kowi Isak cham len khai. Nami khin khe ut hawmh uang haimang mih alakma hownia aia hai khi khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="GEN 24:64" />Rebeka paw tang mü hanow alakma hownia Isak kowi haikhita khai, now aia dow ut luk hownia iu dowm khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="GEN 24:65" />Now Abraham kowh nar kowi Rebeka lüntaah mih, “Pai iow, dowm kowi kowh a-i prakowi uaimang mih maru mia chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 24:65">Abraham kowh nar tek pe mih, “Paimi chowbowt ang kowh kim iah chapa,” pape khai. Nami tata hanow Rebeka mih aia kowh uanchow hown mumta lumowr khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 24:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="GEN 24:66" />Now nami nar dow aia cham changla mih srui Isak kowi tek pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 24:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="GEN 24:67" />Nahanow Isak mih Rebeka kowi a-u Sari kowng dowi tak khe kowh uowila mih tangbung kowi pawla khai. Aia dow Rebeka kowi changla masi hanow lainowmma sakrauah khai. Nahanow a-u kowng kung kowi kowh aprüa aiia hownia dow Isak mih ka sakklamra khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 24:67" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="GEN 25" />
  <para style="s">Abraham hai Ketura iüah kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 25:1" />Abraham mih plan paw masi sar lowk tak chekhai. Amasi ming dow Ketura chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 25:2" />Ketura hown kowh kaah mih dow Zimran, Jawksan, Medan, Midian, Isbak hai Sua büah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 25:3" />Jawksan kowh chapa dow Seba hai Dedan iüah chekhai. Dedan krungchakuüa dow Asurimuüa, Letusimuüa hai Leumimuüa chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 25:4" />Midian kowh chapauüa dow Efa, Efer, Hanawk, Abida hai Elda büah chekhai. Naiawngün bowkbowk dow Ketura kowh chapauüa chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 25:5" />Abraham mih aia kowh dawngthawnguan maten achapa Isak kowi peah khai. <verse eid="GEN 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 25:6" />Abraham mih aia sing uowi reng tak khe aia <char style="w">changla masi mih narma</char> hown kowh chapauüa kowi paw dawngthawnguan ahuma pela pe khai. Tawkche achapa Isak kowi mih aia changla masi mih narma hown kowh chapauüa hown arasang aia towah dowi chekhai. Aia dow nami masi hown kowh chapauüa kowi satlawt pra kowh pren kowi cham chinta khai.<verse eid="GEN 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abraham kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 25:7" />Abraham dow 175 ning mowr singla khai. <verse eid="GEN 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 25:8" />Aia dow alawngtangma khe kowng khai. Aia sing uowi mih khin khe aia kowh chownglawng dow thaulangma hai asowrma chekhai. Aia dow kowng hanow aia pipu-uüa tadupra kowi tawi tadup khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 25:9" />Now aia uak dow Makpela kowi kowh puk kowi achapa Isak hai Ismael iüah kowdupah khai. Nami puk dow Mamre marow satlawt prakowi kowh Hit chenchap Zohar chapa Efrawn kowh laih le kowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 25:10" />Nami laih dow Hituüa hownia kowh Abraham ranah mih chekhai. Nami dowi rawn khe Abraham mih amasi Sari kowi paw nami re-e dupah khai. <verse eid="GEN 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 25:11" />Abraham kowng kung kowi dow achapa Isak kowi Thurai peah prasi khai. Now Isak dow Birlahai-Rawi ria re-e kowuowi khai.<verse eid="GEN 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ismael kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 25:12" />Ismael dow Abraham hai Hagar iüah kowh chapa. Hagar dow Aigupta prenchak, aia dow Sari kowh narma chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 25:13" />Mami dow Ismael kowh krungchakuüa lawnguan chekhai. Ismael kowh chapa lang ta mih ming dow Nebaiawt, nami kung kowi dow Kedar, Adbel, Mibsam, <verse eid="GEN 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 25:14" />Misma, Duma, Masa, <verse eid="GEN 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 25:15" />Hadad, Tema, Jetur, Nafis hai Kedema büah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 25:16" />Ismael kowh nami laipre ia chapa dow laipre chen kowi kowh aluchow chekhai. Amatni ming iawng hai amatni chowlowkkow kowh kua hai kua uat kowi kowh <char style="w">tangbung khup rah</char> towng kowi amatni kowh ming chap pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 25:17" />Ismael dow 137 ning mowr singla khai. Nami kung kowi dow aia mih kowng hanow aia pipu-uüa tadupra kowi tawi tadup khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 25:18" />Ismael krungchakuüa dow Havila hownia Sur pami arah mowr krawi uowi khai. Nami arah dow Aigupta pren hown atawnchow chekhai. Nami dow Asuria pra kowh mangla mih tiama kowi chekhai. Ismael krungchakuüa dow anaumow Isak krungchakuüa pren ria kowi uowi büah khai.<verse eid="GEN 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau hai Jakawb iüah dia mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 25:19" />Mami dow Abraham chapa Isak kowh chownglawng lawnguan chekhai. Isak dow Abraham kowh chapa. <verse eid="GEN 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 25:20" />Rebeka hown <char style="w">tachawng</char> mih khin khe Isak dow 40 ning khowk chekhai. Rebeka dow Padan-aram pren kowi kowh Aramean maru Bethuel chama, now arakma dow Aramean maru Laban chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 25:21" />Isak kowh masi dow atingma rakowi ka chah dowi. Naiawng rakowi Isak dow amasi vüi CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr lü prasi khai. Now CHAKRAMANG dow Isak awr lüah mih hawt sünta pe hanow amasi Rebeka dow uang kum nau khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 25:22" />Aia mu lak kowi dow chah phir chekhai, now amatchi dow lowkkowlowk takhüm khai. Naiawng rakowi Rebeka tek mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow maiawng ang tuk own khai?” pakhai. Aia dow nami auan natukla kownkow CHAKRAMANG tut-e awr lü prasi khai.<verse eid="GEN 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 25:23" />Now CHAKRAMANG tek pe aia mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">“En mu lak kowi mih chen uowi pre chap chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 25:23">uang dia hownia amatchi dow krungchak alangma kangowh naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 25:23">Lowk mih lak-e alowk mih nalang kür kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 25:23">Ata mih dow asawi mih kowh nar nachowng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 25:24" />Aia uowi kim mih khin khe aia kowh dow chah phir chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 25:25" />Now uang rik dia mih kowh dow pik mia aringma. Aia kowh dow pabuk pakowma apawi humma chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aming dow Esau pahai rük pe khai. (Esau pami dow “Apawi kangowh” pami chekhai). <verse eid="GEN 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 25:26" />Anaumow dow uang dia mih khin khe Esau klowngcheng kowi asima dowkla khai. Naiawng rakowi aming dow Jakawb pahai rük pe khai. (Jakawb pami dow “Klowngcheng dowk mih” pami chekhai). Esau hai Jakawb iüah uang dia mih khin khe Isak dow 60 ning khowk.<verse eid="GEN 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau sumta chapa ta rah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 25:27" />Amatchi tainau pre ia dow awr iuk awr sown khai bowt. Now lang ta mih Esau dow chakmit akiakma mih maru uang phaw khai. Aia dow kaurawng kowi lainowmma chakmit daw. Tawkche Jakawb dow adema mih maru chekhai. Aia dow kim kowi lainowmma kiang khai. <verse eid="GEN 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 25:28" />Isak dow achapa Esau kowi lang sakrauah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow Esau kramah mih kaurawng uaramchak nga chak prakowi lang nau khai. Tawkche Rebeka dow Jakawb kowi lang sakrauah rowt chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 25:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 25:29" />Pakat khe Jakawb dow pan daing khai. Nami khin khe Esau dow kaurawng hownia uang mang chakmit khai, now aia dow hawm sakkrai kowh lainowmma kawm khai. <verse eid="GEN 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 25:30" />Now Esau tek pe Jakawb mih, “Hawm sakkrai hown ang kowng kown chowbowt. Naiawng rakowi nami en panah mih aringchow mih daing pan pe cha ang ne dit snow,” pakhai. Nami laiklow rakowi Esau kowh aming plan uowi lowk mih dow Edawm chekhai. (Nami auan dow “Aring” pami chekhai).<verse eid="GEN 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 25:31" />Jakawb tek pe mih, “Tawkchedow en kowh chapa ta rah ani en sum ang kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 25:32" />Esau tek pe mih, “Mü madiah, hawm sakkrai hown ang kowng kown chowbowt. Tawng chow ang nachangla chapa ta rah kown chow?” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 25:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 25:33" />Nachenganchepaw Jakawb tek pe mih, “En nape ang kown mih kowi ang tut-e rik kham sawi diah,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Esau dow kham sawi hanow aia kowh chapa ta rah mih Jakawb kowi sumta pe khai.<verse eid="GEN 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 25:34" />Nahanow Jakawb mih Esau kowi kawm hai daing pan pe chaah khai bowt. Now Esau dow chala khamla prowng now cham kowi khai. Naiawng hai Esau dow aia kowh chapa ta rah towah sung dowi chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 25:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="GEN 26" />
  <para style="s">Apa Abraham kowi iawng Isak kowi Thurai khamah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 26:1" />Abraham khin khe kowh iawng dow nami khin khe paw Kanan pren kowi mih khown kuak khai iawk. Naiawng rakowi Filistinuüa pren kowi kowh mang Abimelek uowi rah Gerar marow kowi Isak kowpowt khai. <verse eid="GEN 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 26:2" />Nakhowk khe mukmang kowi CHAKRAMANG uang tatüng pe hanow Isak kowi tek pe mih, “Aigupta pren kowi hangkow kowi diah. Ang natek en kown mih pren kowi phai uowi phülü diah. <verse eid="GEN 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 26:3" />Kawmat dow mami pren kowi uowi diah towbowt. Ang matia ngengche natawi uowila en hanow ang nape en prasi kown. Mami pren srui dow en hai en krungchakuüa kowi ang nape enni kown. En pa Abraham tut-e kowh ang takhamta khowk mih dow ang nachang pe kown. <verse eid="GEN 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 26:4" />En krungchakuüa kowi mih kuang kowi kowh krek iawng ahuma ang nape prungah kown, mami pren maten ang napeah kown. En krungchak hownia dow lusa kowi kowh chenchap maten naka prasi kown. <verse eid="GEN 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 26:5" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Abraham dow ang laiklow sünta reng chekhai. Aia dow ang kük pe mih maten, ang kowh ana pek, ang kowh ari arow hai ana pek maten chün ang reng chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 26:6" />Naiawng rakowi Isak dow Gerar marow kowi hing uowi khai. <verse eid="GEN 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 26:7" />Nachenganchepaw amasi lawnguan kowi nakowi kowh maru-uüa hawt lüntaah mih khin khe aia dow, “Ang tuamow taih,” padow tek pe khai. Rebeka dow masiuüa klangiungma chekhai rakowi aia ka tuak mih, “Rebeka kowi ka kown nau rakowi nasaita ang büah kown chekhai,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi kram kowh naiawng aia tek mih chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 26:8" />Now nakowi Isak uowi mih dow akrama khowk chekhai. Akat khe Filistinuüa kowh mang Abimelek mih tawngpawk hownia krawi tang mü khai. Nami khin khe aia dow Isak iüah huaiu takrau mih khita khai. Nami khita hanow mang Abimelek mih lainowmma awda khai. <verse eid="GEN 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 26:9" />Naiawng rakowi mang Abimelek mih Isak kowi hawah now tek pe mih, “Rebeka en masi tangtang. Tawngplawng kowchow en tuamow pami en tuk tek anging khai?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 26:9">Isak tek pe mih, “Ang masi pami ang tek now aia rakowi nakowngta ang kown chekhai pami ang ka tuak kowh chowbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 26:10" />Abimelek tek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng en tuk chang anging khai? En masi pami tuk dowi rakowi maru phua iuaah stow. Nakhowk khe dow en tang anging aprek kown lownow,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 26:11" />Naiawng rakowi nami kung kowi dow Abimelek mih maru maten kowi hawah now lawt ana khai. Aia tek mih, “Mami maru hai amasi kowi mia iawng mih chow changah naklak khai hanow nami kowi dow nakowngta ngengche kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 26:12" />Nami ning kowi dow Isak mih tawi chang kheti khai bowt, now aia kowi dow CHAKRAMANG peah prasi khai rakowi akawm phow ka luprak khai. <verse eid="GEN 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 26:13" />Now aia dow uang kureng khai bowt. Aia dow pani kowh pani uang kureng ngamlam hanow akurengma mih maru uang chowng khai. <verse eid="GEN 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 26:14" />Aia kowh dow chia, rua, ruapur, narma hai narla ün lainowmma uang hu khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi nami khi hanow Filistinuüa dow aia kowi irsiah khai. <verse eid="GEN 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 26:15" />Abraham khin khe kowh Abraham kowh naruüa thaiah mih tuikuam maten Filistinuüa mih thiata bowk khowk chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 26:16" />Nami klen kowi Abimelek paw tek pe Isak mih, “Anging lak-e en lang kureng hai lang kür khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi mami pren hownia powt diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 26:17" />Naiawng rakowi Isak dow nami hownia powt hanow Gerar kowi kowh lawngrawi kowi kowkhup tangbung khai, now nakowi mih kowuowi khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 26:18" />Nakowi kowh a-pa Abraham khin khe kowh thaila mih tuikuam srui dow Abraham kowng kung kowi Filistinuüa thiata bowk khowk chekhai. Nami tuikuam srui dow Isak mih kowkrawi plan thai hanow a-pa Abraham chapla pe ming mih rowprowp kutplan chap pe ming khai.<verse eid="GEN 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 26:19" />Now nakowi kowh lawngrawi kowi Isak kowh naruüa mih cham krawi thai tuikuam khai. Nami khin khe amatni dow adak hownia tui uang towk prürü mih tuikuam ka lowk chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 26:20" />Nachenganchepaw Gerar kowi kowh rua hai ruapur thing miuüa dow Isak kowh rua hai ruapur thing miuüa hown uang taran khai. Gerar kowi kowh rua hai ruapur thing miuüa tek mih, “Mami tui anging kowh taih,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi nami tuikuam ming dow Esek pahai Isak chap pe khai. (Esek pami dow taran pami chekhai). <verse eid="GEN 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 26:21" />Nami kung kowi paw Isak kowh rua hai ruapur thing miuüa cham kutplan thai tuikuam khai lowk iawk. Nami khin khe paw Gerar kowi kowh rua hai ruapur thing miuüa uang krawi taran khai iawk. Naiawng rakowi nami tuikuam ming dow Sitna padow Isak chap pe khai. (Sitna pami dow ransu pami chekhai). <verse eid="GEN 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 26:22" />Nami kung kowi dow nami hownia cham süt hanow Isak mih cham plan thai tuikuam khai lowk iawk. Nachenganchepaw nami khin khe dow Gerar kowi kowh rua hai ruapur thing miuüa uang krawi taranla dowi bowt chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nami tuikuam ming dow Rehawbawt pahai Isak chap pe khai. (Rehawbawt pami dow arah huma pami chekhai). Isak tek mih, “Kawmat dow mami re-e naia prungla kownkow CHAKRAMANG mih pe anging arah ahuma khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 26:23" />Nami kung kowi dow Isak mih nami hownia Ber-Seba kowi kowpowt khai. <verse eid="GEN 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 26:24" />Nakowi kowtowm mih iak khe aia tut-e mukmang kowi CHAKRAMANG uang tek pe mih, “Ang mih en pa Abraham kowh Thurai chekhai. Mapaw hangkow kram diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang tawi uowila en reng chekhai. Ang kowh nar Abraham rakowi ang nape en prasi kown, now en krungchak kowi dow ang nape prungah kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 26:25" />Now Isak mih nakowi thawp phuchuara lowk hanow CHAKRAMANG kowi chupah iiaah khai. Nakowi dow aia khup tangbung khai bowt, now aia kowh naruüa mih kutplan thai tuikuam khai iawk.<verse eid="GEN 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abimelek hai Isak iüah tatow sangbowk laitawm mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 26:26" />Nami kung kowi dow mang Abimelek mih Gerar hownia Isak tut-e uang khai. Aia dow aia kowh <char style="w">prengia</char> pek mih Ahuza hai aia kowh siphai aluchow mih Fikawl kowi uang pawla khai. <verse eid="GEN 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 26:27" />Nami khin khe Isak hawt tek pe mih, “Enni naukhi ang dowi kowh enni prüt ang mih chowbowt mowna. Tawngplawng kowchow ang tut-e enni uang khai?” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 26:28" />Kowbüah tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG tawi uowila en reng pami kawmat dow achima anging tuk khowk. Naiawng rakowi en hai anging hown tatow sangbowk laitawm kown takla pami anging tatuak khai. Naiawng kowh chu, a-i takham diah sik. <verse eid="GEN 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 26:29" />Tawngpaw chang en naklak dowi kowi klangiungma klawp en iua en hanow thaulangma hown anging pe lawt en khai. Nami powm iawng en paw hauang chang anging naklak diah. En dow CHAKRAMANG prasi ka mih maru chekhai pami kawmat achima anging tuk khowk,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 26:30" />Now Isak dow amatni hown taphak tainau kownkow chang pe pawi khai, now taiua cha taiua kham büah khai. <verse eid="GEN 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 26:31" />Now auai rau dow murpa awr rü büah hanow lowkkowlowk tut-e takham sawi büah khai bowt. Nahanow athaulangma hown amatni kowi dow Isak pe mangah khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 26:32" />Nami ni khe Isak kowh naruüa mih amatni cham thaiah mih tuikuam lawnguan kowi Isak kowi uang tek pe mih, “Tuikuam kowi anging krum tui khowk,” pape khai. <verse eid="GEN 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 26:33" />Nami tuikuam ming dow “Seba” pahai Isak chap pe khai. (“Seba” pami dow “takham” pami chekhai). Naiawng rakowi kawmat pat nami marow ming dow Ber-Seba pahai uowi reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 26:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau kowh masi pre ia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 26:34" />Esau mih 40 ning chi khe paw masi pre ma khai. Amasi dow Beri chama Judit hai Elawn chama Basemat iüah chekhai. Amasi pre ia dow Hit maru-uüa chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 26:35" />Nami masiuüa pre ia rakowi Isak hai Rebeka iüah kowh chownglawng mih lainowmma nga khai.<verse eid="GEN 26:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="GEN 27" />
  <para style="s">Nau prasi kowh a-pa kowi Jakawb kuanah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 27:1" />Isak dow lainowmma lawngtang khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi aia dow khi mik dowi bowt chekhai. Akat khe achapa lang ta mih Esau kowi hawah now tek pe mih, “Pa,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:1">Esau klangah mih, “Mami re-e chaw ang uowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 27:2" />Isak tek pe mih, “Sünta, ang dow lainowmma lawngtang khai bowt; tawng khe chow ang kowng kown mih ia tekah dowi. <verse eid="GEN 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 27:3" />Naiawng rakowi en kowh chak ap müa salangba hai salangba sek pawla now kaurawng kowi cham mit chak diah. <verse eid="GEN 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 27:4" />Nami en cham ap-ah mih chaknga ang dawah iawng engah now uang pawla ang diah. Ang kowng dowi rawn nami chala now chapa tauüa kaah mih prasira ang pela en kown ang nau,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 27:5" />Isak hown Esau iüah talawp mih khin khe Rebeka mih tawi tata khai. Now Esau dow cham mit chak kownkow cham tarü khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 27:6" />Nakhowk khe Rebeka paw aia lang sakrauah mih chapa Jakawb kowi tek pe mih, “Sünta diah, en taimow Esau kowi maiawng en pa tek pe mih ang ta. <verse eid="GEN 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 27:7" />En pa tek pe mih, ‘Cham mit chak diah, now en cham ap-ah mih chaknga ang dawah iawng engah now uang pawla ang diah. Ang kowng dowi rawn nami chala now CHAKRAMANG ming hown ang pela en prasi kown ang nau,’ pape khai. <verse eid="GEN 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 27:8" />Naiawng rakowi kawmat ang tek en iawng chang diah. <verse eid="GEN 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 27:9" />En mih kawmat mat rua hawmh prakowi kowkowi diah, now rua chah kow lang iung mih ang tut-e uang pawla pre pum diah. Nami hown en pa dawah iawng asowrma ang eng pe sow. <verse eid="GEN 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 27:10" />Nami dow en pa tut-e en nakowpawla kown. Nami chata hanow aia kowng dowi rawn pacham pela en prasi lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 27:11" />Nakhowk khe Jakawb tek pe a-u mih, “Atai Esau kowh dow buk kowi pawi kangowh chekhai. Tawkche ang buk kowi dow pawi uowi dowi. <verse eid="GEN 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 27:12" />Apa nahawt kak ang buk chepaw naia, now ang kowkuanah pami hawt tukta now prasi takcha nape ang piati stow,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 27:13" />Nachenganchepaw a-u plan tek pe mih, “Men, en kowh nami piati mih ang luk kowi pacham kla lah. Ang tek en mih phai chün diah; kowpaw rua chah pre pum hanow ang tut-e uang pawla diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 27:14" />Naiawng rakowi Jakawb dow kowpaw rua chah pre pum khai, now a-u kowi uang peah khai. Now Rebeka mih ahua Isak dawah iawng asowrchow eng pe khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 27:15" />Nami kung kowi dow Rebeka mih kim kowi kowh uowi mih Esau kowh tawnguat lang iung mih pawah hanow Jakawb kowi khup pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 27:16" />Now Jakawb kowh rut hai ngawng kowi pawi uowi dowi mih re-e aia pia pe rua chah pik khai. <verse eid="GEN 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 27:17" />Nami kung kowi dow asowrchow aia engah mih chakkham hai kawm mih Jakawb kowi ap pe khai.<verse eid="GEN 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 27:18" />Jakawb mih a-pa Isak tut-e kowkowi hanow, “Apa,” padow kowhawah khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:18">Isak klangah mih, “Mami re-e chaw ang. Pa, mia chow en?” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 27:19" />Jakawb tek pe mih, “Ang taih le, en chapa lang ta mih Esau taih. En tek ang iawng ang uang changla en khowk. Sakrauma hown awr rü now chowm diah. Now ang cham ap-ah mih chaknga cha hanow pe ang prasi diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 27:20" />Nakhowk khe Isak tek pe mih, “Dui, tawng iawng chow en cham ap-ah khai? En len lai bowt kowbow?” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:20">Jakawb klangah mih, “En kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai khowng ang rakowi ang cham ka mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 27:21" />Now Isak tek pe mih, “Dui, ang re-e uang tatawn diah. Ang chapa Esau ching en na chünchü mih natukla kownkow ang sam kak en matak,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 27:22" />Naiawng rakowi a-pa Isak re-e atawnchow Jakawb kowkowi hanow a-pa Isak mih hawt kakah khai. Now Isak tek mih, “Laiklow dow Jakawb kowh iawng chowdiah. Tawkche rut pre buk dow Esau kowh chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 27:23" />Jakawb kowh rut dow ataimow Esau kowh rut iawng apawi kangowh chekhai rakowi Isak mih achapa Jakawb kowi hawt ka khümah dowi. Naiawng rakowi aia dow Jakawb kowi napeah prasi kownkow kamrüt khai. <verse eid="GEN 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 27:24" />Nachenganchepaw Isak plan lüntaah mih, “Ang chapa Esau ching bow en?” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:24">Jakawb tek pe mih, “Ow, ang Esau chowbowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 27:25" />Now Isak tek pe mih, “Now en cham ap-ah mih chaknga uang sam pawla ang dit madiah; nami chala hanow ang napela en prasi khai,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi Jakawb mih a-pa Isak tut-e kowpawla pe chaknga khai bowt, now nami chaknga mih Isak cha khai bowt. Ki cha chaknga kung kowi dow Jakawb mih apa kowi pe khamah grep tui khai, now Isak dow nami grep tui paw kham khai. <verse eid="GEN 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 27:26" />Nami kung kowi dow Isak tek pe Jakawb mih, “Dui, uang diah, now nam ang diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 27:27" />Naiawng rakowi Jakawb dow a-pa tut-e kowkowi hanow kownamah khai. Isak dow Esau kowh tawnguat nam tata hanow Jakawb kowi peah prasi khai. Jakawb kowi peah prasi mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:27">“Ang chapa nam dow singh rüm krawngta nam iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:27">mami nam dow CHAKRAMANG peah prasi mih süng nam iawng chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 27:28" />Thurai mih kuang hownia pacham pe en <char style="w">nang</char> lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:28">en kowh süng kowi mih krawngsi pacham uowi lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:28">Luprak hai grep tui mih ahuma en pacham ka lah.<verse eid="GEN 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 27:29" />Chenchapuüa mih pacham chowng en kowh nar lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">maru maten mih pacham chupiia en lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">En krungchak maru-uüa tut-e en pacham chowng mang lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">now amatni dow pacham chupiia en lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:29">Pe en piati miuüa luk kowi dow piati pacham kla lah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:29">pe en prasi miuüa dow pacham ka prasi lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nau prasi kowh a-pa tut-e Esau kar mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 27:30" />Now Isak mih Jakawb kowi ki peta prasi khai bowt. A-pa Isak kim lak hownia Jakawb ki lawt hown akrowksang ataimow Esau dow chakmit rah hownia kim kowi uang mang khai. <verse eid="GEN 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 27:31" />Esau paw aia cham ap-ah mih chaknga a-pa dawah iawng engah hanow a-pa kowi uang pawla pe khai. Now tek pe a-pa mih, “Apa, awr rü bowt. En chapa cham ap-ah mih chaknga cha hanow pe ang prasi bowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 27:32" />Nakhowk khe a-pa tek pe Esau mih, “Pa, mia chow en?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:32">Esau tek pe mih, “Ang taih le, en chapa lang ta mih Esau taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 27:33" />Nami tata hanow Isak dow lainowmma chür khai. Now tek pe mih, “Now cham mitah mih chaknga uang pawla hanow alai kowh ang tut-e uang mih mia chow? En uang ting dowi rawn ang chata hanow aia kowi ang ki peta prasi khai bowt; nami prasi dow aia chowtaih naka kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 27:34" />Esau mih a-pa kowh laiklow tata hanow lainowmma sak kowi rau khai; naiawng rakowi aia dow atünma kar khai. Now aia tek pe a-pa mih, “Apa, ang kowi paw pela ang prasi diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 27:35" />Isak tek pe mih, “En naumow uang kuan ang now en kowh prasira pawla khai bowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 27:36" />Now Esau tek mih, “Aia kowh ming Jakawb<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:36 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jakawb </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow Hebrai lai hown kuan pami paw uowi chekhai.</char></note> pami mapaw tawi dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow mami hown kuan ang pre kat khowk chekhai. Chah ta rah rik khünta ang akat khowk, now kawmat paw khünta ang prasira khai iawk,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 27:36">Now a-pa kowi tek pe mih, “Ang vüi tawng iawng mih prasira paw en towla ne dowi bow?” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 27:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 27:37" />Now Isak tek pe mih, “Sünta, en kowi dow Jakawb kowh nar ang thawpta en khai bowt, now aia krungchakuüa maten kowi dow aia kowh nar nachowng kown mih ang changta khowk chekhai. Aia vüi kowi ahuma nakala luprak kown mih hai naka grep tui kown mih paw ang khamta khai bowt. Nami klen kowi dow en vüi tawngpaw ang nowng chang en dowi bowt chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 27:38" />Now Esau tek pe a-pa mih, “Apa, en tut-e nami lowkchow klen kowi prasi uowi dowi bowt bow? Apa, ang kowi paw pela ang prasi diah,” pape khai. Nahanow Esau dow atünma tarua phawnglawng kar khai. <verse eid="GEN 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 27:39" />Nakhowk khe a-pa tek pe mih,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="GEN 27:39" />
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:39">“En nauowiah kown mih süng dow asi nauowi kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:39">nakowi dow kuang hownia nang paw nakla kown nadowi.<verse eid="GEN 27:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 27:40" />En kowh chownglawng dow saidawng hown en nasunah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">en dow en naumow kowh nar nauowi reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 27:40">En nowng kham dowi bowt mih khin khe dow en nakingküaah bowt kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 27:40">nahanow en naumow low hownia dow en nakhalat bowt kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 27:40" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 27:41" />Aia kowh prasira Jakawb pawta pe khai rakowi Esau dow Jakawb kowi lainowmma kunmarauah khai. Aia dow sakdawng kowi tatek mih, “Apa nakowng kown mih khin kra hu dowk. Apa kowng kung kowi dow Jakawb kowi ang nasaiah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 27:42" />Nachenganchepaw Rebeka dow achapa ta Esau kowh sangkrangra tukta hanow Jakawb kowi nauang hawla kownkow kowchin pe maru khai. Jakawb uang khe Rebeka tek pe mih, “Sünta, en taimow Esau mih nasaita en kown pahai aiamat kowi tape sakklamra khai. <verse eid="GEN 27:42" /><verse number="43-44" style="v" sid="GEN 27:43-44" />Naiawng rakowi ang laiklow chün diah. En mih ang rak Laban uowi rah Haran marow kowi kowpowt diah. Now en taimow kowh kunmarau prowng dowi mowr nakowi tawi uowi diah. <verse eid="GEN 27:43-44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 27:45" />Aia kowh kunmarau prowng khe hai aia luk kowi kowh en changta angak mih aia tamata khe ang uang krawi phowng en satang sow. Enchi tainau pre ia pani sang nakowng kown mih ang nau dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 27:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 27:46" />Now akung kowi Rebeka tek pe Isak mih, “Achi kowh iaumow Hituüa kowh chama rakowi sing kown ang nau dowi bowt. Nami klen kowi Jakawb paw mami prenchak Hit masiuüa kowi che paw hanow ang natawi sing kown mih tawngpaw mrawkra uowi dowi chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 27:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="GEN 28" />
  <para style="s">Jakawb kowi Isak pe pe ana mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 28:1" />Rebeka kowh laiklow ta hanow Isak dow Jakawb kowi hawah now peah prasi khai, now aia kowi dow peah ana khai. Isak tek pe mih, “Kanan prenchak masiuüa kowi amia iawng mih kowi paw hangkow paw ba. <verse eid="GEN 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 28:2" />Padan-aram pren kowi kowh en pu Bethuel kim kowi phai kowkowi diah. Now nakowi kowh en u rak Laban chama kowi phai kowpaw diah. <verse eid="GEN 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 28:3" />Lowra nowngia chang mih Thurai dow pacham pe en prasi lah, aia dow chauüa kawmma pacham pe en lah. Naiawng hai en krungchakuüa hownia chenchap ahuma pacham chowng lah. <verse eid="GEN 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 28:4" />Abraham kowi Thurai peah prasi iawng aia dow en hai en kung kowi kowh uang ta uowi kown mih en krungchakuüa kowi paw pacham peah prasi lah. Prenlang maru iawng kawmat kowh en uowiah mih pren dow Abraham kowi Thurai peah mih chekhai, nami pren dow en kowh pren pacham chowng lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 28:5" />Isak mih naiawng tek pe hanow Jakawb kowi cham chinta khai bowt. Now Jakawb paw Padan-aram pren kowi kowh Aramean maru Bethuel chapa Laban tut-e kowkowi khai. Laban dow Jakawb hai Esau iüah u Rebeka kowh rak chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau paw Mahalat mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 28:6" />Akat khe dow Jakawb kowi peah prasi hanow Padan-aram kowi kowh masiuüa kowi nakowpaw kownkow Isak cham chinah mih Esau tawi tuk khai. Nami klen kowi Jakawb kowi Isak peah prasi khe kowh Kanan masiuüa kowi amia iawng mih kowi paw hangkow paw ba pami ana pek paw Esau tawi tuk khai. <verse eid="GEN 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 28:7" />Now a-u a-pa laiklow iawng Padan-aram kowi Jakawb kowkowi mih Esau tawi khi khai. <verse eid="GEN 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 28:8" />Aia dow Kanan prenchak Hit masiuüa kowi a-pa Isak sak-ih dowi pami tuk khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 28:9" />Naiawng rakowi u-pa nasak-ihla kownkow Esau mih masi uowi pre ma khowk chepaw Abraham chapa Ismael kim kowi kowkowiah now Ismael chama Mahalat kowi kowplan paw khai. Mahalat dow Nebaiawt tuamow chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jakawb khi mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 28:10" />A-pa Isak ki peah prasi kung kowi Jakawb mih Ber-Seba hownia lawt hanow a-pu Laban uowi rah Haran marow prakowi tarü khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 28:11" />Now sat kowi khe aia dow tiama rawng kowi cham krum uowi rah arah khai. Aia dow nakowi iak khai. Aia dow nami re-e kowh huaklu uowi lowk mih kowi nüa lu now müi khai. <verse eid="GEN 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 28:12" />Now Jakawb mih khi mang khai. Aia dow mang lak kowi krawng hownia mukuang kowi tachang mih dawng khi lowk. Nami dawng kowi Thurai kowh kramamu-uüa pün dowm lawmlawm mih aia khi khai. <verse eid="GEN 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 28:13" />CHAKRAMANG dow nami dawng chem kowi iowng now tek mih, “Ang chowbowt CHAKRAMANG. Ang dow en pu Abraham hai en pa Isak kowh Thurai chekhai. Kawmat kowh en müiah mih pren dow en hai en krungchak maru-uüa kowi ang napeah kown. <verse eid="GEN 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 28:14" />En krungchak maru-uüa kowi mih lusa kowi kowh sema iawng ang nachangah kown. Amatni dow satlawt satkup hai tawngphak mrawkphak kowi nacham tauet kown. Lusa kowi kowh chenchap maten mih en hai en krungchakuüa hownia naka prasi kown. <verse eid="GEN 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 28:15" />Sünta, ang natawi uowila en reng kown. En cham kowi rah towng kowi ang nakrawi lawng en kown; mami pren kowi mih ang nauang kutplan pawla en iawk kown. Ang khamta en mih ang chang en dowi mowr dow ang powtta en dowi tham,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 28:16" />Now Jakawb dow awr rü müi hanow tek mih, “Mami re-e CHAKRAMANG uowi lowmow! Ang hing tuk dowi smü dow!” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 28:17" />Nami laiklow tatuak now Jakawb dow kram khai. Aia dow tek mih, “Mami arah dow kramra hai ringkawra uowi lai kowbow! Mami dow Thurai kim klen kowi tawngpaw nadowi lowmow; mukuang kimplawt dow mami re-e chowbowt lowmow,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 28:18" />Jakawb mih auai rau murpa awr rü khai, now aia nüala lu mih huaklu dow chowkah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Chowkah </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow hua ai pami kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai.</char></note> khai. Nami hua luk kowi dow klai pe sau hanow CHAKRAMANG vüi chimsaiah khai. <verse eid="GEN 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 28:19" />Aia dow nami arah kowi Bethel pahai chap pe ming khai. (Bethel pami dow “Thurai kim” pami chekhai). Auown khe dow nami marow ming Luz chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 28:20" />Now takham se Jakawb tek mih, “Thurai che mami ang cham kowi rah kowi lawng ang khai, pe ang chakkham hai pe ang khupdip tawngklai khai, <verse eid="GEN 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 28:21" />now apa kim kowi klangiungma ang uang ia plan khai iawk hanow mami CHAKRAMANG kowi ang kowh Thurai padow ang nakhamah kown. <verse eid="GEN 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 28:22" />Nami klen kowi ang chowkah mih huaklu paw Thurai chupra nachowng ngengche kown. Aw Thurai, en pe ang mih srui hownia hamüt bak kowi pabak ang naplan pe en ngengche kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 28:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="GEN 29" />
  <para style="s">Rahel hown Jakawb takrum mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 29:1" />Jakawb dow mang mang hanow satlawt prakowi kowh maru uowiah mih pren kowi kowtowm khai. <verse eid="GEN 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 29:2" />Nakowi kowtowm mih khin khe aia dow krawi tang mü hanow dowm kowi khi tuikuam lowk. Nami tuikuam ria re-e dow rua hai ruapur hawmh uowi sum thum chekhai. Rua hai ruapur hawmh kowi dow nami tuikuam hownia athing miuüa pe khamah tui reng chekhai. Nami tuikuam mowr kowi dow huapher aiukma mih tow pe lowk khai. <verse eid="GEN 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 29:3" />Rua hai ruapur hawmh uang taküm bowk khe nami tuikuam kowi kowh huapher dow athing miuüa sütta pe reng. Now ki pe khamah tui bowk kung kowi dow tuikuam mih kutplan kümla büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 29:4" />Now rua hai ruapur thing miuüa kowi Jakawb lüntaah mih, “Tainau-uüa low, tawng hownia kowh maru chow enni?” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:4">Rua hai ruapur thing miuüa tek pe mih, “Haran marowchak taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 29:5" />Nakhowk khe Jakawb plan lüntaah mih, “Nahawr kowh chu Laban kowi enni tuk tak bow?” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:5">Kowbüah tek pe mih, “Ow, anging tuk chow,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 29:6" />Now Jakawb tek pe mih, “Aia dow iung reng tak bow?” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:6">Kowbüah tek pe mih, “Ow, iung reng tak manow. Pai iow achama Rahel paw rua hai ruapur hawmh hailawm uang haimang khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 29:7" />Now Jakawb tek pe mih, “Mü büa diah, kawmat dow sat lowng mih nowm tak; tawncher maten arasang nauang takua kown mih khin nadowi tak. Naiawng rakowi enni kowh rua hai ruapur hawmh kowi pe khamah tui hanow cham plan thingah büa iawk diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 29:8" />Nachenganchepaw kowbüah tek pe mih, “Naiawng anging ia chang dowi. Tawncher maten arasang uang takua kung kowi chiang tuikuam kowi kowh huapher anging naia süt kown; nakhe chiang rua hai ruapur hawmh kowi anging naia peah tui kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 29:9" />Rua hai ruapur thing miuüa hown Jakawb talawp reng tak khe Rahel mih aia kowh rua hai ruapur hawmh hown nami re-e uang tawi towm khai. Rahel dow a-pa kowh rua hai ruapur hawmh thing mih chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 29:10" />Now Jakawb mih a-pu Laban kowh chama Rahel hai tawncher hawmh khita hanow tuikuam ria re-e kowkowi khai. Now tuikuam mowr kowi kowh huapher mih sütta pe hanow tawncher hawmh kowi pe khamah tui khai. <verse eid="GEN 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 29:11" />Nami kung kowi dow aia mih Rahel kowi nam pe awm hanow atün atünma kar khai. <verse eid="GEN 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 29:12" />Aia tek pe mih, “Ang, Laban kowh tuamow Rebeka kowh chapa chowbowt,” pape khai. Nami laiklow tata hown krowksang Rahel dow kowiowmah hanow a-pa Laban kowi nami satang kowphowng pe khai.<verse eid="GEN 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 29:13" />Laban dow atuamow chapa Jakawb uang mih satang ta hown akrowksang Jakawb hown kowtakrum kownkow kowiowm khai. Aia dow Jakawb kowi kowdawiah hanow nam pe awm khai, now aia kim kowi Jakawb kowi pawla khai. Nakhowk khe Jakawb mih aiamat lawnguan Laban kowi lawp pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 29:14" />Laban tek pe mih, “Achi buk kowi akat sang mih vi uowi nowm chekhai,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="GEN 29:14">Jakawb kowi a-pu Laban kuanah mih</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:14">Nami kung kowi dow Jakawb mih ala mowr Laban kim kowi tawi uowi khai. <verse eid="GEN 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 29:15" />Ala kung kowi Laban tek pe Jakawb mih, “Ang pen chekhai pache dow aiawnglowma en tawi chang ang lup kown pabow? Tawng chow ang pe en kown takla mih tek ang diah. Ang pe en kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 29:16" />Laban kowh dow chama uowi pre ia chekhai. Lang ta mih ming dow Leah, now asawi mih ming dow Rahel chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 29:17" />Leah kowh dow amik klangiungma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Amik klangiungma </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami lawnguan Hebrai lai hown auan tukah kaneu dowi.</char></note>. Nachenganchepaw Rahel kowh dow kow ru hai apowm klangiungma chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 29:18" />Jakawb dow Rahel kowi naukhi rakowi tek pe Laban mih, “En kowh chama Rahel hown pe tachawng ang now ranit ning mowr ang tawi chang en lup kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 29:19" />Nakhowk khe Laban tek pe mih, “Naiawng now iung lai bowt kowbow! Rahel kowi akeng mih maru tut-e cham peah mih lak-e en kowi pe en mih chowbowt lang iung,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 29:20" />Jakawb mih Rahel kowi ka kown nau rakowi ranit ning mowr tawi chang lup khai. Aia dow Rahel kowi lainowmma naukhi khai. Naiawng rakowi ranit ning dow aia tut-e pre sum nichow iawng taih chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 29:21" />Ranit ning chur khe dow Jakawb tek pe Laban mih, “Achi kowh khowmta bowkta mih khin dow chur khowk. Naiawng rakowi khaleng dow Rahel hown pe tachawng ang bowt; aia hown taiua uowi kown ang nau khowk,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 29:22" />Naiawng rakowi Laban mih amatni klowkchak kowi hawah now chang pe pawi khai. <verse eid="GEN 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 29:23" />Nachenganchepaw nami iak dow Rahel takcha achama lang ta mih Leah kowi Jakawb tut-e Laban kowpawla pe khai, now Jakawb mih Leah hown taphua taiua khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 29:24" />Now Laban mih aia kowh narma Zilpa kowi Leah nachangla nar kownkow peah khai.<verse eid="GEN 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 29:25" />Tawkchedow uarthowi khowk khe khita Leah now Jakawb mih lainowmma awda khai. Naiawng rakowi kunmarau kowh Jakawb tek pe Laban mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng en tuk chang ang khai? Ranit ning ang chang en lup mih Rahel kowi en pe ang pakowh nadowi bow? Tawngplawng kowchow en tuk kuan ang khai?” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 29:26" />Nakhowk khe Laban tek pe mih, “Sünta, chama ta cham mang dowi rawn chama sawi nacham mang kown mih anging pren kowi ari uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 29:27" />Mami tachawng talang pawi sapta mih pacham kowi lah diah. Nami kung kowi chama sawi mih kowi paw ang nape en kown taih. Tawkchedow nami vüi kowi ranit ning mowr en nachang ang lup iawk kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 29:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 29:28" />Nami laiklow dow Jakawb chün pe khai. Now tachawng talang sapta chur kung kowi dow Laban mih achama Rahel kowi paw Jakawb kowi peah khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 29:29" />Now Bilha kowi mih Rahel nachangla nar kownkow Laban krawi peah khai. <verse eid="GEN 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 29:30" />Naiawng rakowi Jakawb dow Rahel hown paw taiua uowi khai bowt. Aia dow Leah kowi lak-e Rahel kowi lang sakrauah khai. Aia dow a-pu Laban kowi ranit ning mowr tawi plan chang pe lup khai.<verse eid="GEN 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jakawb kowh krungchak uown prung mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 29:31" />Leah kowi Jakawb sakrauah marai dowi mih khi hanow CHAKRAMANG mih Leah kowi pe kaah chah khai bowt. Nachenganchepaw Rahel kowi dow pe tingah khai. <verse eid="GEN 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 29:32" />Leah dow kum nau hanow ka kachakuüa chah lowk ia khai. Aia dow achapa ming Reuben padow rük pe khai. (Reuben pami dow “mü diah kachakuüa chah” pami chekhai). Leah tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG mih ang kowh akrat pusara khi ang khai. Kawmat hownia dow ang hua nasakrau ang kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 29:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 29:33" />Nami kung kowi paw Leah dow kum nau hanow kutplan ka kachakuüa chah khai iawk. Aia dow achapa ming Simiawn padow rük pe khai. (Simiawn pami dow “aia ta” pami chekhai). Leah tek mih, “Ang hua sakraula ang marai dowi pami laiklow CHAKRAMANG ta chekhai. Naiawng rakowi mami chah paw aia pe ang mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 29:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 29:34" />Nami kung kowi paw aia dow kum nau hanow plan ka kachakuüa chah khai lowk iawk. Nami khin khe Leah tek mih, “Khaleng dow ang hua mih ang hown tabawng kown towbowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow mami hown dow ang ka pe kachakuüa chah sum ia khowk,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow achapa ming Levi padow rük pe khai. (Levi pami dow “tabawng” pami chekhai).<verse eid="GEN 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 29:35" />Nami kung kowi paw aia dow kum nau hanow plan ka kachakuüa chah khai lowk ia iawk. Nami khin khe aia tek mih, “Khaleng dow CHAKRAMANG kowi ang narowsi bowt kown,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow achapa ming Juda padow rük pe khai. (Juda pami dow “rowsi” pami chekhai).</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 29:35">Now nami kung kowi dow Leah kowh chah kak rim khai tak chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 29:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="GEN 30" />
  <para style="s">Rahel hai Leah iüah ta-irsi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 30:1" />Rahel dow Jakawb kowi lowk ia paw nowngia ka pe chah dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow ataimow Leah kowi irsiah khai. Aia tek pe Jakawb mih, “Pe ang chah, nadowi now ang nakowng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 30:2" />Nakhowk khe Jakawb mih Rahel luk kowi lainowmma kunmarau khai. Naiawng rakowi aia tek pe Rahel mih, “Thurai bow ang? Thurai taih dow pe ting en mih,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 30:3" />Now Rahel tek pe mih, “Sünta, ang kowh narma Bilha hown taphua taiua diah. Nami hownia ang tawi ia ka chah tarawng. Naiawng hai ang tawi ia chowng u kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rahel kowh narma Bilha ka chah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 30:4" />Naiawng rakowi Rahel dow ahua Jakawb kowi anarma Bilha hown pe tachawngah khai, now Jakawb dow Bilha hown paw taphua taiua khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 30:5" />Nahanow Bilha mih uang kum nau hanow ka kachakuüa chah lowk ia khai. <verse eid="GEN 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 30:6" />Nami khin khe Rahel tek mih, “Thurai dow ang kowh prasi lük klow sünta ang khai, now tara nowm chet ang khai bowt. Aia dow ang kowh kar klow ta hanow pe ang chapa lowk ia khai,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow achapa ming Dan pahai rük pe khai. (Dan pami dow “Tara nowm” pami chekhai).<verse eid="GEN 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 30:7" />Nami kung kowi Rahel kowh narma Bilha mih plan kum nau hanow Jakawb kowi plan pen pe chapa lowk ia khai iawk. Nami hown dow Rahel kowh chapa mih pre ia khowk chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 30:8" />Nami khin khe Rahel tek mih, “Thurai kowi ang khepla se ang taimow hown ang taüara hownia ang awng khai bowt,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow achapa ming Naptali pahai rük pe khai. (Naptali pami dow “Taüa rah” pami chekhai).<verse eid="GEN 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Leah kowh narma Zilpa ka chah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 30:9" />Leah mih aia ka chah dowi bowt mih tatuk hanow aia kowh narma Zilpa hown Jakawb kowi pe tachawngah khai. <verse eid="GEN 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 30:10" />Nahanow Leah kowh narma Zilpa dow kum nau hanow Jakawb kowi pen pe kachakuüa chah lowk ia khai. <verse eid="GEN 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 30:11" />Nakhowk khe Leah tek mih, “Ang kaucha iung lai kowbow!” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow achapa ming Gad pahai rük pe khai. (Gad pami dow “Kaucha iung” pami chekhai).<verse eid="GEN 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 30:12" />Nami kung kowi Zilpa mih Jakawb kowi plan pen pe chapa lowk ia khai iawk. <verse eid="GEN 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 30:13" />Nakhowk khe Leah tek mih, “Ang piaw lai bowt kowbow! Masiuüa maten dow piaw pahai nahaw ang bowt kown,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow achapa ming Aser pahai rük pe khai. (Aser pami dow “Piaw” pami chekhai).<verse eid="GEN 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chah kak uih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 30:14" />Püm ngen khin khe Reuben mih laih kowi ka chah kak uih sangrum khai, now naiawngün dow a-u Leah kowi uang pawla pe khai. Nakhowk khe Rahel tek pe Leah mih, “En chapa uang kala mih chah kak uih pela ang ne dit,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 30:15" />Leah tek pe mih, “En khünta ang hua mih en sak ta-ih dowi tak bow? Ang chapa uang kala mih chah kak uih paw plan khünta ang iawk kown en nau mih bow?” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:15">Rahel tek pe mih, “En chapa uang kala mih chah kak uih che en pela ang ne now aiak dow Jakawb hown ang pe taphua taiua en sow,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 30:16" />Now iak prakowi Jakawb uang mang chat mih khita hanow Leah mih aia re-e kowkowi khai. Now aia tek pe Jakawb mih, “Ang chapa uang kala mih chah kak uih hown ang ranta en khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi aiak dow ang tut-e en tawi müi kown takla,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi nami iak dow Leah tut-e Jakawb tawi müi khai.<verse eid="GEN 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Leah plan ka chah iawk mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 30:17" />Thurai dow Leah awr lüah mih hawt sünta pe khai. Leah dow uang kum nau hanow Jakawb kowi plan ka pe chapa lowk ia khai iawk. Nami hown dow Leah kowh chapa tanga ia khowk chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 30:18" />Nakhowk khe Leah tek mih, “Ang hua tut-e ang kowh narma kowi ang kowchin pe rakowi Thurai pe ang awmrawm sung mih chekhai,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi achapa ming dow Isakar pahai aia rük pe khai. (Isakar pami dow “Awmrawm sung” pami chekhai).<verse eid="GEN 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 30:19" />Nami kung kowi Leah dow plan kum nau hanow Jakawb kowi plan ka pe chapa lowk ia khai iawk. Nami hown dow Leah kowh chapa mih taruk ia khowk chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 30:20" />Nakhowk khe Leah tek mih, “Thurai dow awmrawm sung aiungma mih pe ang khai. Mami hown dow ang ka pe chah taruk ia khowk. Naiawng rakowi kawmat hownia dow ang hua naringkaw ang kown towbowt,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow achapa ming Zebulun pahai rük pe khai. (Zebulun pami dow “Ringkaw” pami chekhai). <verse eid="GEN 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 30:21" />Nami klen kowi paw Leah mih ka masiuüa chah lowk ia khai. Aia dow achama ming Dina pahai rük pe khai.<verse eid="GEN 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rahel tawi ka chah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 30:22" />Nami kung kowi dow Thurai mih Rahel prakowi pela ching khai bowt. Rahel awr lü mih dow Thurai sünta pe hanow pe kaah chah khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 30:23" />Rahel mih uang kum nau hanow ka kachakuüa chah lowk ia khai. Nami khin khe aia tek mih, “Thurai mih henta ang rukrai khai bowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 30:24" />Naiawng rakowi aia dow achapa ming Josef pahai rük pe khai. (Josef pami dow “Aia pacham pe küng lah” pami chekhai). Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG pacham pe ang kachakuüa chah lowk ia diah lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jakawb uang kureng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 30:25" />Josef uang dia kung kowi Jakawb tek pe Laban mih, “Kawmat dow anging pren kowi kowh ang kim kowi pe mang ang towbowt. <verse eid="GEN 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 30:26" />Ang tawi chang en lup mih dow ang chauüa hai ang masi kowi ang ka kown ang nau rakowi chekhai. Kawmat dow kowbüah hown pe mang ang bowt. Tawng iawng chow ang tawi chang en lup mih krang dow en tuk khowk chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 30:27" />Nachenganchepaw Laban tek pe mih, “En che saksing sana ang reng tak hanow hangkow mangta ang diah. Thurai pe ang prasi mih dow en rakowi chekhai pami ang tuk. <verse eid="GEN 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 30:28" />Naiawng rakowi en kowh sukkri kha dow en nau mih tek ang diah. En tek ang iawng ang nape en kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 30:29" />Nakhowk khe Jakawb tek pe Laban mih, “Tawng iawng chow en kowh lup ang chang en mih en tuk khowk. En kowh tawncher ang rut kowi uowi khe tawng iawng chow prung mih paw en tuk khowk. <verse eid="GEN 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 30:30" />Ang uang uowi dowi tak khe dow en kowh tawncher khowt pat uowi dowi tak. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow en kowh tawncher ahuma uang prung khai bowt. Ang chang en mih srui kowi CHAKRAMANG dow pe en prasi khai. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow ang matia kimchak vüi nakram dawngthawnguan kown mih akhin uang na khai bowt lowmow,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 30:31" />Nami khin khe Laban tek pe mih, “Tawng chow ang nape en kown?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 30:31">Now Jakawb tek pe mih, “Tangka pawisa pe ang kla dowi tham. Tawkchedow en sünta ang lai lowk kown takla. Nahanow en kowh tawncher dow ang naming nakhet en iawk kown taih. <verse eid="GEN 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 30:32" />Ani mih en kowh ruapur hai rua hawmh kowi pe kra ang diah. Now aingma mih hai anum hown akaw taraw mih ruapur hai rua maten ang kowh sukkri kha en pe ang kown takla. <verse eid="GEN 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 30:33" />Pur prakowi en tuak ang sukkri kha mih khin khe tawng angak paw ang chang dowi pami naiawngün hown en natuk kown. Ang kowh rua hai ruapur hawmh pungmadawng kowi aingma nadowi mih hai anum hown akaw taraw dowi mih en khi hanow naiawngün dow ang kuah mih uanh pami en naia tek ang kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 30:34" />Laban tek pe mih, “En tek mih lainowmma iung. En tek iawng pana lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 30:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 30:35" />Nachenganchepaw Laban dow nami ni khe aia kowh tawncher hawmh pungmadawng hownia Jakawb nau kaah kown mih rua hai ruapur maten cham petta khai. Aia dow aingma mih hai anum hown akaw taraw mih rua hai ruapur maten lang kloah hanow achapauüa kowi pe mingkhetah khai. <verse eid="GEN 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 30:36" />Laban dow aia lang kloah mih rua hai ruapur hawmh kowi alak sum ni mang rawng kowi cham pawla khai. Now Jakawb dow Laban kowh ta uowi mih arawng sang mih rua hai ruapur hawmh kowi ta ming ta khet khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 30:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 30:37" />Nami kung kowi dow Jakawb mih cham krawi paw singh mia sum chaing khai. Naiawngün singh mia dow seuta pe apik hanow anga akawma kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 30:38" />Naiawngün singh mia mih tawncher hawmh nakhila kownkow tawncher tui kham rah kowi Jakawb tow pe khai. Nami re-e mih tawncher hawmh uang kham tui hanow uang tapaw hau reng chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 30:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 30:39" />Naiawng hai naiawngün singh mia pur kowi kowh tapaw hau mih rua hai ruapur maten dow pawm hanow pen chah khai; naiawngün chauüa dow anum hown akaw taraw mih kangowh uang phaw khai. <verse eid="GEN 30:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 30:40" />Naiawngün rua chah hai ruapur chah kowi kowh ala nget dow Jakawb lang towah khai. Tawkche rua hai ruapur iia dow Laban kowh aingma mih hai anum hown akaw taraw mih rua hai ruapur hawmh tut-e towla khai. Naiawng hai Jakawb mih aiamat kowh rua hai ruapur hawmh kowi pe prungah khai. Aia dow aia kowh tawncher hawmh kowi Laban kowh tawncher hawmh hown pe talawkah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 30:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 30:41" />Nami klen kowi akürma mih tawncher tapaw hau mih khin khe naiawngün singh mia mih amatni kowh tui khamra kowi Jakawb tow pe khai. Nami aia tow pe mih dow amatni mih singh mia pur kowi pacham tapaw hau lah pakowh chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 30:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 30:42" />Nachenganchepaw kür uowi dowi mih rua hai ruapur pur kowi dow naiawngün singh mia mih Jakawb tow pe dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Laban kowh tawncher dow kür uowi dowi chekhai; tawkche Jakawb kowh tawncher dow akürma kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 30:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 30:43" />Naiawng hai Jakawb dow lainowmma uang kureng khai bowt. Aia kowh dow narma narla ün, ut ün, kawrngaramchük ün, tawncher ün lainowmma hu khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 30:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="GEN 31" />
  <para style="s1">A-pu Laban hownia Jakawb ku powt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 31:1" />Jakawb mih aia lawnguan kowi Laban kowh chapauüa tatek mih tawi ta khai. Laban kowh chapauüa tatek mih, “Jakawb mih apa kowh uowi mih maten pawta pe bowk khowk. Aia kowh dawngthawnguan maten dow apa hownia kowh kangowh chekhai,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="GEN 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 31:2" />Nami klen kowi auown khe kowh khowt Laban iungah dowi bowt mih paw Jakawb tuk khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 31:3" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Jakawb mih, “En pipu-uüa pren kowi en maru-uüa tut-e kowplan diah, ang natawi uowila en reng kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 31:4" />Naiawng rakowi Jakawb mih dowm kowi kowh tawncher hawmh uowi rah re-e nauangla kownkow kowchin maru now Rahel hai Leah iüah kowi uang hawla khai. <verse eid="GEN 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 31:5" />Nami kung kowi Rahel hai Leah iüah kowi Jakawb tek pe mih, “Auown khe kowh khowt enchi kowh pa iung ang dowi bowt mih ang tuk. Nachenganchepaw apa kowh Thurai dow tawi uowila ang reng. <verse eid="GEN 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 31:6" />Ang kowh kür maten hown enchi kowh pa lup ang chang pe mih enchi tuk. <verse eid="GEN 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 31:7" />Nachenganchepaw aia dow kuan ang rengreng tak chekhai. Aia dow atungma klowita ang sukkri kha khai. Nachepaw nachang ang naklak kown mih pat dow Thurai pe changah dowi. <verse eid="GEN 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 31:8" />Enchi kowh pa rik tek ang khe dow, ‘Thudit thudatma mih tawncher maten en kowh sukkri kha naown kown,’ pakhai. Nami khin khe dow thudit thudatma mih kangowh uang pen khai. Nakhowk khe dow enchi kowh pa plan tek ang iawk mih, ‘Keiing keiangma mih tawncher maten dow en kowh sukkri kha naown kown,’ pakhai. Nakhowk khe paw keiing keiangma mih kangowh uang pen khai iawk. <verse eid="GEN 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 31:9" />Naiawng hai Thurai mih enchi pa kowh tawncher hawmh pe ang khai.<verse eid="GEN 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 31:10" />“Tawncher hawmh hau pawk khin khe ang khi mang lowk. Mang lak kowi ang krawi tang mü mih khin khe ang khi mih dow krawi paw hau mih ruala hai ruapurla maten thudit thudatma mih hai keiing keiangma mih kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 31:11" />Mang lak kowi Thurai kowh kramamu haw ang mih, ‘Jakawb,’ pakhai. Nakhowk khe ang klangah mih, ‘Mami re-e chaw ang uowi,’ pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 31:12" />Now aia tek ang mih, ‘Krawi tang mü madiah, krawi paw hau mih ruala hai ruapurla maten thudit thudatma mih hai keiing keiangma mih kangowh chekhai. Naiawngün dow ang changah mih chowbowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Laban chang en mih maten ang khi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 31:13" />Bethel kowi mih en tut-e ang uang tatüng khai. Nami khin khe nakowi mih en chowkla hua lowk, now nami hua luk kowi en klai pe sau hanow ang tut-e en khamla sawi khai. Ang dow nami Thurai chowbowt. Kawmat dow mami pren hownia lawt hanow en matia dia rah pren kowi plan bowt diah,’ pah ang khai,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 31:14" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Rahel hai Leah iüah tek pe Jakawb mih, “Kawmat mowr kowi apa kowh dawngthawnguan tawngpaw angching tawi ka dowi tak, pur prakowi paw tawi ka kown mih nadowi bowt. <verse eid="GEN 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 31:15" />Aia dow prenlang maru iawng hai tuakla angching khai. Aia dow sum angching hanow angching kowh sung srui chata bowk khai. <verse eid="GEN 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 31:16" />Naiawng rakowi angching kowh pa hownia kowh Thurai pawah mih dawngthawnguan srui dow a-i hai a-i kowh chauüa vüi towbowt. Naiawng kowh Thurai tek en mih iawng kawmat chang towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 31:17" />Naiawng rakowi Jakawb mih achauüa hai amasi büah kowi ut luk kowi tangah khai. <verse eid="GEN 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 31:18" />Now Padan-aram kowi uowi khe kowh aia kramla mih tawncher hawmh hai dawngthawnguan ün pawla bowk hanow a-pa Isak uowi rah Kanan pren prakowi plan mang khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 31:19" />Nami khin khe Laban mih cham kep ruapur pawi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kep ruapur pawi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mih auan dow ruapur pawi hown changla la hanow thawpla uanh kownkow chekhai.</char></note> kownkow cham kowi khai. Nami takra kowi Rahel mih a-pa kowh arup ün kowkula pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 31:20" />Jakawb mih a-pu Laban kowi ku powtta pe khai. (Laban dow Aram maru chekhai). Aia powt mih dow Laban kowi aia tekla pe dowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 31:21" />Naiawng hai Jakawb mih aiamat kowh dawngthawnguan maten pawla now ku powt khai. Aia dow Iufratis aw haipown hanow Gilead süng kowi kowh hungh prakowi kowkowi khai.<verse eid="GEN 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laban krawi cham Jakawb mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 31:22" />Nami kung kowi sum ni khe dow Jakawb ku powt mih Laban tukta khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 31:23" />Nakhowk khe aia dow aia kowh tasin taken miuüa kowi hawla now kowkawi krawi Jakawb khai, now amatni dow ranit ni mang rawng khe Gilead süng kowi kowh hungh kowi kowkrumta khai. <verse eid="GEN 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 31:24" />Nachenganchepaw nami iak-e mang kowi Thurai uangah hanow Laban kowi tek pe mih, “Kaneu ba! Jakawb kowi aiung angak tawngpaw hangkow tek pe ba,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 31:25" />Jakawb dow Gilead süng kowi kowh hungh kowi khup tangbung khai, now nakowi uowi khe Laban mih kowkrumta khai. Now Laban hai aia tasin taken miuüa paw nami hungh kowi tawi khup tangbung khai. <verse eid="GEN 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 31:26" />Akung kowi Laban tek pe Jakawb mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng mih lup en tuk chang khai? Tawngplawng kowchow en tuk kuan ang khai? Tasenra kowi kowh khümla mih iawng ang chamauüa kowi tawng en tuk ku pawla khai? <verse eid="GEN 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 31:27" />Tawngplawng kowchow tekla ang dowi kowi en tuk ku powtta ang khai? En tekla ang panü dow apiaw apama hown meng hown lai hown, sawkchow tün hai taraw tün hown tawi sa en kown taih diah. <verse eid="GEN 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 31:28" />Ang chamauüa hai ang chu-uüa kowh awm khowm en pe namla ang dowi. Athukma mih iawng pache tawng en tuk chang lup khai. <verse eid="GEN 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 31:29" />Napiakla enni kown mih kür ang tut-e uowi dowi mih nadowi. Nachenganchepaw maiak khe enni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai tek ang mih, ‘Kaneu ba! Jakawb kowi aiung angak tawngpaw hangkow tek pe ba,’ pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 31:30" />En prüa en pa kim lai bowt rakowi en mang pami ang tukta khowk. Nachenganchepaw tawngplawng kowchow ang kowh arup ün dow enni tuk kula khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 31:31" />Jakawb tek pe mih, “Ang kram kowh chowbowt. En chamauüa kowi kür hown en nakrawi rupta ang tarawng padow ang ka tuak khai. Naiawng rakowi ang ku powt mih chekhai,” pape khai. <verse eid="GEN 31:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 31:32" />Jakawb dow Rahel uang kula a-pa kowh thurai rup mih tuk dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Jakawb tek mih, “Amia iawng mih tut-e chow en kowh thurai rup en ka khai, nami maru kowi dow nakowngta kown. Naiawng rakowi ang kowh dawngthawnguan pungmadawng kowi en kowh tawng chow uowi mih kawmat achi kowh tasin taken miuüa pur kowi krawi cham diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 31:33" />Nahanow Laban dow Jakawb kowh tangbung kowi kowkupah hanow kowkrawi cham khai. Nami kung kowi dow Leah kowh tangbung kowi kowcham khai. Nami kung kowi dow narma pre ia mih tangbung kowi kowcham khai. Nachenganchepaw naiawngün tangbung lak kowi dow tawngpaw ka dowi chekhai. Now akung kowi dow Rahel kowh tangbung kowi kowkup khai. <verse eid="GEN 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 31:34" />Rahel dow nami arup mih ut kumlawng kowi dauah mih uan krüa kowi petta khai, now aia dow nami luk kowi chowm khai. Naiawng rakowi Laban mih tangbung lak kowi krawi chamta bowk khowk chepaw nami arup krawi ka dowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 31:35" />Nakhowk khe Rahel tek pe a-pa mih, “Apa, hauang kunmarau ang diah. Ang kowh <char style="w">uisawng</char> uowi khai rakowi en pur kowi ang ia iowng dowi tham,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi Laban dow krawi chamta bowk khowk chepaw aia kowh thurai rup ka dowi chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 31:36" />Nami khin khe Jakawb mih lainowmma kunmarau khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow nangah se tek pe Laban mih, “Tawng angak chow ang changta khai? Tawng rirow chow ang piakta en khai kowh en uang tuk krawi ang khai? <verse eid="GEN 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 31:37" />Ang kowh uanh maten en krawi phuita bowk khowk; naiawngün kowi en matia kowh uanh en ka ne tak bow? Ka khai hanow achi kowh tasin taken miuüa pur kowi uang haitow diah; amatni dow pacham chet achi tara lah. <verse eid="GEN 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 31:38" />En tut-e ang tawi uowi mih pirmi ning khowk. Nami takra kowi en kowh ruama hai ruapurma pawm kowh iut khai pami paw uowi dowi tak, now en kowh rua hai ruapur hawmh hownia ang ngenah now ang chata khai mih paw uowi dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 31:39" />Nami klen kowi kaurawng uaramchak makta en tawncher mih khin khe paw ang pe tukla en dowi; nami piak mih klai ang takcha en reng chekhai. Ni-e kowh tama mih lah, iak-e kowh tama mih lah, tama mih klai dow en paw ang reng. <verse eid="GEN 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 31:40" />Ni-e dow ni chut chi ang kawng sat den, uar-e dow uar prowt chi ang kawng arua khai; tawngbak khe müi khowm ang nowng müi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 31:41" />En kim kowi ang uowi mih pirmi ning kowi laitali ning mih dow en kowh chama pre ia kowi ang nakala kownkow chekhai, now taruk ning mih dow en kowh tawncher hawmh ang nakala ne kownkow chekhai. Nami takra kowi atungma en klowi ang sukkri kha khai. <verse eid="GEN 31:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 31:42" />Apa kowh Thurai, Abraham kowh Thurai hai Isak ringkawah reng mih Thurai che tawi uowila ang dowi e dow rut khawma hai en nape mang ang ngengche kown chekhai. Thurai dow ang kawm mih hai ang chang lup mih krang khi ang reng. Naiawng rakowi aia dow maiak khe uang chet ang tara nowm mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 31:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jakawb hai Laban iüah kowh sangbowk laitawm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 31:43" />Now Laban tek pe Jakawb mih, “Mami masiuüa hawmh dow ang kowh chama taih, mami ngeuüa hawmh paw ang kowh chu-uüa taih, now mami tawncher hawmh paw ang kowh taih. Mami re-e kowh en khi-ah mih maten dow ang kowh kangowh chekhai. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow mami chamauüa hai amatni kowh chauüa kowi ang krawi ia paw dowi bowt. <verse eid="GEN 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 31:44" />Naiawng rakowi chu, achi tatow sangbowk laitawm lowk diah sik. Nami sangbowk laitawm saksi dow achi chowk hua lowk diah sik,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 31:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 31:45" />Naiawng rakowi Jakawb dow uang pawla huaklu lowk hanow chowkah khai. <verse eid="GEN 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 31:46" />Now aia maru-uüa kowi paw krawi pe pawah huaklu hanow nami huaklu ria kowi uang pe chunah khai. Nahanow Jakawb hai Laban iüah dow amatchi kowh maru-uüa hown nami hua chun ria kowi cha büah kham büah khai. <verse eid="GEN 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 31:47" />Laban dow nami hua chun kowi amatni Aramean lai hown Jegar-Sahadutha padow chap pe ming khai. (Nami auan dow “Saksi Hua Chun” pami chekhai). Now Jakawb paw amatni Hebrai lai hown Galed padow chap pe ming khai. (Nami auan paw “Saksi Hua Chun” pami chekhai).<verse eid="GEN 31:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 31:48" />Now Laban tek mih, “Ani hownia now mami hua chun mih achi kowh sangbowk laitawm saksi chekhai,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi nami hua chun ming dow Galed pahai chap pe mih chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 31:49" />Nami klen kowi nami arah ming dow Mizpa pahai plan chap pe lowk khai. (Nami auan dow “Kangchawng rah” pami chekhai). Tawngplawng kowchow panow Laban tek mih, “Lowkkowlowk achi takhi dowi bowt mih khin paw CHAKRAMANG dow pacham krawi mü achi reng lah. <verse eid="GEN 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 31:50" />En che ang chamauüa luk kowi chang naklak khai, nami klen kowi ang chamauüa uowi reng tak khe akeng mih masiuüa kowi en cham paw khai hanow achi pur kowi miapaw uowi dowi chepaw Thurai dow achi kowh saksi uowi reng pami tukah reng diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 31:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 31:51" />Laban plan tek pe Jakawb mih, “Mami hua chun prakowi mü diah. Now achi takra kowi kowh achi chowkah mih hua pra paw mü diah. <verse eid="GEN 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 31:52" />Mami huaklu chowkia hai huaklu chunia dow achi kowh saksi chekhai. Mami huaklu klen hownia now napiak en kownkow ang uang krawi uang dowi bowt tham. En paw mami huaklu chowkia hai mami huaklu chunia klen hownia now napiak ang kownkow hauang krawi uang tham bowt. <verse eid="GEN 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 31:53" />Naiawng chepaw krawi chang reng tak hanow Abraham kowh Thurai hai Nahawr hai amatchi pa kowh thuraiuüa mih pacham chet achi tara lah,” pakhai. Now Jakawb dow a-pa Isak ringkawah mih Thurai ming hown amatchi kowh sangbowk laitawm nachün kownkow kham sawi khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 31:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 31:54" />Nami kung kowi dow Jakawb mih nami hungh kowi tawncher hown chang phuchua pawi khai; aia dow aia kowh tasin taken miuüa kowi paw tawi cha tawi kham kownkow hawla khai. Amatni dow ki cha ki kham hanow nami hungh kowi iak khai. <verse eid="GEN 31:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 31:55" />Laban dow auai rau murpa awr rü hanow achamauüa hai achu-uüa kowi nam pe awm khai, now peah prasi khai. Nami kung kowi dow Laban mih aia kim prakowi plan khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 31:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="GEN 32" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 32:1" />Nami hownia Jakawb mih plan tarowng mang khai. Now tiama rawng kowi dow Thurai kramamu-uüa hown aia takrum khai. <verse eid="GEN 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 32:2" />Kramamu-uüa kowi khita kowh Jakawb tek mih, “Mami dow Thurai thumchak lowmow!” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow nami re-e kowh arah ming Mahanaim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mahanaim </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami auan dow Pre thumchak pami chekhai.</char></note> pahai chap pe khai.<verse eid="GEN 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau kowi kram kowh Jakawb krawi sa pe awmrawm sung mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 32:3" />Jakawb mih Seir pape mih arah prakowi ataimow Esau tut-e kowrik chin maru pre sum ia khai. Seir pami arah dow hungma mawngma süng chekhai; nami dow Edawm pren kowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 32:4" />Aia dow aia kowchinah mih maru-uüa kowi Esau tut-e nakowtekah kown mih lai krawi sangah khai. Aia tek pe mih, “Ang kowh chakramang Esau kowi maiawng kowtek pe büa diah: Ang dow en kowh nar Jakawb chekhai. Kawmat mowr kowi Laban tut-e ang tawi uowi reng tak. <verse eid="GEN 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 32:5" />Kawmat dow chia hai kawrngaramchük ün, rua hai ruapur ün, narma narla ün ang kowh uowi ahuma khowk. Ang kowh chakramang tut-e ang nakala sanara kownkow ang uang rik phowng en satang mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 32:6" />Now nami maru-uüa uang plan hanow Jakawb kowi uang tek pe mih, “En taimow Esau tut-e anging kowkowi khowk. Aia dow uang pawla maru iun 400 ia now en hown nauang takrum kownkow kawmat uang tarü thüm khowk,” pape khai. <verse eid="GEN 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 32:7" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Jakawb dow lainowmma kram hai tuak krat khai. Aia dow aia kowh maru-uüa hai rua hai ruapur ün, chia hai kawrngaramchük ün, ut ün changah pre thum khai. <verse eid="GEN 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 32:8" />Pathum mih kowi Esau uang sen chepaw akeng mih thum dow ia powt kown taih padow Jakawb tatuak khai.<verse eid="GEN 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 32:9" />Now Jakawb dow chup Thurai khai bowt. Aia tek mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, apu Abraham hai apa Isak kowh Thurai. Ang matia pren kowi ang matia maru-uüa tut-e naplan kown mih hai nakowi nachang ang aiung kown mih en tek ang khai. <verse eid="GEN 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 32:10" />Ang dow en nar chowtaih. En nasana ang kown mih hai en kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura en natüng ang kown mih ang tataing dowi. Mami Jawrdan aw mapra pown kowi ang uang tarü khe dow ang tut-e raitua lowkchow taih. Tawkche kawmat dow aiukma kangowh mih pre thum hown ang uang plan khai. <verse eid="GEN 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 32:11" />Sakrauma hown ang taimow Esau rut hownia uang lawng ang diah. Esau uang hanow uang kowngta anging bowk kown chekhai; aia dow a-u achah mia kowi paw lawtla dowi tham. Naiawng rakowi lainowmma ang kram khai. <verse eid="GEN 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 32:12" />CHAKRAMANG, en nachang ang aiung ngengche kown mih en kham ang khai. Now ang krungchakuüa kowi mih sata pang kowi kowh sema nowng rüaah dowi mih iawng en nachangah kown mih en kham ang khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 32:13" />Nami iak dow Jakawb mih nakowi iak khai. Aia dow aia kowh uowi mih maten hownia kloah hanow ataimow Esau vüi awmrawm sung lang towah khai. <verse eid="GEN 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 32:14" />Aia dow ruama 200 pum, ruala 20 pum, ruapurma 200 pum, ruapurla 20 pum, <verse eid="GEN 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 32:15" />achah uowi mih utma 30 pum, chiama 40 pum, chiala 10 pum, kawrngaramchükma 20 pum hai kawrngaramchükla 10 pum mih lang towah khai. <verse eid="GEN 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 32:16" />Naiawngün dow athumchow athumchow lang towah hanow anaruüa rut kowi ap pe khai. Now anaruüa kowi tek pe mih, “Pathum pathum mih alak sangrum chowchi uowiah büah hanow ang dowi rawn rik mang büa diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 32:17" />Rik mang mih thum kowi aia tek pe mih, “Ang taimow Esau hown takrum khowk now, ‘Tawng chow en cham kowi? Mia maru chow en? En pur kowi kowh pai iawngün tawncher hawmh mia kowh chow?’ padow nalünta en kown. <verse eid="GEN 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 32:18" />Nakhowk khe en natek pe kown mih, ‘Maiawngün en nar Jakawb kowh chowbowt. Maiawngün dow ang kowh chakramang Esau vüi aia uang krawi peah awmrawm sung mih chekhai. Aiamat paw anging kung kowi uowi,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 32:19" />Naiawng hai pawla tawncher hawmh mih thum maten kowi aia peah ana khai. Aia tek pe mih, “Esau hown takrum now enni paw naiawng natek pe kown. <verse eid="GEN 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 32:20" />Now achur prakowi natek pe kown mih, ‘En kowh nar Jakawb paw anging kung kowi chowbowt,’ pape diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:20">Sakdawng kowi Jakawb tatuak mih, “Ang dowi rawn kowrik sa pe awmrawm sung now ang nowngia klam pe sak kown taih. Nahanow aia hown takrum mih khin khe aia mih naiung ang kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 32:21" />Naiawng rakowi awmrawm sung mih kowrik pawla khai bowt. Nachenganchepaw aia dow nakowi ta iak khai.<verse eid="GEN 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai hown Jakawb dowk takhüm mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 32:22" />Jakawb mih nami uar-e awr rü hanow aia kowh masi pre ia, changla masi mih narma pre ia hai achapa lailowk ia kowi Jabawk aw paipra pown kowi kowsaah khai. <verse eid="GEN 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 32:23" />Nami klen kowi aia kowh uanh uowi mih maten paw kowsata khai. <verse eid="GEN 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 32:24" />Nakowi dow Jakawb mih aia malowkchow towbowt ta uowi khai. Nami khin khe maru lowk ia mih uangah hanow uarthowi dowi mowr Jakawb hown uang dowk takhüm khai. <verse eid="GEN 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 32:25" />Nami maru mih Jakawb kowi nowng dowi bowt pami tatuk hanow takhüm thüm khe Jakawb kowh thung tut kowi thawngta pe mawp khai, nahanow Jakawb kowh thung klikle dow taple khai. <verse eid="GEN 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 32:26" />Nakhowk khe nami maru tek pe Jakawb mih, “Uar thowi kown chowbowt. Khaleng dow plawtta ang bowt,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:26">Nachenganchepaw Jakawb tek pe mih, “En pe ang prasi dowi mowr ang plawt en dowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 32:27" />Nami maru lüntaah mih, “En ming tawng chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:27">Jakawb tek pe mih, “Ang ming Jakawb,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 32:28" />Nami maru tek pe mih, “Thurai hai maru hown takhüm kowh en awng khai rakowi en ming mih Jakawb pahai nauowi kown nadowi bowt, en ming dow Israel naown bowt kown,” pape khai. (Israel pami dow “Thurai hown takhüm mih maru” pami chekhai).<verse eid="GEN 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 32:29" />Jakawb tek pe mih, “Sakrauma hown tek ang diah, en ming tawng chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 32:29">Now nami maru tek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow en tuk lünta ang ming khai?” pape khai. Nahanow aia dow Jakawb kowi peah prasi khai.<verse eid="GEN 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 32:30" />Now Jakawb tek mih, “Thurai lumowr ang khi khowk chepaw ang sing reng tak lowmow!” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi nami re-e kowh arah ming dow Penuel pahai aia chap pe khai. (Penuel pami dow “Thurai lumowr” pami chekhai).<verse eid="GEN 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 32:31" />Penuel hownia Jakawb powt mih khin khe dow sat uang lawt khai bowt. Aia dow thung klikle taple khai rakowi tabai khawklawk khai. <verse eid="GEN 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 32:32" />Jakawb kowh thung klikle kowi thawng pe khai rakowi ani mowr paw thung klikle kowi kowh anga Israeluüa mih cha dowi tak chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="GEN 33" />
  <para style="s1">Jakawb hai Esau iüah takrum mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 33:1" />Jakawb dow krawi tang mü hanow 400 ia maru hown aia prakowi ataimow Esau uang haimang mih khita khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow Leah hai achauüa kowi athum, Rahel hai Josef iüah kowi athum, now anarma pre ia hai amatchi kowh chauüa kowi changah pre thum khai. <verse eid="GEN 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 33:2" />Aia dow auown kowi anarma pre ia hai achauüa kowi rik pe mangah khai. Nami kung kowi dow Leah hai achauüa kowi towah khai. Achur kowi dow Rahel hai Josef iüah kowi towah khai. <verse eid="GEN 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 33:3" />Now aia dow amatni pur kowi rik mang khai. Aia dow mang se mang se krawng kowi tabawk krawm se chupla khai. Naiawng hai chupla ranit kat kung kowi aia dow ataimow re-e kowtowm khai. <verse eid="GEN 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 33:4" />Nakhowk khe Esau mih uang haiiowm hanow Jakawb kowi uang dawiah khai, now namah khai. Nahanow amatchi pre ia dow kar khai. <verse eid="GEN 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 33:5" />Nami kung kowi dow Esau mih krawi tang mü hanow masiuüa hawmh hai ngeuüa hawmh kowi khi khai. Now aia dow Jakawb kowi lüntaah mih, “En hown katsang uang tawi mih iu iawngünuüa mia chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:5">Jakawb tek pe mih, “Naiawngün chauüa dow en nar kowi Thurai saksing sanaah kowh peah mih chowbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 33:6" />Auown kowi dow narma pre ia mih achauüa hailawm uang tatawn hanow Esau kowi uang chupah khai. <verse eid="GEN 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 33:7" />Nami kung kowi Leah paw achauüa hailawm uang tatawn hanow uang chupah khai. Achur kowi Rahel hai Josef iüah paw uang tatawn hanow uang chupah khai. <verse eid="GEN 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 33:8" />Now Esau tek pe Jakawb mih, “Tiama rawng kowi kowh ang krumla mih tawncher hawmh tawng rakowi chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:8">Jakawb tek pe Esau mih, “Chakramang, naiawngün dow en hownia kala sakraura kownkow chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 33:9" />Nakhowk khe Esau tek pe mih, “Ang kowh paw ahuma uowi khowk chow le. En kowh uowi mih srui dow en tut-e pacham uowi lah towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 33:10" />Nachenganchepaw Jakawb tek pe mih, “Naiawng e nadowi iow, ang chup en, en che sana ang khai hanow ang kowh awmrawm sung paw ang diah. Achi takrum mih khin khe en awmrawm ang mih ang khi mih dow ang khi Thurai lumowr iawng chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 33:11" />Ang uang pawla en mih awmrawm sung sakrauma hown paw ang diah. Thurai saksing sana ang rakowi ang kowh paw ahuma uowi khowk,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:11">Now naiawng Jakawb tek pe rengreng rakowi Esau dow paw pe khai.<verse eid="GEN 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 33:12" />Nami kung kowi Esau tek mih, “Chu, khaleng dow a-i mang bowt lah. En hown katsang ang tawi mang kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 33:13" />Nachenganchepaw Jakawb tek pe Esau mih, “Chakramang, maiawngün ngeuüa hawmh dow asowmchow uowi ne tak mih en tuk. Nami klen kowi iawn cha mih chiama hai ruapurma hawmh kowi paw atuak takla. Naiawngünuüa kowi dow lenlenma che mangla hanow pani sang khowm padow nakowng bowk kown chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 33:14" />Naiawng rakowi ang kowh chakramang, sakrauma hown en nar dowi rawn rik mang diah. Ang kowh ngeuüa hawmh hai tawncher chauüa nowngia mang mowrchow chi naurawng naurachow ang uang mangla kown chekhai. Seir pami arah kowi en hown ang uang takrum kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 33:15" />Nami khin khe Esau tek pe mih, “Naiawng now ang hown kowh uang tawi mih maru-uüa kowi ang ta towla en ne kown towbowt,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 33:15">Jakawb tek pe mih, “Naiawng pat paw lakke dowi tham. En kowh sakraura ang ka mih ang tut-e lang iuk chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 33:16" />Naiawng rakowi Esau dow nami ni khe Seir pami arah prakowi kutplan mang khai. <verse eid="GEN 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 33:17" />Nachenganchepaw Jakawb dow akeng prakowi cham lang mang hanow Sukawt marow kowi kowtowm khai. Nakowi aia dow aiamat vüi kowi thawp te lowk khai, now aia kowh tawncher hawmh vüi paw thawp pe rum pre sum buk khai. Naiawng rakowi nami arah ming dow Sukawt pahai chap pe khai. (Nami auan dow “te” pami chekhai).<verse eid="GEN 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apu Laban kim hownia Jakawb uang plan mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 33:18" />Akung kowi dow Jakawb mih Sukawt marow hownia kutplan lawt hanow Kanan pren kowi kowh Sekem marow kowi kowkowi khai. Naiawng hai Padan-aram pren hownia aia uang mang mih dow thaulangma hown uang ting khai. Now aia dow nami marow uat kowi khup tangbung khai. <verse eid="GEN 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 33:19" />Akung kowi nami krawng dow Hamawr krungchakuüa hownia tai akawm hown Jakawb hing ranta khai. Hamawr dow Sekem büah kowh pa chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 33:20" />Nakowi dow Jakawb mih thawp phuchuara lowk hanow aming El-Elawhe-Israel pahai chap pe khai. (Nami auan dow “Israel kowh Thurai chowtaih Thurai” pami chekhai).<verse eid="GEN 33:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="GEN 34" />
  <para style="s">Jakawb kowh chama Dina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 34:1" />Akat khe Dina mih nakowi kowh masiuüa hawmh hown tawi taiua kownkow kowkowi khai. Dina dow Leah hown kowh Jakawb kaah mih chama chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 34:2" />Nami khin khe Hiv chenchap aluchow Hamawr kowh chapa Sekem mih Dina kowi khita khai. Now Sekem mih aia kowi townah hanow piakta pe siri khai. <verse eid="GEN 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 34:3" />Sekem mih Dina kowi hing tuakta hüah chekhai. Aia dow Dina kowi naukhita khai, now Dina kowi aia naukhi-ah mih lawnguan tek pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 34:4" />Nami kung kowi Sekem tek pe a-pa Hamawr mih, “Paimi malauüa kowi kowlo ang; aia hown tachawng kown ang nau,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 34:5" />Jakawb mih achama Dina kowi Sekem piakta pe siri mih lawnguan tukta khai bowt. Nachenganchepaw achapauüa dow nami khin khe dowm kowi cham thing tawncher hawmh reng tak chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia mih achapauüa uang mang dowi mowr tawngpaw lai dowi chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 34:6" />Now Sekem pa Hamawr mih Jakawb hown nauang tatek kownkow uang khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 34:7" />Nami khin khe Jakawb chapauüa paw dowm hownia uang mang kowh nami satang uang tawi tata khai. Nami satang tata hanow amatni dow lainowmma saktuak kawm hai kunmarau khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Jakawb kowh chama kowi Sekem piakta pe siri mih dow Israel chenchap kowi peah rukrai mih chekhai. Naiawng Sekem nachang kown mih mapaw taka dowi chowdiah. <verse eid="GEN 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 34:8" />Jakawb hai achapauüa kowi Hamawr tek pe mih, “En chama Dina kowi ang kowh chapa Sekem lainowmma naukhi. Naiawng rakowi sakrauma hown en chama kowi ang kowh chapa hown pe tachawngah diah. <verse eid="GEN 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 34:9" />Tachawng talang lawnguan kowi a-i talawp talai diah sik. Enni kowh chamauüa kowi pe paw anging, now anging kowh chamauüa kowi paw paw büa diah. <verse eid="GEN 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 34:10" />Anging hown tawi taiua uowi büa diah. Pren dow enni pur kowi uowi hüah khowk. Makowi enni nau rah re-e krawi uowi büa diah, now krawng paw enni nau rah re-e krawi ran büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 34:11" />Now Dina pa hai arakuüa kowi Sekem tek pe mih, “Enni che saksing sana ang khai hanow enni kük ang mih ang nape enni kown taih. <verse eid="GEN 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 34:12" />Enni kowh chama hown pe tachawng ang büa diah, now buk sung hai akeng mih sia enni kük ang iawng ang nape enni kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 34:13" />Amatni kowh tuamow Dina kowi Sekem piakta pe siri khai rakowi Jakawb chapauüa mih Hamawr iüah pachowh kowi kuanah khai. <verse eid="GEN 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 34:14" />Amatni tek pe mih, “Hiah khampha uanh pik dowi mih maru tut-e anging kowh tuamow kowi anging nowngia pe dowi. Naiawng che anging chang hanow anging kowh chenchap ming napiak kown chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 34:15" />Tawkchedow anging tek iawng enni che chang now anging nauta chepaw naia kown. Nami dow enni pren kowi kowh kachakuüa maten anging iawng hiata khampha uanh pik kown takla. <verse eid="GEN 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 34:16" />Naiawng che enni chang hanow anging kowh chamauüa kowi enni nowngia paw kown taih, now enni kowh chamauüa kowi paw anging napaw kown. Naiawng khe chiang enni hown achap sang iawng anging tawi ia taiua uowi kown. <verse eid="GEN 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 34:17" />Tawkchedow anging tek iawng enni che hiah khampha uanh pik dowi now anging kowh tuamow kowi pawla now mami hownia anging powt kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 34:18" />Nami laiklow dow Hamawr iüah pachowh mih nauta khai. <verse eid="GEN 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 34:19" />Sekem mih Jakawb chama kowi lainowmma naukhi khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow Jakawb chapauüa laiklow chün khai. Aia dow amatni kimchak kowi kowh aring akaw lang uowi mih maru chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 34:20" />Now Hamawr hai Sekem iüah pachowh dow marow tapplawt re-e kowkowiah hanow marowchakuüa kowi kowtek pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 34:21" />Amatchi dow tek pe mih, “Sünta büa diah, paimi maru-uüa mih a-i kowh auiua chekhai. A-i pren kowi amatni nauowila kown mih arah paw ahuma chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni nau rah re-e makowi pacham uowi büah lah towbowt. Amatni kowh chamauüa kowi a-i paw pe lah, now a-i kowh chamauüa kowi paw a-i pe pawah lah. <verse eid="GEN 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 34:22" />Tawkchedow amatni tek iawng a-i chang pe lup achap kown takla. Amatni iawng a-i kachakuüa maten mih nahiahta khampha uanh pik kown takla. Naiawng che a-i chang pe hanow a-i hown achap sang iawng tawi taiua uowi büah kown mih nauta chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 34:23" />Nami lup che a-i chang pe hanow amatni kowh chia tawn, rua hai ruapur tawn, dawngthawnguan hai akeng mih tawncher hawmh maten a-i kowh nachowng bowk kown towbowt. Naiawng rakowi chu, amatni tek iawng a-i chang diah sik, now amatni dow a-i hown natawi uowi kown towbowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 34:24" />Nahanow marow kowi kowh kachakuüa maten dow Hamawr hai achapa Sekem iüah tek iawng nauta khai. Amatni bowkbowk dow hiah khampha uanpik khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 34:25" />Tawkchedow nami sum ni kowh ni khe kachakuüa kowh khampha uanpik hiah lawi rau reng tak khe Dina kowh rakmow sin Simiawn hai Levi iüah mih pawla saidawng now marow kowi kowkup khai, now marow kowi kowh kachakuüa maten kowi krawi saita bowk iüah khai. Naiawng naown kown mih marowchakuüa dow miapaw owm dowi chowdiah. <verse eid="GEN 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 34:26" />Amatchi dow Hamawr hai achapa Sekem kowi paw saila khai. Now Sekem kim hownia Dina kowi mih uang pawla iüah khai. <verse eid="GEN 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 34:27" />Jakawb kowh akeng mih chapauüa dow atuamow kowi piak pe siri mih marow kowi kowkup khai. Amatni dow kowng mih uak ün khila büah khai, now nami marow kowi uowi mih maten pawla büah bowk khai. <verse eid="GEN 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 34:28" />Amatni dow marow lak kowi kowh hai uat kowi kowh chia ün, rua hai ruapur ün, kawrngaramchük ün, tawncher uowi mih maten pawla büah bowk khai. <verse eid="GEN 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 34:29" />Nami klen kowi nami marow kowi kowh masiuüa hai ngeuüa maten kowi paw khümla büah khai, now dawngthawnguan hai kim kowi kowh uowi mih maten paw pawla bowk khai.<verse eid="GEN 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 34:30" />Nami kung kowi Simiawn hai Levi iüah kowi Jakawb tek pe mih, “Enchi rakowi mami pren kowi kowh Kananuüa hai Perizuüa nasui ang kown towbowt. Enchi uang pawla ang phih mih chekhai. A-i dow maru iun a-echow taih. Amatni takrüpah hanow uang sen a-i mih khin khe pakimma a-i nakowng kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 34:31" />Nachenganchepaw Simiawn hai Levi iüah tek pe a-pa mih, “Anging kowh tuamow kowi maru nanüla <char style="w">chawkkrawma</char> kown mih iung khai bow?” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="GEN 35" />
  <para style="s">Kanan pren kowi kowh Bethel kowi Jakawb kowkowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 35:1" />Nami kung kowi Thurai tek pe Jakawb mih, “Kawmat dow Bethel marow kowi kowkowi hanow kowhing uowi towbowt. En taimow Esau hownia en cham powt khe kowh en tut-e uang tatüng mih Thurai vüi nakowi kowthawp pe phuchuara lowk diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 35:2" />Naiawng rakowi Jakawb mih aia kimchakuüa hai aia kowh naruüa maten kowi tek pe mih, “Enni tut-e kowh uowi mih arup maten kuakta büa diah, now enni matia paw tachim tasai büa diah. Nami klen kowi enni kowh khupdip tawngklai paw leta büa diah. <verse eid="GEN 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 35:3" />Chu, Bethel kowi a-i kowkowi diah sik. Nakowi Thurai vüi ang nathawp phuchuara lowk kown; aia dow akrat pusa mih khin khe khowng ang reng, now ang cham kowi rah towng kowi paw tawi uowila ang reng chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 35:4" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow amatni tut-e kowh arup uowi mih maten hai amatni kowh ramseng ün Jakawb rut kowi apta pe bowk khai. Naiawngün dow Sekem marow ria re-e kowh sasua singh tut kowi Jakawb kowdupta khai.<verse eid="GEN 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 35:5" />Nami kung kowi dow amatni mih tarü khai bowt. Now tiama rawng kowi mang büah thüm mih khin khe aria aret kowi kowh marowchakuüa maten tut-e kramra ahuma Thurai iu pe pe khai. Naiawng rakowi Jakawb kowh maru-uüa kung kowi miapaw krawi uam krawi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 35:6" />Now Jakawb hai aia kowh maru maten mih Kanan pren kowi kowh Luz marow kowi kowtowm khai bowt. Luz marow dow Bethel marow chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 35:7" />Nakowi dow aia thawp phuchuara lowk khai. Nami arah ming dow El-Bethel pahai chap pe khai. (El-Bethel pami dow “Bethel kowi kowh Thurai” pami chekhai). Tawngplawng kowchow panow ataimow Esau hownia aia cham powt mih khin khe Thurai mih nami arah re-e aia tut-e uang tatüng pe khai.<verse eid="GEN 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 35:8" />Nakowi uowi büah mih khin khe Jakawb u Rebeka kowh narma Debawra pami dow kowng khai. Debawra kowi dow Bethel marow ria kowi kowh sasua singh tut ria kowi dupah khai. Naiawng rakowi nami arah ming dow Alawn-Bakut pahai chap pe khai. (Alawn-Bakut pami dow “Kar mih singh” pami chekhai).<verse eid="GEN 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jakawb kowi Israel pahai Thurai rük pe ming sar mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 35:9" />Padan-aram hownia uang plan kung kowi paw Thurai mih Jakawb tut-e uang plan tatüng pe hanow peah prasi khai. <verse eid="GEN 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 35:10" />Thurai tek pe mih, “En ming dow Jakawb chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw kawmat hownia now Jakawb pahai nahaw en kown nadowi bowt; en ming mih Israel naown bowt kown,” pape khai. Nahanow aia dow Israel pahai rük pe ming khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 35:11" />Now Thurai plan tek pe mih, “Ang chowbowt lowra nowngia chang mih Thurai. Ahuma prek chu prek chah diah. En hownia chenchap ahuma nauang uowi kown. En krungchakuüa hownia mang paw akawmma nauang phaw kown. <verse eid="GEN 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 35:12" />Abraham hai Isak iüah kowi kowh ang peah mih pren ang nape en kown. Nami pren dow en kung kowi kowh nauang ta uowi kown mih en krungchakuüa kowi paw ang napeah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 35:13" />Now Jakawb hown ki taklang kung kowi dow Thurai mih nami hownia awr pün khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 35:14" />Nahanow Jakawb dow Thurai klangah mih arah re-e chowk hua lowk khai. Nami hua chowkia luk kowi dow khamah mih uanap aia awr ap khai. Aia dow nami hua luk kowi klai pe sau hanow Thurai vüi chimsaiah khai. <verse eid="GEN 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 35:15" />Now Thurai hown aia taklangla mih arah ming dow Bethel pahai Jakawb chap pe khai.<verse eid="GEN 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rahel kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 35:16" />Nami kung kowi dow Jakawb mih aia kimchakuüa hailawm Bethel hownia plan mang khai bowt. Now Efrat marow kowi kowtowm büah dowi rawnchow tak khe Rahel kowh dow kimuowi mu rau uown tarowng khai, now aia dow lainowmma kawm khai. <verse eid="GEN 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 35:17" />Aia kowh arau uang hu ngamlam mih khin khe pen sara tek pe mih, “Hangkow kram diah, khaleng paw kachakuüa chah iawk,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 35:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 35:18" />Nachenganchepaw Rahel dow kowng khai. Aia kowng kown chowbowt khe aia dow achapa ming Benawni pahai rükla pe khai. (Benawni pami dow “Ang kawmah mih chapa” pami chekhai). Nachepaw a-pa dow Benjamin pahai rük pe khai. (Benjamin pami dow “Kaucha iukma mih chapa” pami chekhai). <verse eid="GEN 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 35:19" />Now Rahel kowng hanow auak dow Efrat marow pra kowh mangla mih tiama ria kowi dupah khai. Efrat marow dow Bethlehem marow chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 35:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 35:20" />Jakawb dow Rahel kowh tadupra kuam luk kowi amat müa chowkla pe hua lowk khai. Nami hua dow Rahel kowh tadupra kuam luk kowi kawmat pat uowi reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 35:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 35:21" />Nami kung kowi dow nami hownia Israel mih tarowng mang khai iawk. (Israel dow Jakawb chekhai). Aia dow Migdawl Eder pami arah klen kowi kowkhup tangbung khai. <verse eid="GEN 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 35:22" />Nakowi uowi büah mih khin khe Reuben mih a-pa Israel changla masi mih narma Bilha hown taphua taiua khai. Nami lawnguan dow Israel paw tawi tuk khai.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="GEN 35:22">Jakawb kowh chapauüa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 35:22">Jakawb kowh dow chapa uowi laipre ia chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 35:23" />Leah hown kowh Jakawb rik kaah mih chapa dow Reuben. Nami kung kowi kowh dow Simiawn, Levi, Juda, Isakar hai Zebulun büah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 35:24" />Rahel hown kowh kaah mih dow Josef hai Benjamin iüah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 35:25" />Rahel kowh narma Bilha hown kowh kaah mih dow Dan hai Naptali iüah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 35:26" />Leah kowh narma Zilpa hown kowh kaah mih dow Gad hai Aser iüah chekhai. Naiawngün dow Padan-aram pren kowi Jakawb uowi khe kowh kaah mih chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 35:27" />Akung kowi dow Kiriat-Arba re-e kowh Mamre marow kowi a-pa Isak tut-e Jakawb kowkowi khai. (Kiriat-Arba dow Hebrawn marow chekhai). Nami dow Abraham hai Isak iüah uowila mih arah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 35:28" />Isak dow 180 ning mowr singla khai. <verse eid="GEN 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 35:29" />Aia dow alawngtangma khe kowng khai. Aia sing uowi mih khin khe aia kowh chownglawng dow thaulangma hai asowrma chekhai. Aia dow kowng hanow aia pipu-uüa tadupra kowi tawi tadup khai bowt. Aia kowi dow aia kowh chapa Esau hai Jakawb iüah mih dupah khai.<verse eid="GEN 35:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="GEN 36" />
  <para style="s1">Esau kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 36:1" />Mami dow Esau kowh krungchakuüa lawnguan chekhai. Esau dow Edawm chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 36:2" />Esau dow Kanan pren kowi uowi khe paw masi uowi sum ia chekhai. Amasi pre ia mih dow Kanan prenchak Hit chenchap Elawn kowh chama Ada pami lowk ia, now Hiv chenchap Ana kowh chama Awhawlibama pami lowk ia; Awhawlibama dow Zibeawn kowh chu chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 36:3" />Now alowk mih dow apama Ismael kowh chama Basemat chekhai. Basemat kowh rak dow Nebaiawt chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 36:4" />Amasi Ada hown kowh Esau kaah mih chapa dow Elifaz chekhai, now Basemat hown kowh kaah mih dow Reuel chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 36:5" />Now Awhawlibama hown kowh kaah mih dow Jeus, Jalam hai Kora büah chekhai. Naiawngün dow Kanan pren kowi Esau uowi khe kowh kaah mih chapauüa chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 36:6" />Akung kowi Esau dow amasiuüa hai achauüa, tasin taken miuüa hai anaruüa, aia kowh tawncher hawmh hai dawngthawnguan ün Kanan pren kowi kowh aia kaah mih srui pawla now cham powt khai; aia dow anaumow Jakawb hownia alak sangrumchow mih pren kowi cham powt khai. <verse eid="GEN 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 36:7" />Esau hai Jakawb iüah dow kurengma kangowh chekhai. Amatchi kowh dow tawncher hu lai rakowi arasang nataiua uowila kown mih süng talawk dowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 36:8" />Naiawng rakowi Esau dow Seir pren kowi kowh hungh prakowi kowpowt hanow nakowi kowuowi khai. (Esau dow Edawm chekhai).<verse eid="GEN 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 36:9" />Mami dow Seir hungh kowi kowh uowi mih Edawmuüa kowi prekah cheah mih Esau kowh krungchakuüa lawnguan chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 36:10" />Esau kowh chapa dow Elifaz hai Reuel iüah chekhai. Elifaz dow Ada hown kowh kaah mih chekhai, now Reuel dow Basemat hown kowh kaah mih chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 36:11" />Elifaz kowh chapauüa dow Teman, Awmar, Zefaw, Gatam hai Kenaz büah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 36:12" />Esau chapa Elifaz kowh dow aia changla masi mih narma Timna pami paw uowi lowk ia. Now Amalek dow Timna hown kowh kaah mih chekhai. Naiawngün bowkbowk dow Esau masi Ada kowh chu-uüa chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 36:13" />Reuel kowh chapauüa dow Nahat, Zera, Sama hai Miza büah chekhai. Naiawngün dow Esau masi Basemat kowh chu-uüa chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 36:14" />Awhawlibama kowh chapauüa dow Jeus, Jalam hai Kora büah chekhai. Awhawlibama kowh pa dow Ana, now Ana kowh pa dow Zibeawn chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 36:15" />Esau kowh chapauüa pungmadawng kowi tawngbak mih dow chen kowi kowh aluchow paw phaw ne chekhai. Esau kowh chapa ta Elifaz kowh chapa chowng aluchowuüa mih dow Teman, Awmar, Zefaw, Kenaz, <verse eid="GEN 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 36:16" />Kora, Gatam hai Amalek büah chekhai. Naiawngün dow Edawm pren kowi kowh Ada kowh chapa Elifaz kowh krungchakuüa chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 36:17" />Reuel kowh chapa chowng aluchowuüa mih dow Nahat, Zera, Sama hai Miza büah chekhai. Naiawngünuüa dow Esau masi Basemat kowh chapa Reuel kowh krungchakuüa chekhai. Naiawngün dow Edawm pren kowi uowi khe kowh kaah mih chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 36:18" />Esau masi Awhawlibama kowh chapa chowng aluchowuüa mih dow Jeus, Jalam hai Kora büah chekhai. Naiawngünuüa dow Ana chama Awhawlibama kowh chapauüa chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 36:19" />Naiawngünuüa dow Edawm kowh krungchakuüa kangowh chekhai. Amatni dow chowlowkkow chen kowi kowh aluchowuüa chekhai. (Edawm dow Esau chekhai).<verse eid="GEN 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Edawm pren kowi kowh hawt iawng uowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="GEN 36:20-21" />Hawr chenchap Seir pami dow Esau kowuowi dowi rawn hownia Edawm pren kowi kowh hawt iawng uowi mih chekhai. Seir kowh chapauüa dow Lotan, Sobal, Zibeawn, Ana, Disawn, Ezer hai Disan büah chekhai. Naiawngünuüa dow Hawr chen kowi kowh aluchowuüa chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:20-21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 36:22" />Lotan kowh chapauüa dow Hawr hai Hemam iüah chekhai. Lotan kowh tuamow ming dow Timna. <verse eid="GEN 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 36:23" />Sobal kowh chapauüa dow Alvan, Manahat, Ebal, Sefaw hai Awnam büah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 36:24" />Zibeawn kowh chapa dow Aiah hai Ana iüah chekhai. Ana dow cham thing a-pa Zibeawn kowh kawrngaramchük mih khin khe süngrüp süngkangma kowi cham krum tui den kuam lowk chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 36:25" />Ana kowh chapa ming dow Disawn, now chama ming dow Awhawlibama chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 36:26" />Disawn kowh chapauüa dow Hemdan, Esban, Ithran hai Keran büah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 36:27" />Ezer kowh chapauüa dow Bilhan, Zavan hai Akan büah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 36:28" />Disan kowh chapauüa dow Uz hai Aran iüah chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 36:29" />Hawruüa kowh aluchowuüa dow Lotan, Sobal, Zibeawn, Ana, <verse eid="GEN 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 36:30" />Disawn, Ezer hai Disan büah chekhai. Seir pren kowi kowh Hawruüa chen ming dow naiawngün aluchowuüa ming hownia chekhai. Seir dow Edawm chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Edawm pren kowi kowh manguüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 36:31" />Mami dow Israeluüa kowh mang uowi dowi rawn tak khe Edawm pren kowi kowh chowm mang mih manguüa ming chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 36:32" />Beur kowh chapa Bela dow Edawm pren kowi chowm mang khai. Aia kowh marow kri ming dow Dinhaba chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 36:33" />Bela kowng kung kowi kowh ta chowm mang mih dow Bawzra marow kowi kowh Zera chapa Jawbab chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 36:34" />Jawbab kowng kung kowi kowh ta chowm mang mih dow Temanuüa pren kowi kowh Husam chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 36:35" />Husam kowng kung kowi kowh ta chowm mang mih dow Bedad kowh chapa Hadad chekhai. Aia dow Moab pren kowi kowh Midianuüa kowi nowngta khai. Aia kowh marow kri ming dow Avit chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 36:36" />Hadad kowng kung kowi kowh ta chowm mang mih dow Masreka marow kowi kowh Samla chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 36:37" />Samla kowng kung kowi kowh ta chowm mang mih dow Rehawbawt marow kowi kowh Sawl chekhai. Sawl dow Iufratis aw pang kowi kowh uowi mih maru chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 36:38" />Sawl kowng kung kowi kowh ta chowm mang mih dow Akbawr kowh chapa Balhanan chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 36:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 36:39" />Akbawr kowh chapa Balhanan kowng kung kowi kowh ta chowm mang mih dow Hadar chekhai, now aia kowh marow kri ming dow Pau chekhai. Hadar kowh masi ming dow Mehetabel chekhai. Mehetabel kowh pa ming dow Matred, now Metred kowh pa ming dow Mezahab chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 36:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 36:40" />Esau kowh krungchakuüa chowng aluchowuüa mih dow Timna, Alva, Jethet, <verse eid="GEN 36:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 36:41" />Awhawlibama, Ela, Pinawn, <verse eid="GEN 36:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 36:42" />Kenaz, Teman, Mibzar, <verse eid="GEN 36:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 36:43" />Magdiel hai Iram büah chekhai. Naiawngünuüa dow Edawmuüa kowi kowh prekah cheah mih Esau krungchakuüa chekhai. Amatni dow Edawmuüa kowh aluchowuüa chekhai. Pren kowi kowh amatni cham uowiah mih arah ming srui dow amatni kowh ming iawng kangowh hai chap pe büah khai.<verse eid="GEN 36:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="GEN 37" />
  <para style="s">Josef khi mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 37:1" />Jakawb dow a-pa Isak uowila mih Kanan pren kowi uowi khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 37:2" />Mami dow Jakawb kimchakuüa lawnguan chekhai. Josef dow 17 ning chih khe ataimowuüa hown tawi taiua thing rua hai ruapur hawmh khai. Ataimowuüa dow a-urammow Bilha hai Zilpa iüah kowh chapauüa chekhai. Nami khin khe aia dow ataimowuüa kowh chowm krang uowi krang ngah mih lawnguan a-pa kowi tek pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 37:3" />Josef dow lawngtang pra kowh Israel kaah mih chapa chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow akeng mih chapauüa kowi lak-e Josef kowi lang sakrauah khai. Aia dow achapa Josef vüi sawt pe bawng mih kowrmow bawngthawng athawngma mih sown pe lowk khai. <verse eid="GEN 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 37:4" />Josef taimowuüa dow amatni kowi lak-e Josef kowi a-pa lang sakrau mih tuk hanow Josef kowi kingküaah büah khai. Amatni dow Josef hown aiungma miapaw taklang büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 37:5" />Akat khe Josef mih khi mang lowk khai. Nami aia khi-ah mih mang dow ataimowuüa kowi phat pe khai. Naiawng rakowi ataimowuüa mih aia kowi lang kingah dowi ngamlam chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 37:6" />Ataimowuüa kowi Josef tek pe mih, “Sünta büa diah, ang khi mang lowk. <verse eid="GEN 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 37:7" />Nami dow maiawng: Laih kowi a-i cheng cha thüm chowdiah. Nami khin khe ang kowh cha cheng mih awr taiowng downg khai. Now enni kowh cha cheng mih ang kowh cha cheng kowi patta lut now chupah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 37:8" />Now ataimowuüa tek pe Josef mih, “Tawng chow en ka tuak, anging luk kowi en nachowm mang ching kown pabow? Naiawng mih dow anging luk kowi chang alow kown mih en chekhai dowktow?” pape khai. Now ataimowuüa dow aia kowh mang lawnguan hai aia kowh laiklow rakowi aia kowi lang kingah dowi ngamlam chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 37:9" />Nami kung kowi paw Josef mih plan khi mang khai lowk iawk. Nami mang paw ataimowuüa kowi aia phat pe khai. Ataimowuüa kowi aia tek pe mih, “Sünta büa diah, ang plan khi mang lowk iawk. Nami ang khi mih dow sat, lama hai krek lailowk klüng chup ang khai,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 37:10" />Nami aia khi-ah mih mang dow a-pa hai ataimowuüa kowi aia phat pe khai. Now a-pa dow nangah se tek pe mih, “Tawng iawng mih mang chowbowt chow nami? Ang hai en u hai en taimowuüa krawng kowi tabawk krawm se en pur kowi nauang chup en nowm kown chekhai bow?” pape khai. <verse eid="GEN 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 37:11" />Nami kung kowi ataimowuüa dow Josef kowi lang naukhi-ah dowi ngamlam chekhai. Nachenganchepaw a-pa dow nami laiklow sak kowi towah phülü khai, aia dow amia kowi paw cham tek dowi chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josef kowi ataimowuüa sumah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 37:12" />Nami kung kowi dow Josef taimowuüa mih a-pa kowh rua hai ruapur hawmh nacham thing kownkow Sekem kowi tarü khai. <verse eid="GEN 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 37:13" />Akat khe Josef kowi Israel tek pe mih, “En taimowuüa Sekem kowi kowthing rua hai ruapur hawmh khai. Nakowi kowkowi diah snow,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:13">Josef tek pe a-pa mih, “Ow, ang kowkowi sow,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 37:14" />Israel plan tek pe Josef mih, “En taimowuüa hown rua hai ruapur hawmh tawng iawng chow uowi mih kowmü now uang tek ang diah,” pakhai. Naiawng tek pe now aia dow Josef kowi amatni uowi rah Hebrawn lawngrawi hownia Sekem kowi kowchinah khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 37:14">Now Josef dow Sekem kowi kowtowm khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 37:15" />Josef dow dowm kowi krawi cham ataimowuüa mih krawi mang panglang khai. Nami khin khe maru lowk ia dow naiawng Josef krawi mang panglang mih khita hanow lüntaah mih, “Tawng chow en krawi cham?” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 37:16" />Nami maru kowi Josef tek pe mih, “Ang krawi cham ang taimowuüa mih chowdiah chaw. Ang taimowuüa tawng kowi chow cham thing rua hai ruapur hawmh mih en ia tek ang kown bow?” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 37:17" />Nami maru tek pe Josef mih, “Amatni dow mami hownia powt khai bowt. Amatni powt kown mih khin khe maiawng tatek büah mih ang ta, ‘Chu, Dothan kowi a-i kowkowi lah,’ pakhai,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi Josef mih Dothan kowi kowkowi hanow nakowi ataimowuüa kowi kowkhi khai.<verse eid="GEN 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 37:18" />Ataimowuüa dow alakma hownia Josef kowi haikhita khai. Amatni dow Josef uang ting dowi rawn Josef kowi nasaiah kownkow hawt sangkrang khai. <verse eid="GEN 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 37:19" />Amatni dow lowkkowlowk tatek mih, “Pai iow mü madiah, khi mang mih maru uang khowk. <verse eid="GEN 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 37:20" />Chu, kawmat a-i kowsaita now kuam kowi a-i cham kuakta bowt lah. Josef kowi kaurawng uaramchak cham chata tüng khowk padow apa kowi a-i kowtek pe now na. Nahanow aia kowh mang dow akung kowi tawng iawng chow nata own kown mih a-i sam müah madiah sik,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="GEN 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 37:21" />Nachenganchepaw Reuben mih nami laiklow tawi tata hanow anaumowuüa rut hownia Josef kowi nalawngah kown tatuak khai. Aia dow anaumowuüa kowi tek pe mih, “Aia kowh sak pat dow hangkow paw pe diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 37:22" />Reuben plan tek iawk mih, “Saiah kown mih pat dow hangkow chang diah. Aia kowh asak paw pe dowi kowi mami süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh kuam kowi a-i kuakah diah sik,” pakhai. Naiawng anaumowuüa kowi Reuben tek pe mih dow amatni rut hownia Josef kowi lawngah hanow a-pa tut-e kowpawla kownkow chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 37:23" />Now amatni re-e Josef uang ting hown akrowksang ataimowuüa mih aia kowh kowrmow bawngthawng athawngma mih kür hown klüp pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 37:24" />Nami kung kowi dow ataimowuüa mih Josef kowi dowkah now tui uowi dowi mih akangma mih kuam kowi kuakah büah khai.<verse eid="GEN 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 37:25" />Nami kung kowi dow Josef taimowuüa mih amatni cha hawm kan kown chowbowt khe Gilead hownia Ismael chenchap kun chang miuüa uang haimang mih khita khai. Nami kun chang miuüa dow ut luk kowi nam iungma mih sau, asung khakma mih singh pun hai paingbawng pawla büah now Aigupta pren kowi kowkowi büah mih chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 37:26" />Nakhowk khe Juda tek pe atainau-uüa mih, “A-i kowh naumow kowi saita now nami lawnguan kowi tadata khai e tawng chow a-i kowh maratra uowi? <verse eid="GEN 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 37:27" />Aia dow a-i kowh naumow, now aia dow a-i hown pabuk panga chak chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow a-i saiah dowi kowi Ismaeluüa kun chang miuüa tut-e a-i sumah mih nalang iung kown,” pakhai. Now Juda tek iawng atainau-uüa dow nauta khai.<verse eid="GEN 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 37:28" />Now Midian prenchak Ismael kun chang miuüa uang ting dowi rawn amatni dow Josef kowi kuam hownia kowpawta khai. Now Josef kowi dow tai pirmi iun hown Ismaeluüa tut-e sumta khai. Nami kun chang miuüa dow Josef kowi Kanan pren hownia Aigupta pren kowi pawla khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 37:29" />Josef kowi sumah mih khin khe Reuben dow anaumowuüa re-e tawi uowi dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow kuam kowi kowmü Josef khai. Nakowi Josef kowi kowkhi dowi rakowi aia dow saktuak piak kowh aia kowh kowrmow sekta nak khai. <verse eid="GEN 37:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 37:30" />Aia dow kowplan now anaumowuüa kowi tek pe mih, “Kuam kowi Josef uowi dowi le! Kawmat tawng iawng chow ang nachangah bowt kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 37:31" />Nakhowk khe ataimowuüa dow ngen rua lowk hanow rua vi mih Josef kowh athawngma mih kowrmow kowi plik pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 37:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 37:32" />Amatni dow nami kowrmow pawla now a-pa kowi kowtüng pe khai. Now tek pe mih, “Mü madiah, anging cham kaah mih kowrmow, en chapa kowh kowrmow chünchü?” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 37:33" />Jakawb dow khita now achapa Josef kowh kowrmow pami tuk mat khai. Now aia tek mih, “Ang chapa kowh kowrmow lowmow. Aia kowi dow kaurawng uaramchak makta khai bowt lowmow. Josef kowi kaurawng uaramchak chata ngengche mih chekhai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 37:34" />Nami kung kowi dow Jakawb mih aia kowh kowrmow sekta nak khai, now khup sala uan hanow achapa vüi kowi akrama <char style="w">uowila uiting uangtak</char> khai. <verse eid="GEN 37:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 37:35" />Aia kowh akeng mih chapa chamauüa dow uang tawi tek pe sakklam lai khai. Nachenganchepaw tawng iawng mih sakklamra paw Jakawb hawt sünta pe dowi chekhai. Aia tek mih, “Ang kowng pat ang chapa vüi kowi ang nauowila uiting uangtak kown,” pakhai. Naiawng hai Jakawb dow achapa Josef rakowi kar khai.<verse eid="GEN 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 37:36" />Midian prenchak kun chang miuüa dow Josef kowi Aigupta pren kowi pawla now Pawtifar tut-e kowsumah khai. Pawtifar dow <char style="w">Faraw</char> kowh chintak mih chekhai, now aia dow kangchawng miuüa kowh aluchow chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 37:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="GEN 38" />
  <para style="s1">Juda hai Tamar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 38:1" />Nami khin khe Juda dow atainau-uüa hownia cham powt hanow Adulam kua kowi kowuowi khai. Aia dow nakowi kowh Hira pami maru lowk ia hown tawi taiua uowi khai. <verse eid="GEN 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 38:2" />Nakowi uowi mih khin khe Juda dow Kanan chenchap Sua pape mih kowh chama kowi naukhita khai, now nami masiuüa hown aia dow tachawng khai. <verse eid="GEN 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 38:3" />Nami masiuüa dow kum nau hanow pen chapa lowk ia khai. Achapa ming dow Er pahai a-pa Juda rük pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 38:4" />Nami kung kowi paw amasi dow plan kum nau hanow pen chapa lowk ia khai iawk, now achapa ming dow Awnan pahai a-u rük pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 38:5" />Nami kung kowi paw amasi mih kutplan kum nau hanow plan pen chapa lowk ia khai, now achapa ming dow Sela pahai a-u rük pe khai. Sela dow Chezib marow kowi uowi büah mih khin khe kowh dia mih chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 38:6" />Nami kung kowi dow Juda mih achapa lang ta mih Er kowi Tamar pami masiuüa hown pe tachawngah khai. <verse eid="GEN 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 38:7" />Nachenganchepaw Er dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi lainowmma nga khai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowngta khai. <verse eid="GEN 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 38:8" />Nami khin khe Juda tek pe Awnan mih, “En taimow ta mai mih kowi ta chawng diah. En dow anaumow chedow en luk kowi kowh kurdik uowi iawng en taimow kowi ta prek pe chu chah diah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">En dow anaumow chedow en luk kowi kowh kurdik uowi iawng en taimow kowi ta prek pe chu chah diah </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow ataimow kowh liu namitla dowi kownkow ataimow ta mai mih kowi ta chawng hanow rik kaah mih kachakuüa chah dow ataimow kowh chah pahai nadowkah kown mih chekhai. Juda rirow kowi dow ataimow paw masi kowh kala chah dowi kowi kowng khai hanow anaumow nata prek pe cha kown takla. Marka 12:18-27, Luka 20:27-33.</char></note>,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 38:9" />Nachenganchepaw Awnan dow aia hown kowh kaah mih chah aia krungchak nadowk pe kown nadowi pami tuk rakowi ka chah kown nau dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ataimow masi hown taphua taiua towng aia kowh khampha uanh tui mih prang kowi pe towkah khai. <verse eid="GEN 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 38:10" />Naiawng Awnan chang mih CHAKRAMANG dow naukhi dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Awnan kowi paw CHAKRAMANG kowngta khai. <verse eid="GEN 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 38:11" />Now Sela paw ataimowuüa iawng dow nakowng kown chekhai padow Juda tatuak khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi aiaumow Tamar kowi tek pe mih, “Ang chapa Sela iuk dowi mowr dow en pa kim kowi mamaimow iawng kowuowi diah towbowt,” pape khai. Naiawng rakowi Tamar mih Juda laiklow iawng a-pa kim kowi kowuowi khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 38:12" />Nami kung kowi akrama khe dow Sua kowh chama Juda kowh masi mih kowng khai bowt. Now Juda dow amasi prüa rau uowi dowi bowt mih khin khe Adulam kuachak aia auiua Hira hown Timna marow kowi kowkowi khai. Aia dow aia kowh ruapur pawi kep miuüa kowh lup nakowmü kownkow nakowi kowkowi mih chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 38:13" />Nami dowi rawn khe Tamar kowi maru lowk ia kowtek pe mih, “Sünta, en tarang cham kep ruapur pawi kownkow Timna marow prakowi tarü thüm khowk,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 38:14" />Now Tamar dow aia kowh mamaimow tawnguat klüpta hanow tawnguat klangiungma mih hown tatawng khai bowt. Now aia dow mumla lumowr hanow Enaim marow tapplawt re-e kowhawtchowm phülü khai. Naiawng Tamar chang mih dow Sela iuk khowk chepaw Sela hown atarang pe tachawngah dowi reng rakowi chekhai. Enaim dow Timna pra kowh mangla mih tiama kowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 38:15" />Tamar mumta lumowr khai rakowi Juda dow khita hanow Tamar kowi nüla chawkkrawma khai. <verse eid="GEN 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 38:16" />Aia dow aiamat iaumow kowi mapaw tuk mat dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi tiama ria kowi Tamar tut-e Juda kowkowiah now tek pe mih, “Uang, achi taphua taiua lah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:16">Tamar tek pe mih, “Taphua taiuala en mih sung tawng chow en pe ang kown?” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 38:17" />Juda tek pe mih, “Ang kowh rua hawmh hownia ang uang krawi sa en rua chah lowk kown towbowt,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:17">Tamar tek pe mih, “Nami en uang krawi sa ang dowi mowr en ta towla ang uanh ne kown takla,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 38:18" />Juda tek pe mih, “Tawng uanh chow ang ta towla en kown?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:18">Tamar tek pe mih, “En kowh raitua hai en matia kowh <char style="w">mur</char> aleng hailawm towla ang diah,” pape khai. Naiawngün uanh mih Tamar kowi ap pe hanow amatchi dow taphua taiua khai. Naiawng rakowi Tamar dow kum nau khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 38:19" />Tamar dow kim kowi kowplan mang hanow aia khupla mih khupdip tawngklai hai lu mum müa kowklüpta khai, now aia kowh mamaimow tawnguat mih kutplan khup khai iawk.<verse eid="GEN 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 38:20" />Akung kowi Tamar tut-e kowh ta towla mih uanh nakowklan kownkow Juda mih aia auiua kowi krawi peah rua chah lowk hanow kowchinah khai. Nachenganchepaw Juda kowh auiua mih Tamar kowi kowkrum dowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 38:21" />Nami khin khe nakowi kowh uowi miuüa kowi Juda kowh auiua lüntaah mih, “Enaim tiama ria kowi kowh chowm reng mih chawkkrawma tawng kowi chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 38:21">Nakowi kowh maru-uüa tek pe mih, “Makowi dow tawng iawng mih chawkkrawma paw uowi dowi kowbow!” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 38:22" />Naiawng rakowi nami maru mih uang plan hanow Juda kowi tek pe mih, “Masiuüa kowi ang kowkrum dowi. Nami klen kowi nakowi kowh maru-uüa tek tawng iawng mih chawkkrawma paw nakowi uowi dowi pe,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 38:23" />Now Juda tek mih, “Naiawng now ang ta towla mih uanh aia tut pacham uowi ngowngla towbowt. Naiawng nadowi now maru naprawng naren achi kown chekhai. Nami klen kowi en kowkrum dowi kowh smü dow rua chah mih ang krawi sa pe khowk chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tamar kum nau mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 38:24" />Sum la kung kowi dow chang iang kowh aiaumow pawm khai pe pami satang Juda tawi ta khai bowt. Nami tata hanow Juda tek mih, “Nami masiuüa kowi uang lawtla hanow maih kowi nawmah diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 38:25" />Now aia kowi uang lawtla mih khin khe Tamar mih atarang tut-e kowchin maru lowk ia khai. Tamar krawi tek pe mih, “Sakrauma hown maiawngün uanh mih müah kaneu diah. Mami raitua hai aleng hailawm mih mur mia kowh chow? Ang kum nau mih dow maiawngün uanh iah hown chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 38:26" />Juda dow naiawngün uanh tuk matta hanow tek mih, “Aia dow ang lak-e lang iung but chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang chapa Sela hown ang pe tachawngah dowi rakowi naiawng aia chang mih chekhai,” pakhai. Nami kung hownia now Tamar hown katpaw aia taphua taiua dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 38:27" />Kimuowi mu rau uang phaw mih khin khe Tamar kowh chah phir chekhai pami tuk büah khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 38:28" />Aia uowi kim khe lowk ia mih kowh dow rut uai rik chawn khai. Nakhowk khe lasin iang aringma mih hown nami rut kowi pen sara sük pe hanow tek mih, “Mami dow uang rik dia mih chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 38:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 38:29" />Nachenganchepaw nami nau plan kupta rut hanow ataimow mih uang chawn plawi khai. Nakhowk khe pen sara tek mih, “En naumow kowi etla now tawng iawng chow en uang tuk chawn khai?” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi aming dow Perez pahai rük pe khai. (Perez pami dow “Etla now uang chawn mih” pami chekhai).<verse eid="GEN 38:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 38:30" />Nami kung kowi dow rut kowi lasin iang aringma mih sükchow anaumow uang ta chawn khai. Now aming dow Zera pahai rük pe khai.<verse eid="GEN 38:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="GEN 39" />
  <para style="s">Josef hai Pawtifar kowh masi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 39:1" />Akung kowi dow Ismael kun chang miuüa mih Aigupta pren kowi Josef kowi kowpawla khai. Now amatni dow aia kowi Pawtifar tut-e kowsumah khai. Pawtifar dow Faraw kowh chintak mih chekhai. Aia dow Faraw kangchawng miuüa kowh aluchow chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 39:2" />CHAKRAMANG dow Josef tut-e tawi uowi reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Josef changah mih lup srui dow aiungma uang phaw khai. Aia kowi dow Aigupta maru Pawtifar kim kowi towah khai. <verse eid="GEN 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 39:3" />Pawtifar dow Josef changah mih srui aiungma uang phaw mih hawt khi pe khai. Now aia dow Josef tut-e CHAKRAMANG tawi uowi reng pami tuk khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 39:4" />Naiawng hai Pawtifar dow Josef kowi aiungma mih maru padow tuk khai. Josef kowi dow aiamat kowh chintak mih kowi towah khai. Aia dow aia kowh kim üa hai dawngthawnguan naming nakhet kown mih kurdik Josef kowi peah khai. <verse eid="GEN 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 39:5" />Naiawngün kurdik Josef kowi Pawtifar ap pe kung kowi CHAKRAMANG dow Josef rakowi Pawtifar kowh uowi mih uanh srui luk kowi peah prasi khai. CHAKRAMANG dow Pawtifar kowh üa hai laih kowi kowh ru mih srui kowi paw peah prasi khai. <verse eid="GEN 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 39:6" />Naiawng phaw mih khi hanow Pawtifar dow aia kowh uowi mih maten naming nakhet kown mih kurdik Josef kowi pe pe khai. Aia dow hawm chak kan chak klen kowi tawng iawng mih lup paw tawi tuak dowi bowt chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 39:6">Josef dow kow ru hai apowm klangiungma chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 39:7" />Now akung kowi dow Pawtifar kowh masi mih Josef kowi naukhita khai. Akat khe Pawtifar kowh masi tek pe Josef mih, “Ang hown uang tawi taiua mawk diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 39:8" />Nachenganchepaw Josef dow nau pe dowi. Josef tek pe mih, “Mü diah, mami kim kowi ang uang uowi rakowi ang kowh kim iah mih tawngpaw tawi tuak dowi bowt. Aia kowh uowi mih maten naming nakhet kownkow ang luk kowi peta ang kurdik khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 39:9" />Mami kim kowi naming nakhet kown mih maru dow ang luk kowi miapaw uowi dowi bowt. Now en dow aia kowh masi chekhai, aia dow en klen kowi akeng mih maru-uüa kowi dow ang dak kowi towah khai. Naiawng rakowi en luk kowi naiawng mih suiiai kaniaima mih lup ngak ang ia chang dowi tham. Naiawng che ang chang hanow Thurai kowi ang kingküa mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 39:10" />Nachenganchepaw Pawtifar kowh masi dow nami laiklow ni towng tek pe khai. Naiawng tek pe rengreng chepaw Josef dow tawi mawk pe dowi. Nami klen kowi aia hown atawnchow kowtawi taiua uowi kown mih khowm nau pe dowi chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 39:11" />Now akat khe dow aia kowh lup nakrawi chang kownkow kim lak kowi Josef kowkup khai. Nami khin khe kim lak kowi Pawtifar kowh masi klen kowi miapaw uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 39:12" />Nakhowk khe Pawtifar kowh masi mih Josef kowh khupdip tawngklai kowi dowk pe now küngah khai. Now Josef kowi tek pe mih, “Ang hown uang tawi taiua mawk diah,” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw Josef dow aia kowh khupdip tawngklai thuala now prang kowi lawtta pe khai.<verse eid="GEN 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 39:13" />Naiawng hai Josef dow thuala khupdip tawngklai now Pawtifar kowh masi hownia prang kowi lawt khai. <verse eid="GEN 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 39:14" />Nakhowk khe Pawtifar kowh masi mih kim kowi kowh uowi mih aia kowh naruüa kowi hawah khai. Now aia tek pe mih, “Mü madiah, Hebrai maru kowh kowrmow! Nape a-i rukrai kownkow aia kowi ang hua uang pawla mih chekhai. Aia dow napiak ang siri kownkow ang kim lak kowi uang kup chowdiah, nakhe atünma ang awr hek pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 39:15" />Aia dow ang hek klow kowi kram kowh thuala khupdip tawngklai now prang kowi lawt khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 39:16" />Now Pawtifar kowh masi mih ahua uang mang dowi mowr nami khupdip tawngklai aia tut-e towah khai. <verse eid="GEN 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 39:17" />Now akung kowi ahua uang mang mih khin khe naiawngün lawnguan mih ahua kowi aia hawt lawp pe khai. Aia tek pe mih, “En uang pawla mih Hebrai maru napiak ang siri kownkow ang kim lak kowi uang kup chowdiah. <verse eid="GEN 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 39:18" />Nakhowk khe atünma ang hek pe khai, now ang hek klow kowi kram kowh aia dow thuala khupdip tawngklai now prang kowi lawt khai,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josef kla thawng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 39:19" />Pawtifar dow amasi hawt tek pe mih laiklow tata hanow Josef luk kowi lainowmma kunmarau khai. <verse eid="GEN 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 39:20" />Naiawng rakowi Pawtifar mih Josef kowi Faraw ransu-uüa kowh thawngrum kowi phangah khai. Now Josef dow nakowi tawi uowi khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 39:21" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG dow Josef tut-e tawi uowi reng chekhai. Aia dow Josef kowi aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura tüng pe khai. Naiawng rakowi thawngrum chawng mih aluchow kowi Josef kowi naukhi-ah iawng CHAKRAMANG changah khai. <verse eid="GEN 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 39:22" />Now thawngrum chawng mih aluchow dow thawngrum lak kowi kowh uowi mih maru-uüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik Josef kowi peah khai. Now thawngrum kowi uowi miuüa dow Josef tek iawng chang khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 39:23" />Naiawng rakowi thawngrum chawng mih aluchow dow Josef kowi peta kurdik khowk mih luk kowi mingkhet tawi takla dowi bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG dow Josef tut-e tawi uowi reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Josef changah mih lup maten dow CHAKRAMANG pe phawah reng chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 39:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="GEN 40" />
  <para style="s1">Josef phuang mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 40:1" />Naiawngün kung kowi akat khe Aigupta pren mang kowh kawm thawp mih aluchow hai grep tui pek mih aluchow dow mang naukhi dowi iawng changta lup khai. <verse eid="GEN 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 40:2" />Naiawng rakowi Aigupta mang mih nami maru pre ia luk kowi lainowmma kunmarau khai. <verse eid="GEN 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 40:3" />Nami maru pre ia kowi dow Josef uowiah mih thawngrum lak kowi mang kowtowah thawng khai. Nami dow thawngrum chawng mih aluchow kowh kim kowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 40:4" />Now thawngrum chawng mih aluchow dow nami maru pre ia kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik Josef kowi peah khai. Naiawng hai amatni dow khin krama thawngrum kowi taiua uowi büah khai.<verse eid="GEN 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 40:5" />Akat khe dow mang kowh kawm thawp mih aluchow hai grep tui pek mih aluchow mih uar-e taiua khi mang iüah lowk chi khai. Nachenganchepaw amatchi kowh mang uan dow alangma kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 40:6" />Now auai rau amatchi tut-e Josef kowkowi mih khin khe amatchi dow mawnchürüchow kangowh hawt uowi iüah mih Josef kowkhi khai. <verse eid="GEN 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 40:7" />Nami khita now Josef lüntaah mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow arau dow enchi mawn lai kowbow?” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 40:8" />Amatchi tek pe mih, “Angching pre ia dow khi mang lowk chi khai. Nachenganchepaw nami mang uan naphuang angching kown mih maru miapaw uowi dowi,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 40:8">Josef tek pe mih, “Mang uan nowng phuang mih Thurai uowi nadowi bow? Enchi khi-ah mih mang phat ang iüah madiah,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 40:9" />Naiawng rakowi nami grep tui pek mih aluchow dow aia mangah mih Josef kowi phat pe khai. Aia tek pe mih, “Mang lak kowi dow ang pur kowi ang khi grep ruih atut. <verse eid="GEN 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 40:10" />Nami grep ruih kowi mih aprek uowi sum buk. Nami aprek kowi dow aram awr thawn hown krowksang awr pau khai, now apawt apawtma awr uih hanow awr min khai. <verse eid="GEN 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 40:11" />Nami khin khe Faraw kowh bia mih ang rut kowi chekhai. Now ang krawi klek grep uih hanow nami bia kowi ang pet pe atui khai, now nami dow Faraw kowi ang peah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 40:12" />Josef tek pe mih, “Nami mang uan dow maiawng: Aprek uowi sum buk mih uan dow sum ni pami chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 40:13" />Ani hownia sum ni kowh ni khe mami hownia Faraw nalawtla en hanow en changla mih lup naplan pe chang en iawk kown. Now alai kowh iawng dow Faraw kowh grep tui pek mih en nachowng iawk kown. <verse eid="GEN 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 40:14" />Nachenganchepaw thawngrum hownia en khalat mih khin khe tuakla ang dit ba. En rakowi mami thawngrum hownia ang nowng lawtla kownkow sakrauma hown ang lawnguan Faraw kowi tek pe dit. <verse eid="GEN 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 40:15" />Lainowm che tek now Hebraiuüa pren hownia khümla ang now kür hown uang pawla ang mih chekhai. Nami klen kowi mami pren kowi ang uang uowi mih khin khe paw mami thawngrum kowi naklala pat mih angak tawngpaw ang chang dowi chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 40:16" />Faraw kowh kawm thawp mih aluchow dow a-auiua kowh mang uan aiungma chekhai mih tuk hanow aia paw aia kowh mang Josef kowi phat pe khai. Josef kowi tek pe mih, “Ang paw khi mang lowk. Ang khi mih dow ang lu luk kowi kawm kharang uowi sum buk. <verse eid="GEN 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 40:17" />Now aluk kowi kowh kharang kowi dow kawm chap ahuma uowi khai. Naiawngün kawm dow Faraw vüi chekhai. Tawkchedow uaklinguüa uang mownah now nami ang lu luk kowi kowh kawm mih uang chawtta khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 40:18" />Josef tek pe mih, “En kowh mang uan dow maiawng: Kharang sum buk mih auan dow sum ni pami chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 40:19" />Kawmat hownia sum ni kowh ni khe Faraw nadungta en lu hanow en kowh buk dow singh kowi natarta en hüah kown, now uaklinguüa uangah hanow en buk kowi kowh nga mih nauang chawt en kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 40:20" />Now sum ni kowh ni khe dow Faraw kowh dia ni chekhai bowt. Nami ni dow aia nimkrüa kowi kowh lup chang miuüa maten kowi Faraw chang pe pawi lowk khai. Nami ni khe aia kowh kawm thawp mih aluchow hai grep tui pek mih aluchow kowi thawngrum hownia uang lawtla now maru kawmuüa pur kowi uang pawla khai. <verse eid="GEN 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 40:21" />Now aia kowh grep tui pek mih aluchow kowi dow auown khe kowh lup Faraw plan pe changah khai. Nami hownia now nami maru dow Faraw kowh grep tui pek mih lup plan chang khai iawk. <verse eid="GEN 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 40:22" />Tawkche kawm thawp mih aluchow kowh buk dow singh kowi tarta hüah khai. Amatchi kowi Josef phuang pe mang mih auan powm iawng amatchi luk kowi uang ting khai. <verse eid="GEN 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 40:23" />Nachenganchepaw nami grep tui pek mih aluchow dow Josef kowh laimak tamata khai, Josef lawnguan kowi aia dow mapaw hing ka tuak dowi chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 40:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="GEN 41" />
  <para style="s1">Faraw khi mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 41:1" />Nami pre ning kung kowi dow Faraw mih khi mang lowk khai. Mang lak kowi aia khi mih dow Nail aw pang kowi aia iowng phülü khai. <verse eid="GEN 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 41:2" />Nami khin khe chia aiuk akauma kangowh mih ranit pum tui hownia uang awr towk hanow aw pang ria kowi kowh bawrchak bia kowi awr taw iualua khai. <verse eid="GEN 41:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 41:3" />Nami kung kowi paw nami aw hownia arawngrangma kangowh mih chia uang plan towk ranit pum khai iawk. Naiawngün dow aw pang ria kowi kowh aiuk akauma kangowh mih chia hawmh ria kowi kowtawi iowng khai. <verse eid="GEN 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 41:4" />Nakhowk khe arawngrangma kangowh mih chia hawmh dow aiuk akauma kangowh mih ranit pum mih chia hawmh kowi uang chata bowk khai. Now Faraw dow awr thowr khai.<verse eid="GEN 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 41:5" />Nami kung kowi paw aia dow kutplan müi hanow plan khi mang lowk iawk. Nami khin khe aia khi mih dow cha akawngchow mih kowi chapüi achakma kangowh mih uang awr lawt ranit püi khai. <verse eid="GEN 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 41:6" />Nami kung kowi dow keureuchow hai apli kangowh mih chapüi uang ta lawt ranit püi khai iawk. Naiawngün chapüi dow satlawt li den hown kowh keu mih chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 41:7" />Naiawngün chapüi dow uang rik lawt mih achakma kangowh mih ranit püi mih chapüi kowi uang iawnta bowk khai. Nami kung kowi dow Faraw mih thowr khai bowt. Now naiawngün dow mang lak kowi kowh aia khi-ah mih chowtaih padow aia tatuk khai.<verse eid="GEN 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 41:8" />Nachenganchepaw rau-e khe dow aia kowh saktuak mih lainowmma pusa khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow kowchin maru hanow Aigupta pren kowi kowh <char style="w">maiaklese sara</char> hai chanlai miuüa maten kowi uang hawla khai. Naiawngün maru-uüa kowi dow mang lak kowi kowh aia khi-ah mih phat pe khai. Tawkchedow nami mang uan mih naiawngünuüa miapaw nowng phuang pe dowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 41:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 41:9" />Nami khin khe Faraw kowh grep tui pek mih aluchow tek pe mih, “Mangkri, ani dow ang kowh angak lawnguan ang ka tuak khai. <verse eid="GEN 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 41:10" />Akat khe mih ang hai en kowh kawm thawp mih aluchow luk kowi en kunmarauah khai. Nami khin khe kangchawng mih aluchow kim kowi kowh thawngrum lak kowi en tow angching khai. <verse eid="GEN 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 41:11" />Nami thawngrum kowi angching uowi khe paiak sang angching khi mang lowk chi khai. Nami mang uan dow alangma kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 41:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 41:12" />Nami khin khe nakowi mih kangchawng mih aluchow kowh nar klanguüachow mih paw tawi uowi lowk ia, nami klanguüa dow Hebrai maru chekhai. Nami klanguüa kowi angching kowh mang angching phat pe khai, now nami mang uan dow aia phuang angching khai. <verse eid="GEN 41:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 41:13" />Now angching kowh mang uan nami klanguüa phuang angching mih iawng dow uang phaw bowk khai. Ang kowi dow ang changla mih lup en pe chang ang khai iawk. Nachenganchepaw kawm thawp mih aluchow kowi dow singh kowi en tarah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Faraw kowi Josef phuang pe mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 41:14" />Nahanow Faraw dow Josef kowi nakowhaw kownkow kowchin maru khai. Josef kowi dow alenma thawngrum hownia uang lawtla khai bowt. Josef dow khaita mawmpawi hanow leta tawnguat khai, now Faraw pur kowi kowkowi khai. <verse eid="GEN 41:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 41:15" />Nami khin khe Faraw tek pe Josef mih, “Ang khi mang lowk chowdiah. Tawkchedow nami mang uan miapaw nowng phuang ang dowi. Nachenganchepaw phat en mang now nami auan en nowng phuang pe pami ang ta,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 41:16" />Josef tek pe Faraw mih, “Nami kür dow ang kowh uowi dowi. Nachenganchepaw Thurai mih naphuang en mang uan hanow nape en sakklamra kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 41:17" />Nakhowk khe Faraw tek pe Josef mih, “Mang lak kowi mih Nail aw pang kowi ang iowng phülü chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 41:18" />Nakhowk khe chia aiuk akauma kangowh mih ranit pum aw hownia uang awr towk hanow aw pang ria kowi kowh bawrchak bia kowi awr taw iualua khai. <verse eid="GEN 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 41:19" />Nami kung kowi paw nami aw hownia arawngrangma hai apowm akrangnangma kangowh mih chia uang plan towk ranit pum khai iawk. Aigupta pren paprenma kowi naiawng khowt mih chia klang ngak dow katpaw ang khi dowi tak. <verse eid="GEN 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 41:20" />Nami arawngrangma hai apowm klang ngakma mih chia dow uang rik towk mih aiuk akauma kangowh mih chia ranit pum kowi uang chata bowk khai. <verse eid="GEN 41:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 41:21" />Tawkchedow aiuk akauma mih chia hawmh kowi chata büah khai pami mapaw tuk matah dowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün dow aiuk akauma mih chia hawmh kowi chata büah dowi rawn khe kowh iawng aklang ngakma chowreng reng chekhai. Nami kung kowi dow ang thowr khai. <verse eid="GEN 41:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 41:22" />Nami kung kowi paw ang plan khi mang lowk iawk. Nami khin khe ang khi mih dow cha akawngchow mih kowi chapüi achakma kangowh mih uang awr lawt ranit püi. <verse eid="GEN 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 41:23" />Nami kung kowi dow keureuchow hai apli kangowh mih chapüi awr ta lawt ranit püi khai iawk. Naiawngün chapüi dow satlawt li den hown kowh keu mih chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 41:24" />Nami chapüi akeureuchow hai apli kangowh mih dow achakma kangowh mih chapüi kowi uang iawnta bowk khai. Naiawngün dow maiaklese sarauüa kowi ang tek pe khowk chowdiah. Tawkchedow nami auan miapaw nowng phuang ang büah dowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 41:25" />Nakhowk khe Josef tek pe Faraw mih, “Mangkri, nami mang pre chap mih auan dow pachapsang taih. Thurai dow aia nachangah kown mih uang tüng en mih chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 41:26" />Akauma kangowh mih ranit pum mih chia auan dow ranit ning pami chekhai, now achakma kangowh mih ranit püi mih chapüi uan paw ranit ning pami chekhai. En kowh mang pre chap mih auan dow lowkchow taih. <verse eid="GEN 41:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 41:27" />Now akung kowi kowh uang awr ta towk mih arawngrangma hai aklang ngakma mih ranit pum mih chia auan dow ranit ning khown nakuak kown mih ning chekhai. Satlawt li den hown kowh keu mih ranit püi mih chapüi auan paw ranit ning khown nakuak kown mih ning chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 41:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 41:28" />Thurai dow aia nachangah kown mih auan uang tüng en mih chekhai. Ang tek iawng dow nauang ting ngengche kown. <verse eid="GEN 41:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 41:29" />Aigupta pren paprenma kowi ranit ning mowr mih lainowmma luprak naphaw kown. <verse eid="GEN 41:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 41:30" />Nami kung kowi dow ranit ning mowr khown nakuak kown. Nami khin khe dow alai kowh ka luprak ahuma mih Aigupta maru-uüa natamata kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami khown dow napiakta pren kown chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 41:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 41:31" />Nami khown uang kuak mih khin khe dow maru-uüa mih alai kowh ka luprak ahuma mih naka tuak kown nadowi bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami khown dow lainowmma kramra nauowi kown chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 41:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 41:32" />Naiawng pre kat en khi-ah mih mang auan dow Thurai mih nami lawnguan kowi kamrütta khai bowt, now nami dow alenma aia nauang pe tingah kown chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 41:33" />“Naiawng rakowi mangkri mih kawmat hownia chanlaima mih hai prengia uowima mih maru kowi krawi cham lowk ia diah. Nami maru luk kowi dow Aigupta pren nakruitownla kown mih kurdik peah diah. <verse eid="GEN 41:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 41:34" />Nami klen kowi lup chang mih kowi kowh nakruitown kown mih maru iukuüa kowi paw pawah ne diah. Pren kowi ranit ning mowr luprak ahuma ka mih khin khe naiawngün maru iukuüa mih tanga bak kowi pabak mih nakrawi paw kown. <verse eid="GEN 41:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 41:35" />Naiawngün maru-uüa mih naiawng ahuma ka luprak khe kowh ning kowi luprak pacham krawi pawah lah; now pur prakowi nacha nakhamah kownkow mang nimkrüa kowi kowh marow towng kowi pacham krümah lah, now nami naming nakhet kown mih maru paw pacham tow pe lah. <verse eid="GEN 41:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 41:36" />Aigupta pren kowi ranit ning mowr khown kuak khe kowh nacha nakhamah kownkow naiawngün chakkham dow nakrümah kown, nahanow khown kuak mih khin khe pren kowi kowh maru-uüa nakowng kown nadowi bowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 41:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josef kruitown Aigupta pren mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 41:37" />Josef kowh nami laiklow dow Faraw hai aia kowh maru iukuüa tut-e lainowmma iung khai. <verse eid="GEN 41:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 41:38" />Naiawng rakowi Faraw tek pe aia kowh maru iukuüa mih, “Mami maru tut-e dow Thurai Lümla tawi uowi chekhai. Nami maru iawng mih mia kowi chow a-i cham ka bowt kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 41:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="GEN 41:39" />Now Faraw tek pe Josef mih, “Naiawngün tukra dow en kowh Thurai pe en mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi en klen kowi dow chanlaira hai prengia uowima mih maru miapaw uowi dowi bowt tham. <verse eid="GEN 41:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="GEN 41:40" />Naiawng rakowi ang kim kowi kowh kurdik maten en napaw kown takla. En kowh ana pek iawng ang kowh maru-uüa nachün kown. Ang kowh lang iukra dow ang kowh mang chowm rah kowi krowngchow towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 41:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="GEN 41:41" />Nami klen kowi Faraw tek pe Josef mih, “Aigupta pren paprenma kowi kruitown mih arah ang peta en khowk pami sak kowi towah diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 41:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="GEN 41:42" />Nami kung kowi dow Faraw mih aia kowh mur uowi mih rutbüt aia rut hownia klüpah hanow Josef kowi krua pe khai. Now aia dow Josef kowi tawnguat klangiungma mih khup pe hanow ngawng kowi ü pe kuh leng khai. <verse eid="GEN 41:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="GEN 41:43" />Now aia pren kowi kowh pre lawmbawr mih aia kowh <char style="w">kawrnga kari</char> kowi Josef kowi pe chowmah khai. Nami kawrnga kari cham krawi lün mih khin khe Josef pur kowi maiawng krawi rik tek khai, “Tua kung büah, tua kung büah,” pakhai. Naiawng hai Faraw mih Aigupta pren kowi nakruitownla kown mih kurdik maten Josef kowi peah khai.<verse eid="GEN 41:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="GEN 41:44" />Now Faraw tek pe Josef mih, “Ang mih kawmat paw mang chowreng tak. Nachenganchepaw Aigupta pren paprenma kowi kowh maru maten dow en kowh ana pek nachün kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 41:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="GEN 41:45" />Faraw mih Josef kowi Zefanat Pane pahai rük pe ming lowk khai. Now Pawtifera kowh chama Asenat hown Josef kowi Faraw pe tachawngah khai. Pawtifera dow Awn marow kowi kowh uamow chekhai. Nami kung kowi dow Aigupta pren paprenma kowi Josef cham krawi len kownkow lawt khai.<verse eid="GEN 41:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="GEN 41:46" />Aigupta mang ap pe pren kruitown mih rah khe Josef kowh ning dow 30 ning chekhai. Aia dow Faraw chowm rah hownia lawt hanow Aigupta pren paprenma kowi cham krawi len khai. <verse eid="GEN 41:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="GEN 41:47" />Now luprak uowi mih ranit ning kowi dow arawn amatma luprak phaw khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 41:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="GEN 41:48" />Josef dow nami ranit ning mih kowi Aigupta pren kowi kowh amaratma mih luprak marow kowi kowh anungra kim maten kowi nungah khai. Aia dow marow riaret kowi kowh üa hai laih hownia kowh luprak ün uang pawla now krümah khai. <verse eid="GEN 41:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="GEN 41:49" />Naiawng hai aia dow sata kowi kowh sema iawng luprak ahuma nungah khai. Naiawngün nungah mih luprak dow hu lai bowt rakowi nowng khaiah dowi bowt chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow hing khaiah dowi bowt.<verse eid="GEN 41:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="GEN 41:50" />Khown kuak dowi rawn khe Pawtifera kowh chama Asenat hown Josef mih ka chapa pre ia khai. Pawtifera dow Awn marow kowi kowh uamow chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 41:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="GEN 41:51" />Josef dow achapa lang ta mih ming Manase pahai rük pe khai. (Manase pami dow “Tamata mih” pami chekhai). Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia tek mih, “Thurai dow ang kowh akrat pusara maten hai apa kimchak lawnguan kowi pe tamata ang khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 41:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="GEN 41:52" />Nami kung kowi kowh chapa kowi dow Efraim pahai Josef rük pe khai. (Efraim pami dow “Pe ka ang chah mih” pami chekhai). Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia tek mih, “Ang kawm kratra pren kowi Thurai mih pe ka ang chah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 41:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khown kuak mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="GEN 41:53" />Nami kung kowi dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh ahuma luprak uowi mih ranit ning chur khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 41:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="GEN 41:54" />Nami kung kowi dow ranit ning mih khown kuak uown tarowng khai bowt. Naiawngün dow Josef tekah iawng uang phaw bowk khai. Aria aret kowi kowh pren maten paw nami khown kuak mih hownia nowngia plai dowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Aigupta paprenma kowi dow tawng kowi paw chakkham akhawr uowi dowi. <verse eid="GEN 41:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="GEN 41:55" />Aigupta pren kowi khown kuak hanow maru-uüa kowh dow chakkham khowk khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi maru-uüa dow Faraw tut-e kowlü chakkham khai. Nami khin khe Faraw tek pe mih, “Josef tut-e phai kowkowi büa bowt. Aia tek enni mih iawng chang büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 41:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="GEN 41:56" />Nami khown dow paprenma kowi krawi kuak khai. Aigupta pren kowi paw nami khown dow arawn amatma chekhai. Nami khin khe Josef dow chakkham nungra kim maten ho pe hanow Aigupta maru-uüa kowi sum pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 41:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="GEN 41:57" />Now akeng mih pren kowi paw nami khown dow arawn amatma chekhai. Naiawng rakowi naiawngün prenchak maru-uüa paw Josef tut-e nauang tawi ran chakkham kownkow Aigupta pren kowi uang khai.<verse eid="GEN 41:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="GEN 42" />
  <para style="s1">Aigupta pren kowi Josef tainau-uüa kowkowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 42:1" />Aigupta pren kowi chakkham uowi pe pami Jakawb tawi ta khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow achapauüa kowi tek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng enni tamüla mak reng tak?” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 42:2" />Jakawb plan tek pe mih, “Sünta büa diah, Aigupta pren kowi chakkham uowi pe pami ang ta khowk. A-i nakowngla dowi kownkow nakowi kowtawi ran a-i chakkham büah dit snow,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 42:3" />Naiawng rakowi Josef kowh taimowuüa hamüt ia mih kowtawi ran chakkham kownkow Aigupta pren kowi kowkowi khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 42:4" />Nachenganchepaw aiung angak nacham own tarawng pami rakowi Josef naumow Benjamin kowi dow ataimowuüa tut-e Jakawb krawi chin pe dowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 42:5" />Aigupta pren kowi kowran chakkham mih akeng maru-uüa thum kowi Israel kowh chapauüa paw tawi uowi khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Kanan pren kowi paw nami khown dow kuak khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 42:6" />Josef dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh kruitown mih chekhai. Pren maten kowi nasum chakkham kown mih kurdik dow aia luk kowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Josef kowh taimowuüa mih Josef pur kowi kowkowiah now krawng kowi tabawkah krawm se kowchupah büah khai. <verse eid="GEN 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 42:7" />Josef dow ataimowuüa kowi tuk matah khai. Nachenganchepaw tuk matah dowi mih iawng aia dow lai rangma hown ataimowuüa kowi klangah khai. Aia tek pe mih, “Tawng hownia chow enni uang?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 42:7">Ataimowuüa tek pe Josef mih, “Uang ran chakkham kownkow Kanan pren hownia anging uang mih chekhai,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="GEN 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 42:8" />Ataimowuüa kowi Josef tuk matah chepaw ataimowuüa dow Josef kowi tuk matah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 42:9" />Nakhowk khe Josef dow ataimowuüa lawnguan kowi kowh aia khi-ah mih mang ka tuak khai. Now aia dow ataimowuüa kowi tek pe mih, “Enni dow uang krawi kumit mih maru chekhai. Tawng mih re-e chow anging pren kowi achawng mih uowi mih uowi dowi mih enni uang krawi kumit mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 42:10" />Ataimowuüa tek pe Josef mih, “Nadowi chakramang, en naruüa uang ran chakkham mih chowtaih. <verse eid="GEN 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 42:11" />Anging dow apa sang mih chah chekhai. Anging dow maru ngak nadowi, en naruüa dow uang krawi kumit mih maru nadowi,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="GEN 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 42:12" />Nakhowk khe Josef plan tek pe mih, “Nadowi iowh, anging pren kowi tawng mih re-e chow achawng mih uowi mih uowi dowi mih uang mü kownkow enni uang mih chekhai,” pape khai. <verse eid="GEN 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 42:13" />Nachenganchepaw ataimowuüa tek pe Josef mih, “En kowh naruüa dow taichow nauchow kangowh, anging taichow nauchow dow laipre ia chekhai. Anging dow Kanan pren kowi kowh maru lowk ia kowh chapauüa chowtaih. Anging laipre ia kowi lang sawi mih dow apa tut-e ta uowi khai, now lowk ia dow kowng khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 42:14" />Josef tek pe ataimowuüa mih, “Enni lawnguan kowi ang tek mih na khai nowm. Enni dow <char style="w">dumiow</char> chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 42:15" />Nachenganchepaw aching chünchü mih ang nachaing enni kown; enni kowh naumow lang sawi mih makowi uang ting dowi mowr mami hownia enni naia lawt kown nadowi. Mami laiklow mih Faraw kowh sak lüklau hown ang tek khowk. <verse eid="GEN 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 42:16" />Enni kowh naumow kowi nauang pawla kownkow enni pungmadawng hownia kowchin maru lowk ia diah, now akeng miuüa dow thawngrum kowi nata uowi kown. Nahanow enni kowh laiklow aching chünchü mih ang natuk kown towbowt. Tawkchedow enni kowh naumow kowi che enni uang ia pawla dowi kowh chalow now Faraw kowh sak lüklau hown ang tek khowk, enni dow krawi kumit mih maru chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 42:17" />Naiawng hai Josef dow ataimowuüa kowi sum ni mowr thawngrum kowi towah khai.<verse eid="GEN 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 42:18" />Sum ni kung kowi Josef tek pe ataimowuüa mih, “Ang dow kram Thurai khai. Naiawng rakowi enni kowh asak sing kown nau now ang tek iawng chang büa diah. <verse eid="GEN 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 42:19" />Enni che maru iungma na khai kowh chalow now enni taichow nauchow pungmadawng hownia thawngrum kowi pacham ta uowi lowk ia lah; now akeng miuüa dow kim kowi kowh akhawr hown uowi miuüa vüi pawla chakkham now pacham mang lah. <verse eid="GEN 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 42:20" />Enni kowh naumow lang sawi mih kowi ang tut-e uang pawla khe chiang enni tekah mih laiklow na khai nowm pami ang natuk kown. Nahanow kowngra hownia enni naplai kown towbowt,” pakhai. Now Josef tek iawng ataimowuüa nauta khai.<verse eid="GEN 42:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 42:21" />Nami kung kowi amatni dow lowkkowlowk tatek mih, “A-i naumow luk kowi a-i chang nowng khai rakowi mami ripra a-i tut-e uang towm mih chekhai. A-i tut-e aia lü lawt mih khin khe aia kowh saktuak krat mih a-i khi pe khowk chepaw a-i pe pe ching dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi mami kratra a-i luk kowi uang towm mih chowbowt,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="GEN 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 42:22" />Nakhowk khe anaumowuüa kowi Reuben tek pe mih, “Aia luk kowi tawng iawng mih angak paw hangkow chang pami ang tek enni khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw ang laiklow enni sünta ang dowi. Kawmat dow aia kowi saita mih sung a-i ka kown mih khin uang towm khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 42:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 42:23" />Ataimowuüa kowh laiklow Josef tukta mih ataimowuüa tuk dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni hown taklang mih khin khe amatni takra kowi lai plan mih tawi uowi lowk ia chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 42:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 42:24" />Josef mih ataimowuüa hownia alak sangrumchow cham powt hanow cham kar khai. Nami kung kowi dow aia mih uang plan hanow ataimowuüa hown uang plan taklang khai iawk. Now Josef mih ataimowuüa pungmadawng hownia Simiawn kowi dowkah now amatni pur kowi natawmah kownkow aia maru-uüa kowi peah ana khai.<verse eid="GEN 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 42:25" />Nami kung kowi ataimowuüa kowh sala kowi nachua pe chakkham hanow nami sala lak kowi tangka paw nakrawi plan phang pe kownkow aia maru-uüa kowi Josef peah ana khai. Nami klen kowi tiama rawng kowi kowh ataimowuüa nacha nakhamla kown mih chakkham paw nakrawi peah kownkow peah ana khai. Naiawng hai Josef kowh naruüa dow Josef tekah iawng krawi chang pe khai.<verse eid="GEN 42:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josef taimowuüa Kanan pren prakowi mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 42:26" />Nami kung kowi dow Josef taimowuüa mih amatni kowh kawrngaramchük luk kowi tangla chakkham sala now mang büah khai. <verse eid="GEN 42:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 42:27" />Now amatni naiakah kown mih arah kowi tanai büah khai. Nami khin khe amatni tainau pungmadawng kowi lowk ia mih pe kawrngaramchük chakkham kownkow kowlat sala hanow sala mowr kowi kowh tangka khita khai. <verse eid="GEN 42:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 42:28" />Nami khin khe aia dow atainau-uüa kowi tek pe mih, “Mü büa diah, ang kowh tangka krawi planta ang khai. Nami tangka dow ang kowh sala mowr kowi uowi,” pakhai. Naiawng amatni khi hanow lainowmma kram büah khai. Amatni dow chür se chür se lowkkowlowk tatek mih, “Tawng iawng chowbowt chow Thurai chang a-i?” pabüah khai.<verse eid="GEN 42:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 42:29" />Amatni dow Kanan pren kowi kowtowm hanow naiawng phaw mih lawnguan a-pa Jakawb kowi kowlawp pe bowk khai. <verse eid="GEN 42:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 42:30" />A-pa kowi amatni tek pe mih, “Aigupta pren kowi kowh kruitown miia lai rangma hown hawt klang anging khai. Aia dow amatni pren kowi kowkrawi kumit mih maru padow ka tuak anging khai. <verse eid="GEN 42:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 42:31" />Nachenganchepaw aia kowi anging tek pe mih, ‘Anging dow maru iung chowtaih, krawi kumit mih maru nadowi. <verse eid="GEN 42:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 42:32" />Anging taichow nauchow laipre ia mih dow apa sang chekhai. Anging laipre ia kowi lowk ia mih dow kowng khai bowt, now lang sawi mih dow Kanan pren kowi apa tut-e ta uowi khai,’ padow anging tek pe khai.<verse eid="GEN 42:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 42:33" />“Nakhowk khe nami pren kruitown mih tek anging mih, ‘Maiawng enni chang ang dowi mowr maru iung pami ang owm enni kown nadowi. Enni pungmadawng hownia ang tut-e ta uowi lowk ia hanow akeng miuüa dow kim kowi kowh akhawr hown uowi miuüa vüi tawng ngai chow lakke mih pawla now mang büa diah. <verse eid="GEN 42:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 42:34" />Now enni kowh naumow kowi ang tut-e uang pawla büa diah. Naiawng enni uang pawla khe chiang enni maru iung, krawi kumit mih maru nadowi pami ang naka tuak kown. Nakhowk khe chiang enni kowh tainau kowi ang lawt enni kown, now mami pren kowi enni ia chang kun kown,’ padow tek anging khai,” pape büah khai.<verse eid="GEN 42:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="GEN 42:35" />Nami kung kowi dow amatni mih klaita sala kownkow lat sala khai bowt. Nakhowk khe amatni bowkbowk kowh sala mowr kowi tangka uowi bowk chekhai. Naiawngün khita hanow a-pa Jakawb hai amatni tainau bowkbowk dow lainowmma kram büah khai. <verse eid="GEN 42:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="GEN 42:36" />Achapauüa kowi Jakawb tek pe mih, “Enni namata ang chah bowk kown chekhai. Josef kowng khai bowt, now Simiawn paw uowi dowi bowt. Nami klen kowi Benjamin kowi paw pawla kown mih enni nau khai. Enni towk ang kawm lai kowbow!” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 42:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="GEN 42:37" />Nakhowk khe Reuben tek pe a-pa mih, “Benjamin kowi che en tut-e ang uang ia pawla dowi kowh chalow now ang kowh chapa pre ia kowi kowngta now na towbowt. Benjamin kowi mih ang rut kowi krawi ap ang diah. Aia kowi en tut-e ang nauang plan pawla en ngengche sow,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 42:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="GEN 42:38" />Nachenganchepaw Jakawb tek pe mih, “Benjamin kowi dow enni tut-e ang nape tawiah kown nadowi bowt. Aia kowh taimow sin Josef mih kowng khai bowt, kawmat ta sing uowi mih dow aia lowk iachow towbowt. Tiama rawng kowi aiung angak enni krum khai e dow mami lawngtang kowi akawm akratma hown kowngra kowi enni nasaah kown chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 42:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="GEN 43" />
  <para style="s1">Benjamin kowi Aigupta pren kowi kowpawla mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 43:1" />Nami khown dow Kanan pren kowi uang lang hu ngamlam khai. <verse eid="GEN 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 43:2" />Now Aigupta pren hownia kowh Israel chapauüa uang pawla mih chakkham dow khowk khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi Israel tek pe achapauüa mih, “Aigupta pren kowi kowplan kowi büah hanow kowran a-i chakkham büa iawk diah,” pakhai. Israel dow Jakawb chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 43:3" />Nakhowk khe Juda tek pe a-pa mih, “Nami pren kruitown mih maru dow, ‘Enni kowh naumow kowi che enni uang pawla dowi now ang pur kowi hauang büah tham bowt,’ padow krawi tek anging napnap chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 43:4" />Naiawng rakowi en che anging kowh naumow kowi krawi chin anging hanow en vüi kowi anging kowia ran en chakkham kown taih. <verse eid="GEN 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 43:5" />Nachenganchepaw Benjamin kowi che en krawi chin anging dowi now anging paw kowkowi dowi bowt tham. Nami pren kruitown mih tek anging mih, ‘Enni kowh naumow kowi che enni uang pawla dowi now ang pur kowi hauang büah tham bowt,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 43:6" />Nakhowk khe Israel tek pe mih, “Enni kowh naumow uowi lowk tak pami laiklow tawngplawng kowchow aia kowi enni kowtuk tek pe khai? Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng enni tuk chang ang khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 43:7" />Achapauüa tek pe mih, “Nami maru mih anging lawnguan hai a-i kimchak lawnguan kowi asipma lünta anging khai. Aia tek anging mih, ‘Kawmat paw enni kowh pa sing uowi reng tak bow? Enni taichow nauchow uowi ne tak bow?’ padow lünta anging khai. Nami maru lünta anging iawng anging klangah khai. Nakhowk khe aia tek anging mih, ‘Enni kowh naumow kowi uang pawla büa diah,’ pakhai. Naiawng aia natek anging kown mih amia chow tuk?” pabüah khai.<verse eid="GEN 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 43:8" />Nakhowk khe Juda tek pe a-pa mih, “Benjamin kowi krawi chin anging diah. Now alenma Aigupta pren kowi anging tarü kown towbowt. Nahanow en hai anging hown anging kowh chauüa paw nasing kown, nakowng kown nadowi. <verse eid="GEN 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 43:9" />Benjamin vüi kowi ang takham khowk. Aia rakowi en naia pe ang aprek kown. Aia kowi che en tut-e ang uang ia plan pawla en dowi now nami aprek mih ang tut-e achowngma pauowi lah. <verse eid="GEN 43:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 43:10" />Makhowt anging kra dowi e dow kawmat mowr kowi anging kowkowi kowh uang ia plan pre kat bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 43:11" />Nakhowk khe a-pa Jakawb tek pe kowbüah mih, “Naiawng chekhai now maiawng chang büa diah. Enni kowh sala hown aia vüi pawla pe awmrawm sung ne diah. Mami pren kowi kowh asung khakma mih singh pun, kuai tui, nam iungma mih sau, nam iungma mih paingbawng hai madam chap maiow pawla pe büa diah. <verse eid="GEN 43:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 43:12" />Khaleng dow pre dungna chi pawla tangka büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow sala mowr kowi kowh amatni uang krawi planta mih tangka paw enni naplanta pe kown takla. Naiawngün dow amatni tawi kowh uang krawi phangta mih tarawng. <verse eid="GEN 43:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 43:13" />Enni kowh naumow kowi pawla now nami maru tut-e alenma kowkowi büa diah. <verse eid="GEN 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 43:14" />Lowra nowngia chang mih Thurai dow enni kowi nasaksing sanala kown mih saktuak nami maru luk kowi pacham peah lah. Nahanow nami maru mih enni kowh tainau Simiawn hai Benjamin iüah kowi enni tut-e pacham lawt enni lah. Now ang kowh chah tama khai chepaw pacham tama lah towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 43:15" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow naiawngün awmrawm sung, tangka pre dungna hai Benjamin kowi pawla hanow tarü khai bowt. Aigupta pren kowi kowtowm hanow Josef pur kowi kowiowng büah khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 43:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 43:16" />Now Josef dow ataimowuüa hown Benjamin uang tawi mih khita khai. Aia dow aia kowh kim mingkhet mih kowi tek pe mih, “Naiawngün maru-uüa kowi ang kim kowi kowpawla diah. Now kowngen tawncher hanow koweng diah. Naiawngün maru-uüa mih ani dow ang hown taiua cha ni hawm kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 43:17" />Nahanow Josef tek iawng nami kim mingkhet mih dow chang khai. Aia dow nami maru-uüa kowi Josef kim kowi kowpawla khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 43:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 43:18" />Naiawng Josef kim kowi pawla mih tuk büah hanow amatni dow kram kowh tatek mih, “Aia kim kowi pawla a-i mih dow uang rik uang khe kowh a-i kowh sala kowi uang krawi planta a-i mih tangka rakowi naown. Khaleng dow aia natüng a-i aprek hanow nakhüm a-i kown towbowt, now a-i kowh kawrngaramchük ün kür hown napawta a-i hanow a-i kowi dow nachangla a-i nar kown towbowt,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="GEN 43:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josef hown atainau-uüa taiua cha hawm mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 43:19" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Josef kimplawt re-e kowtowm büah hanow kim mingkhet mih kowi tek pe mih, <verse eid="GEN 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 43:20" />“Chakramang, mami dowi rawn khe paw anging uang rik ran chakkham akat khowk. <verse eid="GEN 43:20" /><verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="GEN 43:21-22" />Nachenganchepaw anging plan mang mih khin khe tanaira kowi anging uow sala hanow chowlowkkow sala mowr kowi tangka uowi bowk mih anging khi khai. Naiawngün tangka amia chow krawi phang mih anging tuk dowi chekhai. Naiawngün tangka paw kawmat anging uang plan pawla iawk khowk. Nami klen kowi naranla chakkham kown mih paw anging uang plan pawla tangka küng tak,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="GEN 43:21-22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 43:23" />Nami kim mingkhet mih tek pe mih, “Hangkow kram büa diah, sakkhawtma hown uowi büa diah. Nami tangka dow enni hai enni pa kowh Thurai mih enni kowh sala kowi krawi phang enni mih chowbowt. Enni kowh tangka ang ka khowk,” pakhai. Now aia dow Simiawn kowi uang lawtla hanow amatni tut-e uang pawla pe khai.<verse eid="GEN 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 43:24" />Nami kung kowi dow aia mih amatni bowkbowk kowi Josef kim lak kowi kowpawla now peah tui khai, now amatni dow nami tui hown sau bawng sau pang büa khai. Aia dow kowbüah kowh kawrngaramchük ün kowi paw peah chakkham khai. <verse eid="GEN 43:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 43:25" />Sat downg khe Josef uang kown pami rakowi amatni dow amatni kowh awmrawm sung hawt kamrütta kaneu khai. Now amatni dow nakowi nacha hawm kown pami ta büah khai.<verse eid="GEN 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 43:26" />Kim kowi Josef uang mih khin khe dow amatni uang pawla mih awmrawm sung Josef kim lak kowi kowpawla hanow Josef kowi kowap pe büah khai. Amatni dow aia kowi krawng kowi tabawk krawm se chupah büah khai. <verse eid="GEN 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 43:27" />Amatni dow iung reng tak bow pami talünta büah kung kowi Josef lüntaah mih, “Enni tekah mih enni kowh pa alawngtangma pami iung reng tak chow? Aia dow kawmat paw sing uowi reng tak bow?” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 43:28" />Amatni tek pe mih, “Anging kowh pa en kowh nar kawmat paw sing uowi reng tak, now iung paw iung reng tak chowh,” pabüah khai. Nahanow amatni dow krawng kowi tabawk krawm se Josef kowi chupah khai.<verse eid="GEN 43:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 43:29" />Josef mih krawi tang mü hanow anaumow Benjamin kowi khita khai. Now Josef tek pe ataimowuüa mih, “Nami chowbowt bow enni tekah mih enni kowh naumow?” pape khai. Nami kung kowi Josef tek pe Benjamin mih, “Thurai pacham saksing sana en reng lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 43:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 43:30" />Josef mih anaumow kowi khita hanow lainowmma sak prüa rau uang khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow nacham kar kownkow nami hownia powt khai, now aia towklak kowi cham kar khai. <verse eid="GEN 43:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 43:31" />Nami kung kowi aia dow murta mowr prowng hanow uang lawt khai. Aia dow townta sak hanow aia kowh tainau-uüa kowi nathen pe hawm kan kown mih aia maru-uüa kowi peah ana khai. <verse eid="GEN 43:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 43:32" />Hawm then miuüa dow Josef hai atainau-uüa hown Josef kim kowi kowh tawi cha hawm mih Aigupta prenchakuüa kowi alang alangma then pe khai. Aigupta prenchakuüa dow Hebrai maru-uüa hown taiua cha hawm dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dow amatni tut-e suiiaima chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 43:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 43:33" />Now Josef dow atainau-uüa kowi amatni kowh ning taken iawng aia pur kowi pe chowmah khai. Naiawng rakowi atainau-uüa dow awda kowh lowkkowlowk lumowr prakowi tamü büah khai. <verse eid="GEN 43:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 43:34" />Josef dow aiamat <char style="w">pawitang</char> hownia kowh chakkham atainau-uüa kowi pela pe ne khai. Aia dow ataimowuüa kowi lak-e anaumow sin Benjamin kowi tanga phow lang peah hu khai. Naiawng hai amatni dow Josef hown taiua cha taiua kham büah khai. Amatni dow ahuma kham grep tui hanow lainowmma piaw büah khai.<verse eid="GEN 43:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="GEN 44" />
  <para style="s1">Tai bia tama mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 44:1" />Nami kung kowi aia kowh kim mingkhet mih kowi Josef peah ana mih, “Amatni ia kur mowr chi sala kowi chua pe chakkham diah, now amatni chowlowkkow kowh tangka amatni kowh sala mowr kowi krawi phangta pe diah. <verse eid="GEN 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 44:2" />Now lang sawi mih sala mowr kowi dow ang kowh tai bia hai aia ranla chakkham mih tangka paw krawi phang pe diah,” pakhai. Nami kim mingkhet mih dow Josef tek pe iawng chang khai.<verse eid="GEN 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 44:3" />Auai rau dow murpa atainau-uüa kowi kawrngaramchük hown amatni pren prakowi chinta khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 44:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 44:4" />Now atainau-uüa marow hownia lawt kowh cham ting sangrumchow taih tak khe aia kowh kim mingkhet mih kowi Josef tek pe mih, “Alenma kowbüah kowi kowkowi krawi diah. Kowbüah kowi en kowkrum khe maiawng kowtek pe diah, ‘Chang enni aiung mih takcha tawngplawng kowchow enni tuk changla angak khai? <verse eid="GEN 44:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 44:5" />Nami bia dow ang kowh kim iah khamla reng mih hai müla hawra reng mih lownow. Naiawng mih lup enni chang mih dow lainowmma enni chang angak mih chekhai,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 44:6" />Nami kim mingkhet mih kowbüah kowi tiama rawng kowi kowkrumta hanow nami laiklow dow kowtek pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 44:7" />Nachenganchepaw kowbüah tek pe mih, “Chakramang, tawng naiawng mih laiklow en tuk tek anging khai chow? En kowh naruüa naiawng mih lup mapaw chang dowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 44:8" />Sünta diah, uang rik uang khe kowh anging kowh sala mowr kowi kaah mih tangka khowm padow Kanan pren hownia anging uang plan pawla khai. Now tawngplawng kowchow en kowh kim iah kim hownia anging nauang kula kuh tai chow? <verse eid="GEN 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 44:9" />En kowh naruüa pungmadawng kowi amia iawng mih tut-e chow nami bia ka khai, nami maru kowi pacham kowngta lah, nahanow anging paw en nar iawng hai natawi uowi kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 44:10" />Nami kim mingkhet mih tek pe mih, “Lainowmma iung, enni tek iawng ang chang enni kown taih. Nachenganchepaw amia iawng mih tut-e chow nami bia ka khai nami maru chowtaih ang kowh nar nachowng kown. Akeng miuüa dow nami aprek tawi ka dowi tham,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 44:11" />Nahanow amatni dow amatni chowlowkkow kowh sala alenma krawng kowi iu kla büah hanow lat büah khai. <verse eid="GEN 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 44:12" />Nami kim mingkhet mih dow ata mih kowh sala hownia uownah hanow asawi mih kowh sala mowr krawi cham khai. Now Benjamin kowh sala kowi nami bia kata khai. <verse eid="GEN 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 44:13" />Nami khita hanow ataimowuüa mih saktuak piak kowh amatni kowh kowrmow sekta büah khai. Nahanow amatni dow amatni chowlowkkow kowh sala kawrngaramchük luk kowi tangla büah now marow prakowi plan kowi büah khai.<verse eid="GEN 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 44:14" />Juda hai atainau-uüa Josef kim kowi kowting mih khin khe Josef mih kim kowi hawt uowi reng tak chekhai. Now amatni dow krawng kowi tabawkah krawm se Josef kowi kowchupah khai. <verse eid="GEN 44:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 44:15" />Nakhowk khe Josef tek pe atainau-uüa mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng mih lup enni tuk chang khai? Ang iawng mih maru tuk mü hawra ching pami enni tuk dowi bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 44:16" />Juda tek pe mih, “Chakramang, tawng chow anging tek en bowt kown chow? Tawng iawng chow anging klang en bowt kown chow? Anging achi anawmma pami paw tawng iawng chow anging tüng en bowt kown chow? En kowh naruüa kowh aprek dow Thurai uang tüng pe khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi ka pe bia mih maru hailawm anging bowkbowk nachowng en kowh nar kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 44:17" />Nachenganchepaw Josef tek pe mih, “Naiawng mih lup dow mapaw ang ia chang dowi. Amia tut-e chow nami bia ka mih nami chowtaih ang kowh nar nachowng kown. Tawkche enni dow thaulangma hown enni kowh pa tut-e kowplan büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda lü anaumow mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 44:18" />Nakhowk khe Josef tut-e kowtatawnah hanow Juda tek pe mih, “Chakramang, sakrauma hai en hown pe taklang ang diah. En kowh arah dow Faraw kowh arah hown tale. Nachenganchepaw mami en kowh nar luk kowi hauang kunmarau diah. <verse eid="GEN 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 44:19" />Chakramang, anging uang rik uang khe en lünta anging mih, ‘Enni kowh pa sing uowi sak uowi reng tak bow? Enni taichow nauchow uowi ne tak bow?’ pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 44:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 44:20" />Nakhowk khe anging tek en mih, ‘Anging kowh pa lawngtang sing uowi sak uowi reng tak, now lawngtang pra kowh aia kaah mih chapa paw uowi lowk ia. Ataimow dow kowng khai bowt, now amatchi amachak kowi ta sing mih dow aia malowkchow towbowt. Naiawng rakowi apa mih aia kowi lainowmma sakrauah khai,’ pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 44:21" />“Nakhowk khe en tek anging mih, ‘Aia kowi ang tut-e uang pawla büa diah; aia kowi khi kown ang nau,’ pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 44:22" />Now anging tek en mih, ‘Aia dow a-pa kowi towla hanow uang ia tawi dowi tham. Aia che uang tawi now a-pa mih ta kowng kown towbowt,’ pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 44:23" />Nachenganchepaw en tek anging mih, ‘Enni kowh naumow kowi enni uang pawla dowi now ang pur kowi hauang büah tham bowt,’ pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 44:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 44:24" />Naiawng rakowi anging kowmang now en kowh nar apa kowi en kowh laiklow maten anging kowlawp pe khai.<verse eid="GEN 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 44:25" />“Nami kung kowi anging kowh pa tek anging mih, ‘Kowplan kowi büah hanow kowran a-i chakkham büah ne iawk diah,’ pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 44:26" />Nakhowk khe anging tek pe mih, ‘Anging kowh naumow anging hown tawi khe chiang anging kowkowi kown. Naiawng nadowi now anging kowia kowi dowi bowt tham. Anging kowh naumow anging hown tawi dowi now nami maru pur kowi anging kowia kowi dowi bowt,’ pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 44:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 44:27" />“Nakhowk khe en kowh nar anging kowh pa tek anging mih, ‘Ang masi Rahel penla ang chapa pre iachow taih mih enni tuk khowk. <verse eid="GEN 44:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 44:28" />Akat khe lowk ia mih dow ang pur hownia cham lawt khai, now akung kowi kaurawng uaramchak cham cha cham iaita naknak pami ang ta tuk khai. Nami hownia aia kowi katpaw ang khi dowi bowt. <verse eid="GEN 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 44:29" />Kawmat mami asawi mih kowi paw ang hownia enni cham pawla kowh cham kla phih khai hanow mami lawngtang kowi aprüa anguk hown enni nakowngta kown towbowt,’ padow tek anging khai.<verse eid="GEN 44:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="GEN 44:30-31" />“Naiawng rakowi chakramang, en kowh nar apa tut-e anging kowplan khe nami asawi mih kowi apa hawt khi dowi now apa nakowng kown towbowt. Nami asawi mih dow apa kowh sakrui iawng chekhai. Nahanow en kowh nar anging kowh pa lawngtangma mih kowi aprüa anguk hown anging nakowngta kown chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 44:30-31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 44:32" />En kowh nar ang dow apa tut-e nami vüi kowi ang takhamla khai, ‘Apa, aia kowi che en tut-e ang uang plan pawla en dowi now nami aprek dow ang tut-e achowngma pauowi lah,’ ang pape khai. <verse eid="GEN 44:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 44:33" />Naiawng rakowi chakramang, sakrauma hown nami asawi mih takcha ang kowi phai changla ang en kowh nar diah, now nami asawi mih kowi ataimowuüa hown pe tawi mangah diah. <verse eid="GEN 44:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 44:34" />Nami asawi mih kowi pawla dowi matchang tawng iawng chow apa tut-e ang nakowplanah kown chow? Apa luk kowi kowh prüa ngukra nauang ting kown mih ang nowng mü dowi tham,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 44:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="GEN 45" />
  <para style="s1">Atainau-uüa kowi Josef lawtah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 45:1" />Now Josef dow aia pur kowi kowh iowng miuüa re-e nowng taüp dowi bowt. Naiawng rakowi aia dow atünma tek mih, “Ang pur hownia lawt büah bowk diah,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi aia pur kowi kowh iowng miuüa dow lawt büah bowk khai. Nahanow aia dow atainau-uüa pur kowi taphuang khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 45:2" />Josef dow atünma kar khai. Nami aia kowh kar klow dow Aigupta maru-uüa tawi ta khai. Nami satang dow Faraw kim kowi kowh maru-uüa paw tawi ta khai.<verse eid="GEN 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 45:3" />Atainau-uüa kowi Josef tek pe mih, “Ang mih enni kowh tainau Josef chowbowt. Kawmat paw apa sing uowi reng tak bow?” pakhai. Nahanow atainau-uüa dow nami laiklow tata hanow kram kowh chür büah khai; naiawng rakowi amatni dow Josef kowi hing nowng klangah büah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 45:4" />Nakhowk khe atainau-uüa kowi Josef tek pe mih, “Sakrauma hown ang re-e uang tatawn büa diah,” pakhai. Now amatni kowtatawn hanow Josef tek pe mih, “Aigupta pren kowi cham chang kun miuüa tut-e kowh enni sumah mih enni kowh tainau Josef ang chowbowt. <verse eid="GEN 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 45:5" />Enni sumta ang khai chenganchepaw hangkow tuak krat büa diah, now kowmatia luk kowi paw hangkow takunmarau büa diah. Maru kowh asak naplaila kownkow enni dowi rawn Thurai uang rik chin ang mih chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 45:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 45:6" />Khown kuak mih pre ningchow taih tak. Nami khown dow nakuak tanga ning tak. Nami khin khe liu paw nasawt kown nadowi, now ngen paw nangen kown nadowi. <verse eid="GEN 45:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 45:7" />Lusa kowi enni kowh krungchak kowi nape plaiah kownkow hai piakra hownia awdara uowima hown nalawng enni kownkow enni dowi rawn Thurai uang rik chin ang mih chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 45:8" />Naiawng rakowi makowi enni uang chin ang mih nadowi, uang chin ang mih dow Thurai chowtaih. Thurai dow Faraw pa kowh arah kowi tow ang khai, now Faraw kim kowi kowh aluchow thawp ang khai. Nami klen kowi aia dow Aigupta pren paprenma kowi kowh nakruitown kown mih kowi tow ang khai.<verse eid="GEN 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 45:9" />“Kawmat alenma apa tut-e kowkowi now kowtek pe büa diah, ‘En chapa Josef krawi tek mih: Thurai mih Aigupta pren paprenma kowi kowh nakruitown kown mih kowi tow ang khai. En mih kra dowi kowi ang tut-e uang diah. <verse eid="GEN 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 45:10" />Ang hown kowh atawnchow mih Gawsen süng kowi uang uowi diah. En hai en chauüa, en chu-uüa, en kowh tawncher hai ruapur hawmh hai en kowh uowi mih maten uang pawla diah. <verse eid="GEN 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 45:11" />Khown kuak kown mih uowi tanga ning tak. Naiawng rakowi Gawsen süng kowi uang uowi diah, nakowi ang naming nakhet en sow. En hai en kimchakuüa hai enni bowkbowk nakhawrla dowi kownkow ang kamrüt enni chakkham sow,’ pakhai,” pape diah.<verse eid="GEN 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 45:12" />“Naiawngün laiklow dow ang matia nawr hown kowh ang tekah mih enni matia mik hown enni khi bowk khowk, now ang naumow Benjamin paw tawi khi khowk chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 45:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 45:13" />Aigupta pren kowi ang kowh ringkawra hai enni khi-ah mih maten apa kowi kowtek pe ngengche büa diah. Kawmat lenlenma kowkowi now apa kowi makowi uang pawla büa diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 45:14" />Nami kung kowi dow Josef mih anaumow Benjamin kowi dawiah hanow kar khai, now Benjamin paw aia kowi dawiah hanow kar khai. <verse eid="GEN 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 45:15" />Nami kung kowi ataimowuüa bowkbowk kowi paw Josef dawiah now namah khai, now kowbüah kowi paw karah khai. Nami hownia now atainau-uüa dow aia hown taklang khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 45:16" />Josef kowh tainau-uüa uang pe pami satang Faraw kim kowi kowting khai. Nami satang tata hanow Faraw hai aia kowh maru iukuüa paw lainowmma awmrawm khai. <verse eid="GEN 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 45:17" />Faraw tek pe Josef mih, “En kowh tainau-uüa kowi kowtek pe diah, amatni dow kawrngaramchük luk kowi tangla chakkham now Kanan pren kowi pacham mang lah. <verse eid="GEN 45:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 45:18" />Now amatni kowh pa hai amatni kowh kimchakuüa kowi pawla now en tut-e pauang lah. Aigupta pren kowi kowh lang iung mih süng en napeah kown mih hai mami pren kowi kowh chakkham lang iung mih amatni naka cha kown mih tek pe diah. <verse eid="GEN 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 45:19" />Nami klen kowi mami ana paw ang pe en khowk. En tainau-uüa kowi kowtek pe diah, amatni kowh masi hai ngeuüa sowmlowmchow miuüa kowi nauang pawla kownkow Aigupta pren hownia pacham pawla chia kari büah lah. Now amatni kowh pa kowi paw pauang pawla lah. <verse eid="GEN 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 45:20" />Amatni dow amatni kowh dawngthawnguan kowi hangkow pacham ngan lah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Aigupta pren kowi kowh aiung aiungma mih uanh maten dow amatni kowh chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 45:21" />Now Israel kowh chapauüa dow naiawng chang khai bowt. Faraw kowh ana pek iawng Josef mih atainau-uüa kowi chia kari hai tiama rawng kowi kowh chakkham krawi kamrüt pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 45:22" />Josef mih ataimowuüa kowi krawi peah khupdip tawngklai aükchi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw anaumow Benjamin kowi dow khupdip tawngklai tanga ük hai tai 300 iun krawi peah khai. <verse eid="GEN 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 45:23" />Now a-pa vüi kawrngaramchükla hamüt pum hai kawrngaramchükma hamüt pum Josef krawi sa pe khai. Nami hamüt pum mih kawrngaramchükla luk kowi dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh aiung aiungma mih uanh krawi tang pe khai. Now hamüt pum mih kawrngaramchükma luk kowi dow cha hai kawm hown akeng mih chakkham krawi tang pe khai. Naiawngün dow a-pa uang tarü mih khin khe kowh tiama rawng kowi nacha nakhamah kown mih chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 45:24" />Naiawngün uanh maten krawi kamrüt pe hanow atainau-uüa kowi Josef chinta khai bowt. Atainau-uüa mang mih khin khe aia krawi tek pe mih, “Tiama rawng kowi hangkow tapring tanang büah ba,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 45:25" />Now Josef kowh tainau-uüa dow Aigupta pren hownia mang hanow Kanan pren kowi amatni kowh pa Jakawb tut-e kowtowm khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 45:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 45:26" />A-pa kowi kowtek pe büah mih, “Kawmat paw Josef sing uowi reng tak. Aia dow Aigupta pren paprenma kowi kowh kruitown miia chekhai,” pape khai. Nami tata hanow Jakawb dow owm dowi rakowi amawlawma own khai.<verse eid="GEN 45:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 45:27" />Nachenganchepaw kowbüah kowi Josef krawi tek pe mih maten ta hai aia pawk müa chia kari Josef krawi sa pe mih khita hanow aia dow awmrawm kowh sak thowr khai. <verse eid="GEN 45:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 45:28" />Now Jakawb tek mih, “Na khowk, ang owm enni khowk. Ang chapa Josef sing uowi reng tak now na towbowt. Kowng dowi rawn aia kowi ang kowmüla akat tak,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 45:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="GEN 46" />
  <para style="s">Kanan pren hownia Aigupta pren kowi kowpowt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 46:1" />Naiawng rakowi Israel dow aia kowh uowi mih maten pawla hanow Aigupta pren prakowi tarü khai bowt. Aia dow Ber-Seba kowi uang ting mih khin khe a-pa Isak kowh Thurai vüi changla phuchua pawi khai. <verse eid="GEN 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 46:2" />Nami iak khe Thurai mih mukmang kowi Israel hown uang taklang khai. Thurai hawah mih, “Jakawb, Jakawb,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 46:2">Jakawb klangah mih, “Mami re-e chaw ang uowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 46:3" />Thurai tek pe mih, “Ang dow Thurai, en pa kowh Thurai chekhai. Aigupta pren kowi nakowkowi kown mih hangkow kram diah; tawngplawng kowchow panow nakowi mih chenchap aiukma ang nathawp en kown. <verse eid="GEN 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 46:4" />Aigupta pren kowi ang natawi uowila en kown, now en kowh krungchakuüa kowi Kanan pren kowi ang nauang plan pawla ngengche kown. Now en kowng khe dow Josef natawi uowila en kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 46:5" />Nahanow Jakawb dow Ber-Seba hownia Aigupta pren prakowi tarü khai bowt. Israel kowh chapauüa dow amatni kowh pa, amatni kowh chauüa hai amatni kowh masi kowi chia kari hown pawla khai. Naiawngün chia kari dow amatni pawk müa Faraw uang krawi sa pe mih chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 46:6" />Kanan pren kowi kowh amatni kramah mih tawncher hai dawngthawnguan maten pawla hanow Jakawb hai amatni kimchakuüa dow Aigupta pren kowi kowpowt khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 46:7" />Jakawb dow aia kowh chauüa hai aia kowh chu-uüa, aia kowh krungchakuüa maten kowi pawla now Aigupta pren kowi kowkowi khai.<verse eid="GEN 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aigupta pren kowi kowkowi mih Jakawb kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 46:8" />Mami dow Aigupta pren kowi kowpowt mih Jakawb hai aia kowh krungchakuüa lawnguan chekhai. Jakawb kowh chapa ta dow Reuben chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 46:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 46:9" />Reuben kowh chapauüa dow Hanawk, Pallu, Hezrawn hai Karmi büah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 46:10" />Simiawn kowh chapauüa dow Jemuel, Jamin, Awhad, Jakin, Zohar hai Sawl büah chekhai. Sawl kowh u dow Kanan prenchak masiuüa chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 46:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 46:11" />Levi kowh chapauüa dow Gersawn, Kohat hai Merari büah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 46:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 46:12" />Juda kowh chapauüa dow Er, Awnan, Sela, Perez hai Zera büah chekhai. Er hai Awnan iüah dow Kanan pren kowi kowng khai bowt. Perez kowh chapauüa dow Hezrawn hai Hamul iüah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 46:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 46:13" />Isakar kowh chapauüa dow Tola, Puva, Jawb hai Simrawn büah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 46:14" />Zebulun kowh chapauüa dow Sered, Elawn hai Jalel büah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 46:15" />Naiawngünuüa dow Padan-aram kowi Leah hown kowh Jakawb kaah mih krungchak chekhai. Amatchi kowh dow Dina pape mih chama paw uowi lowk ia. Dina hailawm Jakawb kowh naiawngün krungchakuüa dow süngkawm laisum ia chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 46:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 46:16" />Gad kowh chapauüa dow Zifawn, Hagi, Suni, Ezbawn, Eri, Arodi hai Areli büah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 46:17" />Aser kowh chapauüa dow Imna, Isva, Isvi hai Beri büah chekhai, now amatni kowh tuamow dow Sera chekhai. Beri kowh chapa dow Heber hai Malkiel iüah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 46:18" />Naiawngünuüa dow Zilpa hown kowh Jakawb kaah mih krungchak chekhai. Zilpa dow Leah kowi kowh a-pa Laban krawi peah mih narma chekhai. Zilpa hown kowh Jakawb kaah mih krungchakuüa dow laitaruk ia chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 46:19" />Rahel hown kowh Jakawb kaah mih chapa dow Josef hai Benjamin iüah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 46:20" />Aigupta pren kowi kowh Josef kaah mih chapa dow Manase hai Efraim iüah chekhai. Amatchi kowh u dow Pawtifera kowh chama Asenat chekhai. Pawtifera dow Awn marow kowi kowh uamow chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 46:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 46:21" />Benjamin kowh chapauüa dow Bela, Beker, Asbel, Gera, Naman, Ehi, Raws, Mapim, Hapim hai Ard büah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 46:22" />Naiawngün laitali ia miuüa dow Rahel hown kowh Jakawb kaah mih krungchak chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 46:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 46:23" />Dan kowh chapa dow Husim chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 46:24" />Naptali kowh chapauüa dow Jazel, Guni, Jezer hai Silem büah chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 46:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 46:25" />Naiawngünuüa dow Bilha hown kowh Jakawb kaah mih krungchak chekhai. Bilha dow Rahel kowi kowh a-pa Laban krawi peah mih narma chekhai. Naiawngün Bilha hown kowh Jakawb kaah mih krungchakuüa dow ranit ia chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 46:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 46:26" />Aigupta pren kowi Jakawb hown kowh tawi mih aia kowh krungchakuüa dow 66 ia chekhai. Naiawngün pungmadawng kowi aia kowh iaumowuüa kowi dow klowkla dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 46:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 46:27" />Josef kowh dow Aigupta pren kowi dia mih chapa uowi pre ia. Naiawngün hailawm Aigupta pren kowi kowpowt mih Jakawb kimchakuüa dow 70 ia chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 46:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aigupta pren kowi kowh Gawsen kowi Jakawb kimchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 46:28" />Jakawb dow Gawsen süng prakowi mangla kown mih tiama nakowrik lünta kownkow Josef tut-e Juda kowi kowrik chinah khai. Nahanow amatni bowkbowk Gawsen süng kowi kowtowm khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 46:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 46:29" />Now Josef mih a-pa Israel hown nauang takrum kownkow aia kowh kawrnga kari kamrütla now Gawsen süng kowi uang tarü khai. Aia dow a-pa kowi khita hanow uang dawiah khai, now akrama kar khai. <verse eid="GEN 46:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 46:30" />Nakhowk khe a-pa Israel tek pe Josef mih, “Kawmat paw en sing uowi reng tak pami ang matia mik hown ang khi khowk. Naiawng rakowi kawmat ang kowng chepaw iung towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 46:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 46:31" />Now atainau-uüa hai a-pa kimchak maru-uüa kowi Josef tek pe mih, “Faraw tut-e kowkowiah now maiawng ang nakowtek pe kown, ‘Ang tainau-uüa hai apa krungchak maru-uüa mih Kanan pren hownia ang tut-e uang khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 46:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 46:32" />Amatni dow tawncher thing mih chekhai; amatni dow rua hai ruapur thing mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow amatni kowh rua, ruapur, chia hai dawngthawnguan maten uang pawla büah khai,’ ang napape kown. <verse eid="GEN 46:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 46:33" />Naiawng rakowi Faraw nahaw enni now, ‘Tawng lup chow enni chang?’ padow nalünta enni kown. <verse eid="GEN 46:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="GEN 46:34" />Nami khin khe maiawng enni natek pe kown, ‘Mami en kowh naruüa hai anging kowh pipu-uüa dow asowmchow hownia kawmat mowr thing tawncher reng mih maru chekhai,’ pape diah. Nahanow Faraw mih makowi nape uowi enni kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow tawncher thing miuüa kowi dow Aigupta maru-uüa suiah reng chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 46:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="GEN 47" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="GEN 47:1-2" />Now Josef mih ataimowuüa kowi pawla tanga ia hanow Faraw tut-e nakowtalawp kownkow kowkowi khai. Aia dow ataimowuüa kowi Faraw hown pe rik tatukah khai. Faraw kowi Josef tek pe mih, “Apa hai ang tainau-uüa mih amatni kowh rua, ruapur, chia hai amatni kowh uowi mih maten uang pawla now Kanan pren hownia uang powt khai bowt. Amatni dow kawmat Gawsen süng kowi uowi büah khai,” pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 47:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 47:3" />Josef tainau-uüa kowi Faraw lüntaah mih, “Tawng lup chow enni chang?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:3">Amatni tek pe mih, “Chakramang, mami en kowh naruüa anging dow tawncher thing mih chekhai. Anging kowh pipu-uüa paw tawncher thing mih chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 47:4" />Mami pren kowi nauang uowi tak kownkow anging uang mih chekhai. Kanan pren kowi khown kuak mih dow arawn amatma, now nakowi nathingla tawncher kown mih pram khowm uowi dowi bowt. Naiawng rakowi sakrauma hown Gawsen süng kowi pe uowi anging diah,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="GEN 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 47:5" />Now Josef kowi Faraw tek pe mih, “En pa hai en tainau-uüa en tut-e uang mih chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 47:6" />Aigupta pren paprenma dow en pur kowi uowi hüah khowk. Mami pren kowi kowh lang iung mih arah kowi en pa hai en tainau-uüa kowi pe uowiah diah. Amatni dow Gawsen süng kowi pacham uowila towbowt. Now amatni pungmadawng kowi tawncher thing atukma mih maru en khi hanow naiawngünuüa kowi dow ang kowh tawncher nathing kown mih kurdik peah diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 47:7" />Nami kung kowi dow Josef mih a-pa Jakawb kowi uang pawla now Faraw hown uang pe takrumah khai. Now Jakawb mih Faraw kowi peah prasi khai. <verse eid="GEN 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 47:8" />Now Jakawb kowi Faraw lüntaah mih, “Mün ning khowk chow en?” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 47:9" />Jakawb tek pe mih, “Mami lusa kowi khari kowi mih iawng hai ang uang uowi mih dow 130 ning khowk. Nami khin townchow mih ning kowi akrat pusara ahuma ang krumla khai. Ang kowh pipu-uüa singla khowt khowm padow ang tawi ia singla dowi tham,” pape khai. <verse eid="GEN 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 47:10" />Nami kung kowi dow Jakawb mih Faraw kowi plan peah prasi hanow nami hownia lawt khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 47:11" />Now Josef dow a-pa hai atainau-uüa kowh uowi rah kamrüt pe khai. Aia dow Faraw ana pek iawng Aigupta pren kowi kowh lang iung mih arah Gawsen süng mih amatni kowi dawngthawnguan iawng peah khai. (Akung kowi nami arah ming dow Rameses chekhai). <verse eid="GEN 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 47:12" />Josef dow a-pa, atainau-uüa hai amatni kowh kimchakuüa kowi thumah khai. Aia dow amatni kowh kimchak maru iun uowi iawng pe pe chakkham khai.<verse eid="GEN 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Khown kuak khe kowh Josef prengia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 47:13" />Nami khown dow arawn amatma uang own ngamlam khai. Naiawng rakowi paprenma kowi kowh chakkham mih khowk bowk khowk chekhai. Nami khown rakowi Aigupta pren hai Kanan prenchakuüa mih lainowmma hawm khawr bowm khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 47:14" />Aigupta hai Kanan prenchakuüa uang ran chakkham khe kowh tangka dow Josef krawi kuala bowk now Faraw kim kowi kowpawla khai. <verse eid="GEN 47:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 47:15" />Now Aigupta hai Kanan prenchak maru-uüa kowh dow tangka khowk bowk khowk. Nakhowk khe Aigupta prenchakuüa dow Josef tut-e uangah now tek pe mih, “Sakrauma hown pe anging chakkham diah! En pe anging chakkham dowi now anging kowng kown towbowt! Anging kowh tangka pawisa uowi mih srui khowk bowk khowk,” pabüa khai.<verse eid="GEN 47:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 47:16" />Josef tek pe mih, “Enni kowh tangka khowk bowk khowk now enni kowh chia hai ruapur uowi mih maten uang pe ang büa diah. Nami takcha kowi ang pe enni chakkham sow,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 47:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 47:17" />Nahanow amatni dow amatni kowh tawncher uowi mih maten Josef tut-e uang pawla büah khai. Now Josef dow amatni kowh rua, ruapur, chia, kawrnga hai kawrngaramchük takcha kowi peah chakkham khai. Tawncher uowi mih maten hawt paw pe hanow nami paning dow Josef mih amatni kowi peah chakkham khai. <verse eid="GEN 47:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 47:18" />Nami ning rawn kowh auai ning khe paw amatni dow Josef tut-e uang plan uang khai. Now tek pe Josef mih, “Chakramang, tawngpaw anging it en dowi tham. Anging kowh tangka pawisa khowk bowk khowk, now anging kowh tawncher ün paw en kowh kangowh towbowt. Kawmat dow anging kowh buk hai anging kowh krawng bawn klen kowi nape en kown mih tawngpaw uowi dowi bowt. <verse eid="GEN 47:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 47:19" />Tawngplawng kowchow laih hailawm en pur kowi anging nakowng kown chow? Naiawng rakowi anging hailawm anging kowh laih mih en ranta anging bowk diah, nami takcha kowi pe anging chakkham diah. Faraw tut-e mih anging hai anging kowh laih hailawm anging natawi uowi nar kown towbowt. Now kowng dowi kowi asak nasingla reng kownkow aliu paw pe anging ne diah. Nahanow anging kowh laih paw napiak kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 47:20" />Nahanow Josef mih Aigupta pren kowi kowh laih maten Faraw vüi krawi ranta bowk khai. Nami khown kuak mih dow arawn amatma uang hu ngamlam rakowi Aigupta prenchakuüa mih amatni kowh krawng bawn sumta büah bowk khai. Naiawng hai Aigupta pren kowi kowh krawng bawn maten dow Faraw kowh krawng bawn uang chowng bowk khai. <verse eid="GEN 47:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 47:21" />Naiawng hai Josef dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh uowi mih maru maten kowi changla Faraw nar khai. <verse eid="GEN 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 47:22" />Nachenganchepaw uamowuüa kowh laih dow Josef ranla dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow uamowuüa dow Faraw tut-e ka maina reng chekhai. Now amatni dow nami tangka hown ranla chakkham büah reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowh laih dow sum takla büah dowi. <verse eid="GEN 47:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 47:23" />Maru-uüa kowi Josef tek pe mih, “Sünta büa diah, enni hai enni kowh krawng bawn hailawm ani dow Faraw vüi ang ranta khowk. Naiawng rakowi kawmat mami aliu pawla now laih kowi kowsawt büa diah. <verse eid="GEN 47:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 47:24" />Now enni ki ngen kung kowi kowh enni kaah mih luprak maten hownia tanga bak kowi pabak mih Faraw kowi enni napeah kown. Now tali bak mih dow aliu vüi ün, enni matia chak müa hai enni matia kimchakuüa chak müa ün enni natowah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 47:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 47:25" />Nakhowk khe maru-uüa tek pe Josef mih, “Chakramang, en lawng anging khai. Naiawng rakowi Faraw kowh nar anging hing tawi uowi kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 47:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 47:26" />Nahanow Josef mih Aigupta pren kowi kowh krawng bawn lawnguan kowi thawp ari lowk chekhai. Nami dow luprak maten hownia tanga bak kowi pabak mih Faraw kowi napeah kown mih chekhai. Nami ari dow kawmat pat paw Aigupta prenchakuüa chün reng tak chekhai. Faraw kowh dawngthawnguan kowi tawi taphang dowi mih dow uamowuüa kowh laih ngetchow towbowt chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 47:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josef tut-e Jakawb mala lai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 47:27" />Israeluüa dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh Gawsen süng kowi uowi büah khai. Nakowi dow amatni kowh dawngthawnguan ün uowi khai bowt. Amatni dow ka chu ka chah hanow ahuma uang prung büah khai bowt. <verse eid="GEN 47:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 47:28" />Israel dow Aigupta pren kowi singla 17 ning tak. Aia dow 147 ning mowr singla khai. <verse eid="GEN 47:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 47:29" />Israel dow aia kowng dowi rawn achapa Josef kowi hawah now tek pe mih, “En che sakrau ang khai nowm hanow ang thung krüa kowi uang haitow rut now takham diah. Now ang tek en iawng chang diah; ang kowng mih khin khe Aigupta pren kowi hauang dup ang diah. <verse eid="GEN 47:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 47:30" />Ang dow ang pipu-uüa tadupra kowi tawi tadup kown ang nau. Naiawng rakowi ang kowh uak mih Aigupta pren hownia kawtla hanow ang pipu-uüa tadupra kowi kowdup ang diah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 47:30">Now Josef tek pe mih, “En tek iawng ang chang en kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 47:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 47:31" />Nakhowk khe Israel tek pe mih, “Ang tut-e kham sawi diah,” pakhai. Now Josef dow a-pa tut-e kham sawi khai. Nahanow Israel dow aia phangbek iüaluk prakowi iu mum hanow Thurai kowi chupah khai.<verse eid="GEN 47:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="GEN 48" />
  <para style="s1">Manase hai Efraim iüah kowi Jakawb peah prasi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 48:1" />Nami pre sum ni kung kowi dow Josef mih a-pa Jakawb arau uowi pami satang ta khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow achapa Manase hai Efraim iüah pre ia kowi pawla now nakowmü a-pa kownkow kowkowi khai. <verse eid="GEN 48:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 48:2" />Josef kowtowm mih khin khe Jakawb kowi maru kowtek pe mih, “En chapa Josef uang mü en kownkow uang khowk,” pakhai. Nami tata hanow Jakawb dow aia kowh kür uowi mih maten hown phangbek kowi awr chowm khai. <verse eid="GEN 48:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 48:3" />Now Jakawb tek pe Josef mih, “Lowra nowngia chang mih Thurai dow Kanan pren kowi kowh Luz marow kowi ang tut-e uang tatüng hanow pe ang prasi khai. <verse eid="GEN 48:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 48:4" />Thurai tek ang mih, ‘En kowi mih chauüa akawmma ang nape en kown. Naiawng rakowi en kowh krungchakuüa hownia chenchap ahuma nauang uowi kown. En kung kowi kowh nauang ta uowi kown mih en kowh krungchakuüa kowi dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi nachangla dawngthawnguan kownkow mami pren ang napeah kown,’ pakhai. <verse eid="GEN 48:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 48:5" />En tut-e ang uang dowi rawn khe kowh Aigupta pren kowi en kaah mih en kowh chapa pre ia dow ang kowh chapa padow nadowkah kown. Reuben hai Simiawn iüah iawng Efraim hai Manase iüah paw ang kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 48:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 48:6" />Nachenganchepaw kowiüah kung kowi kowh uang ta dia mih chauüa maten kowi dow en kowh chauüa padow nadowkah kown. Naiawngünuüa dow ang kowh dawngthawnguan natawi ka powng kown nadowi. Tawkchedow amatni kowh taimow Efraim hai Manase iüah kowh dawngthawnguan bak hownia natawi ka powng büah kown taih. <verse eid="GEN 48:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 48:7" />Naiawng ang chang mih dow en u Rahel rakowi chekhai. Aia dow Padan-aram hownia ang uang lawt mih khin khe Kanan pren kowi kowh Efrat marow tiama rawng kowi kowng khai. Naiawng rakowi lainowmma ang sak nga khai. Aia kowi dow Efrat tia keng kowi ang dupla khai,” pakhai. Efrat dow Bethlehem pami chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 48:8" />Nami kung kowi Josef kowh chapa pre ia prakowi haimü hanow Josef kowi Jakawb lüntaah mih, “Kowiüah dow mia chow?” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 48:9" />Josef tek pe a-pa mih, “Kowiüah dow ang kowh chapa chowbowt. Kowiüah kowi mami pren kowi Thurai pe ang mih chowbowt,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 48:9">Jakawb tek pe mih, “Kowiüah kowi ang tut-e uang pawla diah. Kowiüah kowi ang peah prasi tak,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 48:10" />Jakawb mih lawngtang lai bowt rakowi khi mik kaneu dowi bowt. Naiawng rakowi Josef mih achapa pre ia kowi a-pa tut-e kowpawla pe khai. Nahanow Jakawb mih amatchi kowi hawt dawiah now namah khai. <verse eid="GEN 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 48:11" />Now Jakawb tek pe Josef mih, “En kowi ang plan khi iawk kown mih mapaw ang ming dowi bowt chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw Thurai dow en kowi krowngchow nadowi kowi en kowh chapa pre ia kowi paw pe khila ang khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 48:12" />Nakhowk khe Josef dow a-pa thung hownia achapa pre ia kowi pawta now krawng kowi tabawk krawm se a-pa kowi chupah khai. <verse eid="GEN 48:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 48:13" />Nami kung kowi dow Josef mih achapa pre ia kowi a-pa Jakawb tut-e uang plan pawla pe khai iawk. Josef dow Efraim kowi hawmlawm rut hown dowkah now Israel lakuai prakowi towah khai, now Manase kowi dow lakuai rut hown dowkah now Israel hawmlawm prakowi towah khai. <verse eid="GEN 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 48:14" />Nachenganchepaw Jakawb dow aia kowh bawng kingkaiah now Josef kowh chapa sawi mih Efraim lu kowi aia kowh hawmlawm rut tang pe khai, now aia kowh lakuai rut dow Josef kowh chapa ta mih Manase lu kowi tang pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 48:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 48:15" />Nakhowk khe Josef hai Josef chapauüa kowi Jakawb peah prasi mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:15">“Ang kowh pipu Abraham hai Isak iüah dow Thurai hown taklawp taiua reng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:15">nami Thurai dow ang chownglawng kowi auown hownia kawmat mowr pat mingkhet ang reng chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 48:16" />Thurai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">48:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Thurai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami Hebrai Baibul kowi dow Kramamu pahai arui uowi.</char></note> dow angak maten hownia uang lawng ang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 48:16">aia dow kowiüah kowi pacham peah prasi lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">Kowiüah hownia dow ang hai Abraham hown Isak kowh ming pacham ka tuak reng lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 48:16">Palusama kowi kowiüah kowh krungchakuüa mih aiun akawmma pacham prung lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 48:17" />Tawkchedow Efraim lu kowi a-pa tang pe hawmlawm rut mih khita hanow Josef mih sak-ih dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi a-pa kowh rut Efraim lu hownia pawta pe hanow Manase lu kowi Josef tang pe kownkow krowngta pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 48:18" />Josef tek pe a-pa mih, “Apa, naiawng nadowi. Ang kowh chapa ta dow mami chekhai, en kowh hawmlawm rut aia lu kowi tang pe diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 48:19" />Nachenganchepaw a-pa dow nauta pe dowi kowh tek pe mih, “Ang tuk chow le pa, ang tuk chow. Aia paw akri akraingma naphaw kown taih, now aia kowh krungchak maru-uüa hownia mih chenchap nauang phaw lowk kown. Nachenganchepaw aia kowh naumow mih aia lak-e nalang kri kraing kown, now aia krungchak maru-uüa hownia mih chenchap ahuma nauang phaw kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="GEN 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 48:20" />Naiawng rakowi Israel dow nami ni khe amatchi kowi peah prasi mih, “Israeluüa tape prasi mih khin khe enchi ming rükla se natek kown mih, ‘Thurai dow Efraim hai Manase iüah kowi iawng pacham chang en lah,’ napa kown,” pape khai. Naiawng hai Jakawb dow Manase kowi lak-e Efraim kowi lang peah iukra khai.<verse eid="GEN 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 48:21" />Nami kung kowi Israel tek pe Josef mih, “Sünta diah, ang kowh dow kowng khin uang na iawlaw khowk. Nachenganchepaw Thurai mih natawi uowila enni reng kown taih, aia dow enni pipu-uüa pren kowi naplan pawla enni iawk kown. <verse eid="GEN 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 48:22" />En tainau-uüa kowi lak-e ang lang pe en dawngthawnguan hu mih chowbowt. Sekem kowi kowh arah lang iung mih ang peta en mih chowbowt. Nami arah dow Amawruüa kowi saidawng hai salangba hown ang senah kowh ang awngah mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="GEN 49" />
  <para style="s1">Achapauüa kowi Jakawb peah prasi hai piati mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 49:1" />Nami kung kowi achapauüa kowi Jakawb hawah now tek pe mih, “Enni bowkbowk ang tut-e uang büa diah. Pur prakowi tawng iawng chow enni kowh chownglawng nata own kown mih ang natekla enni kown.<verse eid="GEN 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 49:2" />“Jakawb kowh chapauüa low, enni bowkbowk ang tut-e uang büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:2">enni kowh pa Israel tekla enni lai kown mih sünta büa diah.<verse eid="GEN 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 49:3" />“Reuben, en dow ang kowh chapa ta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">en dow ang kowh kür, ang rik kaah mih chah chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:3">en kowh dow ringkawra hai kürra en naumowuüa kowh lak-e lainowmma lang hu.<verse eid="GEN 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GEN 49:4" />Nachenganchepaw en dow nowng town sak dowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:4">ang changla masi mih narma hown en taphua taiua hanow en sürlawk ang mawk rah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:4">Naiawng rakowi en kowh chah ta rah dow nauowi kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="GEN 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GEN 49:5" />“Simiawn hown Levi iüah dow lup ngak prakowi auiua chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:5">amatchi dow nachangla angak kownkow dowk saidawng khai.<verse eid="GEN 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 49:6" />Amatchi dow kunmarau now sai maru sak reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">amatchi dow aiawnglowma krawi tüng chia uowntüng sa reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:6">Amatchi kowh sangkrangra ngak kowi dow ang tawi talük takak dowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:6">ang dow amatchi kowh thumchak nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 49:7" />Amatchi kowh kunmaraura kramra uowima mih dow pacham ka piati lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">Amatchi kowh kunma ngak dow pacham ka piati lah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:7">Amatchi kowh krungchakuüa kowi dow ang nasetta pe plawt kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">amatni dow Jakawb kowh akeng mih chauüa tut-e nacham krawi uowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:7">amatni kowi dow Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi ang nauetta plawt kown.<verse eid="GEN 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 49:8" />“Juda, en kowi dow en tainau-uüa nakiow en kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:8">en kowi dow en tainau-uüa nachup en kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:8">Tawngplawng kowchow panow ransu-uüa kowi en nowngta kown chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 49:9" />Ang chapa Juda, en dow krangsila powrchow iawng akürma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">cham makah mih chak en ki chala now en uowi rah kowi en uang plan khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:9">Krangsi iawng dow en mawk hanow en müi khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:9">amia iawng mih paw uam krüng en dowi chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 49:10" />Juda, en krungchak hownia dow mang nauang uowi reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">en krungchakuüa dow nakruitown pren kown;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:10">en kowi dow maru nauang pawla en awmrawm sung reng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:10">en kowh ana pek dow chenchapuüa maten nachün en reng kown.<verse eid="GEN 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 49:11" />Juda, grep ruih hu lai rakowi grep ruih kowi en nakhuowk kawrngaramchük kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">now grep ruih prek lang iung mih kowi kawrngaramchük chah en nakhuowk pe kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:11">Mün khowt chow grep tui hu kown mih dawnguan khowm padow en naia chu kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:11">en kowh tawnguat dow grep tui avima mih hown en nachuah kown.<verse eid="GEN 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 49:12" />Kham grep tui lai kowh en kowh mik dow grep tui lak-e nalang rik kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:12">kham iawn tui lai kowh en kowh iüng dow iawn tui lak-e nalang kaw kown.<verse eid="GEN 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 49:13" />“Zebulun dow sata pang kowi nauowi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:13">aia kowh uowi rah dow chawnlawng naira nachowng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:13">Aia kowh pren sünghi dow Sidawn marow mowr naiuk kown.<verse eid="GEN 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 49:14" />“Isakar dow akürma mih kawrngaramchük iawng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:14">Nachenganchepaw aia dow kurdik takra kowi mawk khai.<verse eid="GEN 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 49:15" />Aia dow aia kowh pren klangiung mih nakhi kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">now aia kowh tanaira sowr uowi mih natuk kown;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:15">naiawng rakowi nakur kurdik kownkow aia dow pangkawt towng natakla kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:15">aia dow nar iawng akratma mih lup chang natakla kown.<verse eid="GEN 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 49:16" />“Dan paw Israel chen kowi kowh akeng miuüa iawng</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:16">aia maru-uüa kowh tara chet mih nachowng kown.<verse eid="GEN 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 49:17" />Aia dow ransu-uüa tut-e tiama ria kowi kowh rua iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">tia keng kowi kowh akru uowima mih rua iawng naown kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:17">Aia dow nachawt kawrnga klowng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:17">now kawrnga chowm mih dow kung prakowi nadowh kown.<verse eid="GEN 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 49:18" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG, en nauang lawng ang kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:18">en nauang lawng kown mih kowi ang hawt chawng reng chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 49:19" />“Gad kowi dow maru nauang thowkah hia kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:19">Nachenganchepaw nami hia kowi aia nahawt krawiah kown.<verse eid="GEN 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 49:20" />“Aser kowh süng kowi dow lainowmma luprak naphaw kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:20">aia dow mang kowi achak iungma mih chakkham napeah kown.<verse eid="GEN 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 49:21" />“Naptali dow thaulangma mih naki iia iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:21">aia kowh chauüa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Chauüa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami Hebrai Baibul kowi chim dowi rakowi akeng Baibul kowi alangma kangowh maru paw towla khai.</char></note> dow klangiungma kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 49:22" />“Josef krungchak dow lainowmma naprung kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:22">aia dow tui ria kowi kowh auih achakma mih singh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">49:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Singh </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami Hebrai Baibul kowi chim marai dowi rakowi akeng miuüa paw alangma kangowh towla khai.</char></note> iawng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:22">aia dow amia klang rengreng mih singh iawng chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 49:23" />Salangba ap miuüa dow aia kowi lainowmma senah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:23">
    <char style="w">leba</char> sek hown ap-ah rakowi aia dow lainowmma ngare khai.<verse eid="GEN 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 49:24" />Nachenganchepaw Jakawb kowh akürma mih Thurai rut dow Josef tut-e uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">Israeluüa kowh Singku Huamang hai mingkhet miia dow aia tut-e tawi uowi reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:24">Naiawng rakowi aia kowh salangba dow achükma uowi reng,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:24">aia kowh rut paw akhawtma uowi reng chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 49:25" />Ang kowh Thurai dow nakhowng en kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">Lowra nowngia chang mih Thurai dow nape en prasi reng kown;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">aia dow kuang hownia nape en uang tui kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">krawng dak hownia paw nape en krawng dawng tui reng kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:25">Masiuüa hai tawncherma kowi paw ahuma nape kaah chah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">now amatni buk kowi iawn tui paw nape uowiah reng kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:25">aia dow naiawng hai nape en prasi kown.<verse eid="GEN 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 49:26" />Ang pe en mih prasira dow pipu-uüa kaah mih lak-e lang hu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">Nami dow alai chowng khe kowh hungh hownia kaah mih luprak la rak lak-e lang hu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GEN 49:26">Nami prasira dow Josef pacham ka lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:26">aia dow atainau-uüa lak-e lang iuk mih chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 49:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GEN 49:27" />“Benjamin dow arangpranma mih sui iawng;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:27">rau-e dow nakrawi sai ransu kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GEN 49:27">now iak pra dow cham rupla mih uanh naret kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 49:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GEN 49:28" />Maiawngünuüa dow Israel kowh laipre chen maru chekhai. Maiawngün lai dow amatni kowi amatni kowh pa peah prasi khe kowh tek pe mih chekhai. Naiawng hai amatni kowh pa dow amatni bowkbowk kowi pela prasi khai.<verse eid="GEN 49:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jakawb kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="GEN 49:29" />Akung kowi achapauüa kowi Jakawb peah ana mih, “Ang kowh dow pipu-uüa tut-e mang kown mih khin uang na iawlaw khowk. Naiawng rakowi ang kowi paw ang pipu-uüa kowi kowh towah mih puk kowi kowtow ang diah. Nami puk dow Hit chenchap Efrawn kowh laih le kowi chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 49:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GEN 49:30" />Nami puk dow Kanan pren kowi kowh Mamre marow re-e kowh Makpela pami arah dakchow kowi chekhai. Nami puk dow nachangla chengrawng kownkow Hit chenchap Efrawn hownia laih hailawm apu Abraham ranah mih chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 49:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GEN 49:31" />A-pu Abraham hai a-pi Sari iüah kowi mih nakowi dupah khai. Now a-pa Isak hai a-u Rebeka iüah kowi paw nakowi dupah khai. Now Leah kowi paw nakowi ang dupla khai. <verse eid="GEN 49:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="GEN 49:32" />Nami laih dow puk hailawm Hituüa tut-e kowh ranah mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 49:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="GEN 49:33" />Jakawb mih achapauüa kowi ki pela ana kung kowi dow awr mawk khai bowt. Nami kung kowi dow aia kowh sak mih that khai bowt. Aia dow kowng hanow aia pipu-uüa tadupra kowi tawi tadup khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 49:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="GEN 50" />
  <para style="s">Kanan pren kowi kowdup Jakawb uak mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GEN 50:1" />Nakhowk khe Josef dow a-pa luk kowi iu tabawk hanow kar khai, now a-pa kowi namah khai. <verse eid="GEN 50:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GEN 50:2" />Nami kung kowi dow a-pa uak nasula dowi kown mih lup nachang kownkow aia nimkrüa kowi uowi mih daktawruüa kowi Josef peah ana khai. Nahanow daktawruüa dow Josef ana pek iawng chang pe khai. <verse eid="GEN 50:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GEN 50:3" />Uak sula dowi mih lup chang dow likawm ni lakke khai. Naiawng rakowi nami lup chang kowi dow likawm ni daktawruüa tating khai. Now Aigupta maru-uüa dow Israel vüi ranitkawm ni mowr uowila uiting uangtak mih pawi sun büah khai.<verse eid="GEN 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="GEN 50:4-5" />Now uowila uiting uangtak mih pawi ki sun kung kowi dow Faraw kim kowi kowh maru iukuüa kowi Josef tek pe mih, “Apa kowng dowi rawn khe pe kham ang sawi khai. Aia kowh uak mih Kanan pren kowi kowh aia kamrütla mih tadupra kowi nakowdup kownkow aia mala ang khai. Naiawng rakowi Kanan pren kowi ang nakowdup apa uak kownkow sakrauma hown Faraw pacham pe kowi ang lah. Ki dupla uak prowng now ang nauang plan iawk kown taih.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="GEN 50:4-5">“Naiawng rakowi enni che sak-ih ang khai hanow sakrauma hown Faraw tut-e mami laiklow kowtek pe büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 50:4-5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GEN 50:6" />Nami kung kowi Faraw uang krawi tek pe mih, “En pa pe kham en sawi iawng aia kowi kowdupah diah,” pape khai. <verse eid="GEN 50:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GEN 50:7" />Nahanow Josef dow nakowdup a-pa uak kownkow tarü khai bowt. Faraw kowh aluchow maten hai Aigupta pren kowi kowh ringkaw uowima mih maru maten Josef kung kowi tawi khai. <verse eid="GEN 50:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GEN 50:8" />Nami klen kowi Josef kowh kimchakuüa hai a-pa kowh kimchakuüa maten hai atainau-uüa paw aia kung kowi tawi khai. Gawsen kowi dow amatni kowh asowmchow mih ngeuüa hawmh hai amatni kowh tawncher hawmh ngetchow towbowt ta uowi khai. <verse eid="GEN 50:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GEN 50:9" />Amatni dow kawrnga kari hai kawrnga luk kowi kowh chowm miuüa hown athum iukma Josef kung tawi büah khai.<verse eid="GEN 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GEN 50:10" />Amatni dow Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi kowh Atad pami arah kowi kowtowm khai. Nakowi kowh laih kowi dow te uowi lowk chekhai. Nakhowk khe a-pa vüi uowila uiting uangtak mih pawi ranit ni mowr Josef sun khai. Now amatni bowkbowk dow atün atünma kar khai. <verse eid="GEN 50:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GEN 50:11" />Atad kowi kowh te kowi amatni uowila uiting uangtak mih khi hanow Kanan maru-uüa tatek mih, “Mami dow Aigupta prenchakuüa kowh aprüa aiiama mih uiting uangtak pawi chekhai,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Jawrdan aw paipra pown kowi kowh arah ming dow Abel-Mizraim pahai chap pe khai. (Abel-Mizraim pami dow “Aigupta prenchakuüa kowh aprüa aiiama mih uiting uangtak pawi” pami chekhai).<verse eid="GEN 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GEN 50:12" />Naiawng rakowi Israel kowh chapauüa dow a-pa tekla pe mih iawng ta chang büah khai. <verse eid="GEN 50:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GEN 50:13" />Amatni dow a-pa kowh uak Kanan pren kowi kowpawla khai, now Makpela kowi kowh puk kowi kowdupah khai. Nami puk dow Mamre marow kowi kowh Hit chenchap Efrawn kowh laih le kowi chekhai. Nami laih dow nachangla tadupra kownkow puk hailawm Efrawn tut-e kowh Abraham ranah mih chekhai. <verse eid="GEN 50:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GEN 50:14" />Now ki dupla a-pa uak kung kowi dow Josef hai atainau-uüa hai kowtawi dup Josef pa mih maru maten Aigupta pren kowi uang plan büah khai bowt.<verse eid="GEN 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Atainau-uüa kowi Josef peah sakkhawtra mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GEN 50:15" />Now amatni kowh pa kowng kung kowi dow Josef kowh tainau-uüa tatek mih, “Laiuan kowi, Josef sui a-i kowh a-i changah angak mih klai sat a-i e dow tawng chow i changah kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 50:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GEN 50:16" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Josef tut-e kowchin maru khai. Nami maru kowi krawi tek pe mih, “Apa kowng dowi rawn mami laiklow ta mala anging khai. <verse eid="GEN 50:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GEN 50:17" />Apa tek anging mih, ‘Josef kowi ta tek pe büa diah. Enni kowh atawi hai lup ngak maten pacham lawtta enni lah,’ pakhai. Anging dow en pa kowh Thurai naruüa chekhai. Naiawng rakowi sakrauma hown anging kowh angak lawtta anging diah,” pabüah khai. Josef dow atainau-uüa kowh laiklow tata hanow kar khai.<verse eid="GEN 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GEN 50:18" />Nami kung kowi dow atainau-uüa mih aia pur kowi uang tabawkah krawm now tek pe mih, “Anging dow en kowh nar chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GEN 50:19" />Nachenganchepaw Josef tek pe kowbüah mih, “Hangkow kram büa diah. Ang dow Thurai nadowi; angak ripra pek mih dow Thurai chowtaih. <verse eid="GEN 50:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GEN 50:20" />Enni dow nachang ang angak kownkow kamrüt mih chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw nami dow a-i iung müa Thurai kamrütah mih chekhai. Nami kamrütra dow maru akawmma naplaila kownkow chekhai, nami dow kawmat enni khi khowk. <verse eid="GEN 50:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GEN 50:21" />Naiawng rakowi hang kram büa diah. Enni hai enni kowh chauüa chakkham ang nape enni reng kown taih,” pape khai. Naiawng hai Josef dow atainau-uüa kowi sakowmra hai sakklamra lai tek pe khai.<verse eid="GEN 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Josef kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GEN 50:22" />Josef hai a-pa kimchakuüa mih Aigupta pren kowi akrama uowi büah khai. Josef dow 110 ning singla khai. <verse eid="GEN 50:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GEN 50:23" />Josef dow achapa Efraim kowh krungchak kowi sum kungh mowr khila khai. Nami klen kowi Makir kowh chauüa kowi paw ka khila khai. Makir dow Manase kowh chapa chekhai.<verse eid="GEN 50:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GEN 50:24" />Now akat khe Josef tek pe atainau-uüa mih, “Ang kowh dow kowng khin uang na iawlaw khowk. Nachenganchepaw Thurai dow nauang khowng enni ngengche kown taih. Aia dow mami pren hownia pawla enni hanow Abraham, Isak hai Jakawb büah kowi napeah kown pahai kham sawi se tekta khowk mih pren kowi napawla enni kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="GEN 50:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GEN 50:25" />Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa kowi pe takhamah sawi se Josef tek pe mih, “Thurai dow nauang khowng enni ngengche kown taih. Mami pren hownia enni powt mih khin khe ang kowh hut maten pawla büa diah,” pape khai. <verse eid="GEN 50:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GEN 50:26" />Now Josef dow 110 ning chih khe kowng khai bowt. Aia kowh uak dow su dowi iawng daktawruüa changah hanow uak towk rah kowi phangah now Aigupta pren kowi towah büah khai.<verse eid="GEN 50:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GEN 50" />
</usx>